umn of text links followed by the\nquote button. The quote button opens the form on the project types with none\nselected (?mode=types). Review fixes: guarded hash decoding, scroll to nested\ntargets, app-only softwareRequirements, quote script CSP hash.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MYK1VWRrVBpo1Hvb3wQJnB","tree":{"sha":"4a5f568829c15e4d2e34a2329d8a29aadf7b6f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavival/wavival.dev/git/trees/4a5f568829c15e4d2e34a2329d8a29aadf7b6f3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavival/wavival.dev/git/commits/76553e2e66c9d42ca677a7a575350031bc06a6ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a5f568829c15e4d2e34a2329d8a29aadf7b6f3d\nparent 348647df42495d7109b362f1a0b4b7f5dcd1fde9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791229992 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791229992 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): cards link only the case study and quote form opens unselected\n\nCards and home rows show only the case study link. The external links of a\nproject live on its page as a single column of text links followed by the\nquote button. The quote button opens the form on the project types with none\nselected (?mode=types). Review fixes: guarded hash decoding, scroll to nested\ntargets, app-only softwareRequirements, quote script CSP hash.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MYK1VWRrVBpo1Hvb3wQJnB\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFYa9W+E\n88pN4h/tMUFcPqfNEaL42OVBJPnjP3M6iTmnFd+LDm51ZbOJnpVp+yn8mCM/Ft/KtjRHPrL4fNrT\nigs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T19:53:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clau