pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavival/wavival.dev/commits/348647df42495d7109b362f1a0b4b7f5dcd1fde9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:46:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:46:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui): group projects as ecosystems with parts\n\nReplace the nine flat projects with six ecosystems (TerraCore, OKroot,\nNullBreach, Lumina W, wavival.dev, Forgotten Portal). Each has one card and\none URL, split into parts (app, landing, docs, blog, repo, api) rendered as\naccordions or link rows, with hash deep links.\n\n- data model: Project and ProjectPart, helpers, per-project SEO and JSON-LD\n- merged slugs redirect with 301 to their project part anchor\n- official names, llms.txt and llms-full.txt, and the docs set updated\n- tests for the ecosystem behavior, data parity and redirects\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MYK1VWRrVBpo1Hvb3wQJnB","tree":{"sha":"ba83ffb60fef6d3693528e36d4a6623a1021a578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavival/wavival.dev/git/trees/ba83ffb60fef6d3693528e36d4a6623a1021a578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wavival/wavival.dev/git/commits/348647df42495d7109b362f1a0b4b7f5dcd1fde9","verification":{"payload":"tree ba83ffb60fef6d3693528e36d4a6623a1021a578\nparent 92b5f082c4c49f3fadddca42cdaa3419953bed45\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791229603 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791229603 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): group projects as ecosystems with parts\n\nReplace the nine flat projects with six ecosy