url":"https://github.com/pankajparkar","id":5320044,"login":"pankajparkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjAwNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pankajparkar/angular-mfe/commits/d824eceba43246dcc7a4f31797be4ba87deb382a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T21:00:59Z","email":"parkarpankaj3@gmail.com","name":"Pankaj Parkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T21:00:59Z","email":"parkarpankaj3@gmail.com","name":"Pankaj Parkar"},"message":"feat: add Phase 3 documentation for Shell Routing & Standalone Remotes\n\n- Introduced detailed documentation on shell routing using loadRemoteModule.\n- Explained how each remote operates independently as a standalone application.\n- Added code examples for routing configuration in the shell and remotes.\n- Documented the architecture and flow of shared cart state using Angular Signals.\n- Included steps to create a shared cart state library and integrate it across remotes.\n- Implemented CartBadge widget pattern for dynamic updates in the shell header.\n- Verified functionality through a checklist and demo talking points.\n\nfeat: implement shared cart state library using Angular Signals\n\n- Created a new library for shared cart state with signal-based state management.\n- Defined Product and CartItem interfaces for type safety.\n- Implemented functions to add, remove, and clear items from the cart.\n- Ensured the library is shared across all micro-frontends via module federation.\n\nfeat: add Cart and Checkout components with shared state integration\n\n- Developed Catalog, Cart, and Checkout components to utilize shared cart state.\n- Implemented product listing with \"Add to Cart\" functionality in the Catalog.\n- Created a Cart component to display items and handle removal and clearing.\n- Designed a Checkout component to summarize the order and handle payment.\n\nfeat: expose CartBadge widget from Cart remote for dynamic usage in Shell\n\n- Created a CartBadge component to display the number of items in the cart.\n- Exposed the CartBadge component in the Cart remote''s federation config.\n- Integrated the CartBadge widget into the Shell header using dynamic loading.\n\nchore: set up ESLint and project configuration for shared cart state library\n\n- Added ESLint configuration for the shared cart state library.\n- Configured project settings and TypeScript paths for the new library.\n- Established test setup and Vite configuration for the library.","tree":{"sha":"e979044ea5f568ab76a1f395e546295a0f3ed407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pankajparkar/angular-mfe/git/trees/e979044ea5f568ab76a1f395e546295a0f3ed407"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pankajparkar/angular-mfe/git/commits/d824eceba43246dcc7a4f31797be4ba87deb382a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5320044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pankajparkar","id":5320044,"login":"pankajparkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjAwNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pankajparkar/received_events",