tter":{"date":"2026-05-08T13:36:16Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(aula-05): add Docker, Terraform, K8s and GitHub Actions for deploy enterprise\n\n- Multi-stage Dockerfiles (node:20-alpine → nginx:alpine) for all 5 MFEs and backend\n- NGINX configs with immutable cache for hashed assets and no-store for index.html\n- Terraform: VPC, GKE Autopilot cluster, IAM service account, GCS backend\n- K8s manifests: Namespace, backend Deployment+Service, NGINX Ingress\n- Argo Rollouts: canary (shell, mfe-carrinho, mfe-notificacoes) and blue-green (mfe-produtos, mfe-checkout)\n- GitHub Actions workflows: ci-pr, infra-apply, deploy-production, infra-destroy","tree":{"sha":"774fe0b7f88470af700c2b5a4a6cc330c2572d6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/774fe0b7f88470af700c2b5a4a6cc330c2572d6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/dd6a632c203933e4ab578065fb6c9f8feebd55c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/dd6a632c203933e4ab578065fb6c9f8feebd55c8","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKGRkNmE2MzJjMjAzOTMzZTRhYjU3ODA2NWZiNmM5ZjhmZWViZDU1Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0","sha":"b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0"}],"sha":"dd6a632c203933e4ab578065fb6c9f8feebd55c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/dd6a632c203933e4ab578065fb6c9f8feebd55c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T23:14:51Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T23:14:51Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"refactor(frontend): unify @fiap/shared-ui + @fiap/shared-context -> @fiap/shared\n\nUma unica lib publicavel no futuro, organizada em 3 areas:\n  projects/shared/src/\n    ├── ui/       → design system (11 componentes, idem shared-ui)\n    ├── context/  → UserContextService, NotificationHubService,\n    │                NotificationsSocketService, HasGroupDirective,\n    │                API_BASE_URL token, provideStoreApollo\n    └── graphql/  → catalog/cart/notifications queries e tipos\n\ntsconfig paths:\n  \"@fiap/shared\" -> projects/shared/src/public-api.ts\n  (removidos @fiap/shared-ui e @fiap/shared-context)\n\nfederation.config.js: skip list deduplicada para ''@fiap/shared''.\n\nTodos os imports migrados em 5 apps + 1 lib:\n  import { UiButton, UserContextService, MY_CART, NotificationHubService } from ''@fiap/shared'';\n\nfeat(backend,didactic): GET /products REST endpoint\n\nExiste APENAS para a demo do V1 da Aula 3: comparar lado-a-lado o shape\ndo REST (dump completo sempre) com o GraphQL (cliente escolhe). Numeros\nmedidos no smoke test:\n\n  REST /products                     3035 bytes (sempre tudo)\n  GraphQL { listProducts { name } }   357 bytes (8.5x menor)\n  GraphQL pedindo tudo               2334 bytes\n  GraphQL cart->items->product->category: 1 round-trip (ilustra relacoes)\n\nEm producao o catalogo eh consumido via GraphQL; o REST aqui eh material\ndidatico para a comparacao.","tree":{"sha":"e7f9b69dc164705e50e14d4b30b6c3ef77486250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/e7f9b69dc164705e50e14d4b30b6c3ef77486250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKGIyMGRlNTMwZGYyZThkZWQ0MjFlZGQxMDE5NDIyNWZkNzRhMTYzZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef","sha":"3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef"}],"sha":"b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/b20de530df2e8ded421edd10194225fd74a163e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T23:07:45Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T23:07:45Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(ws): notificacoes em tempo real via socket.io separado do graphql\n\nDicotomia de protocolos consolidada:\n  REST    = /auth/*, /users/*    (identidade)\n  GraphQL = /graphql              (dominio: products/cart/orders)\n  WS      = /ws/notifications     (push real-time — notificacoes)\n\nBackend — NotificationsGateway (@nestjs/platform-socket.io):\n- afterInit(ns): registra io.use(middleware) que valida JWT no handshake\n  lendo o cookie httpOnly access_token. Rejeita com next(Error) → cliente\n  recebe connect_error e NAO conecta (auth antes do aceite)\n- handleConnection: socket entra em room user:<sub>, isolamento natural\n- emitToUser(userId, payload): server.to(`user:${userId}`).emit(''notification:new'', ...)\n- NotificationsService.publish agora usa o gateway; removido graphql-subscriptions\n- Resolver mantem apenas query myNotifications + mutation markAsRead\n  (leitura/mutacao do grafo continuam em GraphQL; push migra pro WS)\n\nFrontend — NotificationsSocketService (shared-context):\n- io(url, { withCredentials: true, transports: [''websocket'',''polling''],\n  reconnection: true, reconnectionDelay: 1000..10000 })\n- cookie httpOnly eh enviado automaticamente no handshake pelo browser\n- connect_error → toast warning (nao derruba UI)\n- notification:new → hub.push + hub.incrementUnread (badge do sino)\n- Sino chama socket.connect() no constructor; reconnect automatico cuida\n  do caso \"sem cookie ainda\" ate o login completar\n\nSocket.io-client adicionado como dependencia do frontend.\n\nMateria-prima didatica em pesquisa/pesquisa-websocket-socketio.md:\n- Como WS funciona (handshake + upgrade)\n- Por que 3 protocolos separados (tabela de uso)\n- Comparacao Socket.IO vs ws puro\n- Checklist completo de seguranca (middleware vs handleConnection,\n  cookie httpOnly, CORS+credentials, rooms por user, SameSite)\n- Comandos curl+node para reproduzir a aula\n\nSmoke test end-to-end validado no Playwright:\n- Login cliente → cookie httpOnly seteado\n- addToCart + checkout via GraphQL → backend publica no room user:<id>\n- socket.io do sino recebe notification:new em tempo real\n- Toast \"Pedido criado — R$ 99.00\" renderizado\n- Badge do sino atualiza para \"2\"","tree":{"sha":"f1b592700676f17632f484927aaa70ab446cadb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/f1b592700676f17632f484927aaa70ab446cadb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKDM5NjRkYTBjMDY4MWE4N2JkNDJjNTUwYWViYjU5YmIxNmVkNWZkZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22","sha":"fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22"}],"sha":"3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/3964da0c0681a87bd42c550aebb59bb16ed5fdef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:52:13Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:52:13Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(frontend): mfes consumindo dominio via graphql (produtos+carrinho+checkout)\n\nmfe-produtos:\n- Apollo watchQuery(listProducts) com fetch-policy cache-and-network\n- Subscription manual com DestroyRef (em vez de toSignal, que perdia\n  injection context quando o componente eh carregado via loadRemoteModule)\n- adicionar() dispara mutation addToCart + refetchQueries:[''MyCart'']\n  e emite CustomEvent fiap:cart:updated p/ o carrinho reagir\n- Simplificacao da UI: removidos rating/avaliacoes/tag (nao existem no\n  schema da API). Categoria virou badge no card\n\nmfe-carrinho:\n- Apollo watchQuery(myCart) populando o signal itens\n- Mutations updateCartItem (inc/dec) e removeFromCart com CSRF automatico\n  (pelo csrfLink no Apollo provider)\n- Listener fiap:cart:updated re-executa refetch\n\nmfe-checkout:\n- Apollo watchQuery(myCart) para o resumo\n- Mutation checkout dispara a criacao da Order no backend\n- Em sucesso mostra confirmacao com ID da order; em erro mostra mensagem\n  do GraphQL (extensions.code + message)\n\nshared-context:\n- Movido provideStoreApollo() para a lib (reutilizado por host + 4 MFEs)\n- Queries/mutations/tipos GraphQL em lib/graphql/{catalog,cart}.gql.ts\n\nFederation configs (host + 4 MFEs):\n- Skip list agora cobre @apollo/client/testing|react|ssr,\n  subscriptions-transport-ws, @graphql-tools/*, @jest/*, react/react-dom\n  e crossws (native-federation tentava resolver tudo com shareAll)\n- Phantom deps (react, react-dom, @graphql-tools/*, relay-runtime,\n  crossws) adicionadas como devDeps p/ satisfazer o resolver\n\nApollo version: downgrade para v3.13 (apollo-angular v8) pra evitar o\nacoplamento com react que v4 introduz.\n\nSmoke test end-to-end validado no Playwright:\n- Login cliente -> redirect home\n- 8 produtos carregando via listProducts na home\n- Click em \"Adicionar\" -> addToCart mutation -> cart:{totalCents:9900,\n  items:[{qty:1,product:{name:''Camiseta Native Federation''}}]}\n- document.cookie nao expoe access_token nem refresh_token (httpOnly)\n- CSRF propagando via csrfLink lendo do cookie","tree":{"sha":"44f25d95f4e4c07cf533ab4d63d098681c7fe026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/44f25d95f4e4c07cf533ab4d63d098681c7fe026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKGZhNGQwOTIwNDliYjYxNTliMGJjMDA4NjhiOGY2MjM3Y2E2N2ZhMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db","sha":"c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db"}],"sha":"fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/fa4d092049bb6159b0bc00868b8f6237ca67fa22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:35:23Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:35:23Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(frontend): shared-context lib + apollo + login/signup/logout (V2)\n\nLib @fiap/shared-context:\n- UserContextService com signal user/isAuthenticated/groups/loading\n- hydrate(): GET /users/me com credentials:include; 401 limpa o signal\n- setUser / clear para pos-login e pos-logout\n- hasAnyGroup(...groups): verifica se o user pertence a algum grupo\n- HasGroupDirective: diretiva estrutural *hasGroup (UX-only, backend\n  continua sendo quem valida — defense in depth)\n- API_BASE_URL InjectionToken (default http://localhost:3000)\n\nHost:\n- provideStoreApollo(): Apollo Client 4 com link chain csrfLink -> httpLink,\n  withCredentials: true (cookies httpOnly cross-origin)\n- AuthService: signup/login/logout contra a trilha REST, atualiza o\n  UserContextService em memoria\n- authGuard canMatch: hydrate lazy se ainda nao sabemos; redirect pra\n  /auth/login se 401\n- LoginPage + SignupPage com forms reativos simples\n- provideAppInitializer dispara hydrate() na subida do host\n- Rotas /auth/login e /auth/signup publicas; / e /checkout sob authGuard\n\nFederation:\n- @fiap/shared-context adicionado ao skip dos 5 federation.config.js\n  (padrao identico ao @fiap/shared-ui — resolvido via tsconfig paths,\n  nao via shared deps)\n\ntsconfig.json paths:\n- @fiap/shared-context -> projects/shared-context/src/public-api.ts\n\nSmoke test ponta-a-ponta validado com Playwright:\n- Acesso a / sem cookies -> 401 em /users/me -> redirect /auth/login\n- Login admin -> POST /auth/login 200 -> redirect /\n- document.cookie expõe APENAS csrf_token; access_token e refresh_token\n  sao httpOnly e INVISIVEIS ao JS (protecao XSS do V2)\n- GET /users/me autenticado -> 200 com {groups:[admin,cliente]}\n- GraphQL listProducts publico -> 8 produtos\n- GraphQL mutation sem CSRF header -> extensions.code FORBIDDEN\n- GraphQL mutation com CSRF lido do cookie -> passa do guard","tree":{"sha":"e670cac8102c88c61a65982a2224272c95fde75c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/e670cac8102c88c61a65982a2224272c95fde75c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKGMyYjQ1OTY2ZmEyZWZiOTFkZGY4MDQ3M2YyMTkxYmZiNjNjZWM4ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a","sha":"3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a"}],"sha":"c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/c2b45966fa2efb91ddf80473f2191bfb63cec8db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:27:10Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:27:10Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(common): global exception filter + trace id middleware\n\nPadroniza erros em REST e GraphQL num shape consistente consumivel pelo\nfrontend (AULA 3 V4: ErrorLink -> hub de notificacoes).\n\n- TraceIdMiddleware: usa X-Trace-Id do caller (propagacao distribuida) ou\n  gera UUID. Anexa req.traceId e ecoa no response header.\n- GlobalExceptionFilter (@Catch any): detecta host via getType() e trata\n  REST e GraphQL num unico filtro.\n  * REST: JSON { code, message, traceId, details? }\n  * GraphQL: GraphQLError com extensions { code, traceId, status }\n  * NODE_ENV=production sanitiza message 5xx e remove details\n  * Log 5xx inclui traceId + metodo + url + stack\n- Mapa HTTP_STATUS_TO_CODE centralizado em common/errors.ts\n- formatError do ApolloDriver remove stacktrace/originalError em prod\n- Endpoints __boom (REST) e { boom } (GraphQL) bloqueados em prod,\n  uteis em dev para testar o filtro ao vivo\n\nSmoke test validado:\n- /__boom -> 500 { code:INTERNAL, traceId } + log com trace\n- login senha errada -> 401 { code:UNAUTHORIZED }\n- signup senha curta -> 400 { code:BAD_REQUEST, details:[...] }\n- Trace-Id de cliente eh respeitado + ecoado no header e no log\n- Trace-Id gerado quando cliente nao manda\n- GraphQL { boom } -> extensions.code:INTERNAL, status:500, traceId\n- Cliente fazendo createProduct -> extensions.code:FORBIDDEN, status:403","tree":{"sha":"453c20fdb59fa8b7257c33aed6cbd2de1ef3f2f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/453c20fdb59fa8b7257c33aed6cbd2de1ef3f2f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKDM0NjQ5MjZlNzMyM2NmOGExNTU5YjE1OTdiNjUzNzhhYTU3N2Q4OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3","sha":"762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3"}],"sha":"3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/3464926e7323cf8a1559b1597b65378aa577d88a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:22:34Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:22:34Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(domain): products + cart + orders + notifications (graphql)\n\n4 modulos de dominio expostos 100% por GraphQL (dicotomia clara REST vs\nGraphQL). Todos os resolvers autenticados exigem JwtAuthGuard + CsrfGuard\nem mutations; admin-only usa RolesGuard + @Roles(''admin'').\n\nproducts:\n- Category + Product entities (eager: category)\n- Queries: listProducts(search,category), product(id), categories\n- Mutation createProduct (admin + CSRF + guards)\n- Seed inicial: 3 categorias (camisetas/canecas/livros) + 8 produtos\n\ncart:\n- Cart (userId unique) + CartItem (cartId, productId, quantity) com eager\n  loading bidirectional\n- myCart / addToCart / updateCartItem / removeFromCart (auth + CSRF)\n- totalCents calculado a partir de items.product.priceCents * quantity\n\norders:\n- Order (status PENDING/PAID/SHIPPED/CANCELLED, items JSON snapshot)\n- Queries: myOrders, allOrders (admin)\n- Mutation checkout: snapshot dos items do cart, persiste order, limpa cart,\n  publica notificacao SUCCESS\n\nnotifications:\n- Notification (kind enum, title, body, readAt) + PubSub singleton in-memory\n- Queries: myNotifications, mutation markAsRead\n- Subscription notificationAdded filtrada por userId do JWT (graphql-ws)\n- OrdersService dispara notificacao SUCCESS no checkout\n\nFixes:\n- CsrfGuard agora detecta graphql vs http (getType) para ler o req\n  correto via GqlExecutionContext\n- imageUrl e readAt com @Field(() => String/Date, {nullable:true}) pois\n  TypeScript emit nao infere unions\n- Cart.items OneToMany (item => item.cart) + CartItem.cart ManyToOne bidir\n\n4 migrations novas: CreateCategoriesAndProducts (+seed), CreateCartAndItems,\nCreateNotifications, CreateOrders.\n\nSmoke test ponta-a-ponta validado:\n- listProducts (publico) retorna 8 produtos com categoria\n- addToCart/myCart/checkout fluxo completo funcionando\n- myOrders e myNotifications populados apos checkout\n- CSRF bloqueando mutations sem header\n- RBAC bloqueando cliente em createProduct/allOrders\n- Admin consegue createProduct e allOrders\n- Notificacao SUCCESS publicada automaticamente no checkout","tree":{"sha":"c2d9d3746d07657370e1ed70cbea5cd7e771808f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/c2d9d3746d07657370e1ed70cbea5cd7e771808f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3","node_id":"C_kwDOR_ZI-toAKDc2MmNkMzUxYTNkOThmYjFiZDVjYTYyOTQ0ZWJiMjRlYmFiMDYwYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gerps2/fiap-store/commit/12abc52188ee7877196b46bc28ca7f16cd9828db","sha":"12abc52188ee7877196b46bc28ca7f16cd9828db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/12abc52188ee7877196b46bc28ca7f16cd9828db"}],"sha":"762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/762cd351a3d98fb1bd5ca62944ebb24ebab060c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234501558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/12abc52188ee7877196b46bc28ca7f16cd9828db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:15:16Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:15:16Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(users,auth): jwt es256 + argon2id + httponly cookies + csrf + rbac\n\nIdentidade completa via REST, alimentando o shared-context dos MFEs.\n\nUsers module (REST):\n- User entity (SQLite-friendly: id uuid string via @BeforeInsert, groups CSV\n  com transformer robusto que aceita array ou string)\n- UsersService com argon2id (19 MiB / 2 iter / 1 parallel — OWASP 2026) e\n  burnArgon2 dummy para tempo constante em caminhos de erro\n- UsersController: GET /users/me (protegido por JwtAuthGuard)\n\nAuth module (REST):\n- JwtSignerService com jose ES256 (chaves .keys/ carregadas onModuleInit),\n  claims completas (iss/aud/sub/jti/iat/exp)\n- RefreshToken entity com familyId (reuse detection) e revokedAt\n- AuthService:\n  * signup (anti-enumeration via argon2 dummy em 409)\n  * login (tempo constante via burnArgon2 quando email nao existe)\n  * refresh com rotacao + deteccao de reuse (revoga family inteira)\n  * logout (revoga refresh atual)\n- AuthController: signup/login/refresh/logout/csrf com cookies\n  httpOnly + Secure + SameSite=strict e CSRF double-submit\n- JwtAuthGuard (unificado REST e GraphQL via context.getType())\n- RolesGuard + @Roles() decorator\n- CsrfGuard com timingSafeEqual\n- @CurrentUser() decorator\n\nMigrations:\n- CreateUsers (1700000000000)\n- SeedUsers (1700000001000) — admin@fiap.com/admin123 e cliente@fiap.com/cliente123\n- CreateRefreshTokens (1700000002000)\n- src/data-source.ts para TypeORM CLI (migration:generate/run)\n\nSmoke test ponta-a-ponta validado:\n- login/signup/logout/refresh + users/me funcionando\n- CSRF bloqueia mutation sem header\n- Timing constante login (email inexistente vs senha errada: ~46ms ambos)\n- Reuse detection revogando family\n- GraphQL /graphql segue respondendo { hello }\n\nAuthModule e UsersModule com forwardRef (JwtAuthGuard consumido em\nUsersController).","tree":{"sha":"5eb1c59bb6eabc14cc358200ffa98a8f3d3d813a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/trees/5eb1c59bb6eabc14cc358200ffa98a8f3d3d813a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/git/commits/12abc52188ee7877196b46bc28ca7f16cd9828db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signa