}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gprudencio-pront","id":234501558,"login":"gprudencio-pront","node_id":"U_kgDODfo1tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gprudencio-pront","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gerps2/fiap-store/commits/8c3ee28fe1ba84af56f4c2aac2fd613ad1d737b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:08:19Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T22:08:19Z","email":"gerson.prudencio@prontlink.com.br","name":"Gerson Prudencio"},"message":"feat(backend): bootstrap nestjs monolito modular with rest + graphql + sqlite\n\nInitial backend scaffold for Aula 3. Lives in src/backend/ alongside the\nexisting src/frontend/ workspace, with its own package.json and node_modules.\n\nWhat is set up:\n- NestJS 10 + @nestjs/graphql 12 + @nestjs/apollo 12 (code-first)\n- TypeORM + better-sqlite3 (db.sqlite created on boot, migrationsRun: true)\n- Global middleware: helmet, cookie-parser, CORS with credentials,\n  ValidationPipe with whitelist/transform\n- Smoke endpoints: GET /health (REST) and { hello } (GraphQL)\n- ES256 key pair generator (scripts/gen-keys.mjs) for future JWT module\n- .env.example with all knobs documented\n- npm run demo:reset to wipe db and resubir limpo\n\nNext steps (per PLANO.md): modules users (REST) and auth (REST), followed\nby products/cart/orders/notifications (GraphQL).","tree":{"sha":"dd40e3d9e5a1ac5b2