t/db9a9b8c39ff8f4ee7b0147d51a4e8525717c468","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGRiOWE5YjhjMzlmZjhmNGVlN2IwMTQ3ZDUxYTRlODUyNTcxN2M0Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441","sha":"b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441"}],"sha":"db9a9b8c39ff8f4ee7b0147d51a4e8525717c468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/db9a9b8c39ff8f4ee7b0147d51a4e8525717c468"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:03:56Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:03:56Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: warn when the applied theme class is not defined anywhere\n\nThemeProvider restores a theme name from localStorage without checking it\nstill exists — deliberately, since UIKit cannot know the themes an app\ndefines. The cost of that freedom is a silent, total failure.\n\nFound while rebuilding a real product on Bloom. The app shipped six palette\nvariants, we cut it down to one committed scheme, and a stored preference for\na now-deleted variant kept winning. Every token fell back to UIKit''s base\ntheme, so the accent was simply the wrong blue. No error, no warning, and no\nway to tell from the page why the palette you just wrote was being ignored.\n\nThis changes no behaviour. It says what happened:\n\n  [@bloomneo/uikit] Theme \"app-teal\" is applied to <html>, but no stylesheet\n  defines \".theme-app-teal\". Every token falls back to the base theme — which\n  usually shows up as the wrong accent colour, with no error.\n    · Renamed or removed this theme? Clear the stored preference: …\n    · Or ignore storage entirely: <ThemeProvider theme=\"…\" forceConfig />\n\nDevelopment only. Cross-origin stylesheets are unreadable, so those are\nassumed to define the theme rather than produce a false positive.\n\n227 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a3d9540fca46fd6c9c4201bd6cd94ffd8f336e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/5a3d9540fca46fd6c9c4201bd6cd94ffd8f336e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGI0ZGM4MTg0NmQzZDI4MWI5ZjdiZWEwODZlYzYyNDQ4YTdhNDY0NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b","sha":"049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b"}],"sha":"b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b4dc81846d3d281b9f7bea086ec62448a7a46441"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:34:47Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:34:47Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: modal close button kept an arrow cursor\n\nDialog and Sheet close with a raw Radix Close primitive rather than a <Button>,\nso 4.1.4''s cursor pass — which enumerated components by hand — skipped both.\n\nAlso gives it a real hit target: a bare 16px icon is small to aim at, so it is\nnow a 28px square with a hover background.\n\nThe guard was rewritten to check shape rather than a list, since enumerating\nnames is exactly how this was missed. It now finds any Radix Close/Trigger that\nstyles itself (rather than delegating via asChild) and requires it to declare\nits own cursor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bca072c81daf76c792951e12548250dd49537aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/6bca072c81daf76c792951e12548250dd49537aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDA0OWE3YWIxMmRiZTRmYWJhNThiNzhlZjczZDZlZTM3MGVkMWNjOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c","sha":"d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c"}],"sha":"049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/049a7ab12dbe4faba58b78ef73d6ee370ed1cc9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:30:50Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:30:50Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: every modal opened with no dim behind it\n\nDialogOverlay and SheetOverlay used shadcn''s bg-black/50. The 3.0 palette reset\nremoves Tailwind''s default colours — including black — so that class compiled\nto nothing and every dialog opened over a fully visible page with no scrim.\n\nReplaced with a --color-overlay token (oklch(0 0 0 / 0.5) light, 0.68 dark)\nplus a 2px backdrop blur, so the scrim is themeable rather than a literal.\ntext-white on the destructive Button and Badge became text-destructive-\nforeground for the same reason.\n\nThe guard that should have caught this had a hole: its pattern required a\nnumeric shade (bg-red-500), and black/white have none, so all four instances\nwere invisible. Extended and verified by reintroducing bg-black/50.\n\nThird bug in this series from adopting shadcn source without reconciling it\nagainst UIKit''s conventions — token names, Tailwind version, and now a palette\nthat no longer contains the colours shadcn assumes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e88a1890b41e9ec8349112ef6b4eb8da8ab51079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/e88a1890b41e9ec8349112ef6b4eb8da8ab51079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGQ4M2FhMzg4MjJiMzlhYTlkM2U4ZjU1MTU3Yzc0NjNlNjFiMTAyMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2","sha":"de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2"}],"sha":"d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/d83aa38822b39aa9d3e8f55157c7463e61b1021c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:23:07Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:23:07Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: nothing clickable showed a pointer cursor\n\nButtons, tabs, dropdown items and select options all rendered with the default\narrow; only real <a href> elements showed a hand, so the whole library felt\ninert on hover.\n\nTwo causes, both from adopting shadcn source without reconciling it against\nthis project''s context:\n\n- Tailwind v4''s Preflight sets `button { cursor: default }`, a change from v3.\n  Every clickable surface needs cursor-pointer explicitly now, and shadcn''s\n  sources predate that.\n- Menu and list items were marked cursor-default deliberately — a desktop-menu\n  convention that reads as broken on the web.\n\ncursor-pointer added to Button and TabsTrigger; the eight cursor-default\ndeclarations across dropdown-menu, select and command replaced. Disabled states\nare unaffected, they already carry disabled:pointer-events-none.\n\nGuarded by a test asserting no component ships cursor-default, verified by\nreintroducing one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe143f75e68366569505081b834e14506d5898d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/fe143f75e68366569505081b834e14506d5898d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGRlNDQ1YmViMTcyNGI0OGU5YjhmNjdlNWJiOTE4ZjFkODQ1OGFjZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922","sha":"fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922"}],"sha":"de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/de445beb1724b48e9b8f67e5bb918f1d8458acd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:16:29Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:16:29Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: toasts rendered with a transparent background\n\nToaster set Sonner''s colour variables from shadcn''s token names:\n\n  ''--normal-bg'': ''var(--popover)''    // UIKit defines --color-popover\n\nUIKit''s tokens are Tailwind v4 @theme names, so --popover does not exist, and\nCSS resolves an undefined custom property to nothing rather than erroring. The\nresult was a fully transparent toast with its text sitting on whatever was\nbehind it — unreadable anywhere the page had content.\n\nSix references across sonner.tsx and toast.tsx, all from shadcn source copied\nin without adapting the variable names. Reported as ''the toaster has\ntransparent bg which is making it hard to read with overlap''.\n\nAdds a guard that scans every component for bare shadcn custom properties,\nverified by reintroducing one. Same root cause as the Tabs sizing issue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"85f0b5bfed4bbfdf99dea6aae8d404a17d4c6d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/85f0b5bfed4bbfdf99dea6aae8d404a17d4c6d7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGZiOTI2ZmU4YTc3OWZiZGMyMzU3NmNmZTdhZmQ3YjdhOTQ2YTM5MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e","sha":"ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e"}],"sha":"fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/fb926fe8a779fbdc23576cfe7afd7b7a946a3922"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:56:37Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:56:37Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: consuming apps got none of UIKit''s own utility classes\n\nTailwind only emits a utility it can see in scanned source, and it never\nscans node_modules. UIKit''s components carry their own classes — bg-muted on\nTabsList, bg-popover on DropdownMenu, bg-destructive on the destructive\nbutton — so unless the consuming app happened to write the same class in its\nown source, that CSS was never generated.\n\nA freshly scaffolded Bloom app was missing 22 of them. Nothing errored and no\nwarning appeared; the visible symptom was a tab strip with no pill behind it,\nwhich reads as a design mistake rather than a missing stylesheet. It surfaced\nas a report that ''the padding looks off''.\n\ndist/theme.css now carries its own @source. That directive resolves relative\nto the file containing it, so importing the theme — which every consumer\nalready does — is now sufficient. The alternative was documenting an extra\n@source line for every consumer, i.e. exactly the kind of rule that gets\nskipped and fails silently.\n\nGuarded by a test that compiles a consumer with `source(none)` so automatic\ncontent detection cannot mask the result. The first version of that guard\npassed with the fix removed — the fixture lives inside this repo and Tailwind\nwas auto-scanning dist/ — so it was rewritten until it failed for the right\nreason.\n\n218 tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51f93978ade6110c4fb9a48c828e9f59e51cddea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/51f93978ade6110c4fb9a48c828e9f59e51cddea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGNhOWQ4YmNhZDY3YTRhMzM2ZjlkYjM1MTFkMGVhYThjNWNhYzlmNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa","sha":"364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa"}],"sha":"ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/ca9d8bcad67a4a336f9db3511d0eaa8c5cac9f6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:06:37Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:06:37Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: uikit 4.1.1 — file-by-file audit before publishing\n\nEverything here was already shipped and broken. None of it was caught by the\nbuild, by uikit''s own typecheck, or by 187 passing tests, because each failure\nis only visible from outside the package.\n\n- Build-time `@/` aliases leaked into the published .d.ts. tsc copies import\n  specifiers verbatim, so an alias in a TYPE position survived into shipped\n  declarations; consumers cannot resolve it, so the symbol degraded to `any`\n  and every derived type collapsed. PasswordInputProps became Omit<any,''type''>,\n  making <PasswordInput onChange={e => ...}/> an implicit-any error in every\n  strict consumer. useDataTable and CommandDialog had the same fault. Inside\n  this repo the alias resolves, so our own typecheck stayed green.\n  Fixed at emit time by scripts/fix-dts-aliases.mjs, which exits non-zero if\n  any alias survives.\n\n- Five shipped examples did not typecheck. useApi''s verbs are now per-call\n  generic (<R = T>) because a list hook is useApi<User[]> while the POST that\n  creates one returns a single User — which is what examples/use-api.tsx\n  assumed. CSS subpaths now carry a types condition, so the canonical\n  `import ''@bloomneo/uikit/styles''` no longer raises TS2882.\n\n- 16 platform helpers existed in src/lib/platform.ts since 2.x but were never\n  exported, while the npm description, the agent skill and the docs site all\n  promised them. Exports 139 -> 155. isExtension never existed; that claim is\n  corrected on the site rather than the function invented.\n\n- Removed dead config: tailwind.config.js (v3 syntax in a v4 project, globbing\n  a directory that does not exist), postcss.config.js (vite overrides it with\n  an empty inline config), their two devDeps, and five tracked .DS_Store files.\n\n- tests/package-integrity.test.ts asserts against the built artefact, where all\n  of the above lived. 211 tests; each guard verified by reintroducing its bug.\n\nVerified by installing the tarball into a strict project: all 20 shipped\nexamples plus a probe typecheck clean, palette lockdown holds, components\nSSR-render, 155 exports. Tarball 2616 -> 2614 KB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"606c9b207900c731162f4513af2ffd21a31f12e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/606c9b207900c731162f4513af2ffd21a31f12e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDM2NGYzMzFjZTQ3MzFlYzc5NTIxMzk4MzcxNTE2Yjk1N2MyMGU2YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159","sha":"4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159"}],"sha":"364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/364f331ce4731ec79521398371516b957c20e6aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:39:15Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:39:15Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"test: cover Select and Combobox — the components the #1 rule names\n\nAGENTS.md''s top rule names exactly two components: ''never use onChange on\n<Select> or <Combobox>''. The first pass of the component tests covered that\ncontract with <Tabs> as a stand-in for ''single-value picker'', which left both\nnamed components untested — and they are the fiddliest here, a Radix portal\nand cmdk inside a Popover.\n\n8 tests: onValueChange fires with the value (not the label, not an event),\nonChange is ignored exactly as documented, the trigger reflects the choice,\nand Combobox filters and shows its empty message.\n\nMutation-verified: suppressing Combobox''s onValueChange call fails the suite.\nNoted honestly in the README that the filter assertion exercises cmdk rather\nthan our code, and that 11/30 components are covered, with the three gaps\nworth closing listed in priority order.\n\n180 tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45f42c3e8df259c27167518cfb0d495dcfed93eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/45f42c3e8df259c27167518cfb0d495dcfed93eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDQwNTE0NzlkOTBhMTU0MmQ4YThjOThkNmMxMWQ0OTQzMDk3NzMxNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc","sha":"084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc"}],"sha":"4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/4051479d90a1542d8a8c98d6c11d494309773159"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:09:00Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T13:09:00Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: npm description advertised layouts, routing and scaffolding\n\nThe package description is the first thing an agent reads — llms.txt\ninherits it verbatim as its header, and it is what npmjs.com shows. It\nstill claimed ''components, layouts, themes, routing, scaffolding'' after\n4.0 removed the layouts and the scaffolder.\n\nFound while syncing the docs site: the file I copied over described a\nlibrary that no longer exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"466bc4dc2611b9a1441f18bb6d1d5a60c7d329d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/466bc4dc2611b9a1441f18bb6d1d5a60c7d329d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDA4NGFkNDRmNTY5YTgxNWNjYWIzODc5OWU2YjYzNGE0NzI5NjBjY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754","sha":"dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754"}],"sha":"084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/084ad44f569a815ccab38799e6b634a472960ccc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:43:31Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:43:31Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"test: add component tests, mutation-verified\n\n4.0''s suite was 60 export-surface assertions and 74 CSS assertions — not one\nrendered a component. The id-vs-key bug in the demo surfaced only as a React\nwarning in a browser console; nothing in CI would have caught it.\n\nAdds 38 DOM tests under a separate vitest project (happy-dom; jsdom 27 fails\nto load on Node 20.17 via a transitive CJS/ESM conflict):\n\n- controlled-props: the onChange / onCheckedChange / onValueChange contract\n  AGENTS.md calls the #1 agent failure mode, asserted by driving each\n  component and checking which callback fires with what.\n- data-table: column contract (id required, cell receives value-first,\n  accessor beats accessorKey), sorting, search, empty/loading/error states,\n  and the educational throw on non-array data.\n- providers-and-guards: duplicate-provider warnings, required-prop errors,\n  PermissionGate failing closed, useConfirm resolving, ThemeProvider owning\n  the theme-* class on <html>.\n\nEvery behavioural assertion was mutation-tested. That caught a weak one: the\nsearch tests all queried prefixes, so swapping includes for startsWith stayed\ngreen. Added a substring case that fails under that mutation.\n\n172 tests total. Build and typecheck unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f1ff67f9ebe6b1ca6f7fedd5f22b8ed6b30dd47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/8f1ff67f9ebe6b1ca6f7fedd5f22b8ed6b30dd47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGRmZWExMzUxMWZhMWFkMDhjZTg2NDkzNjRiNzlmZGZlZjk3ZDY3NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/51354e74f8f345a694bea0cce0fa990613c951ad","sha":"51354e74f8f345a694bea0cce0fa990613c951ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/51354e74f8f345a694bea0cce0fa990613c951ad"}],"sha":"dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/dfea13511fa1ad08ce8649364b79fdfef97d6754"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/51354e74f8f345a694bea0cce0fa990613c951ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:32:52Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:32:52Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: uikit 4.1.0 — drop the dead weight 4.0 left behind\n\n4.0''s component surface was correct; its asset payload was not. I audited\nexports and never weighed the tarball. Unpacked 5.9 MB -> 3.2 MB.\n\n- Remove dist/fonts (3.4 MB, 56% of the package). All 11 families served\n  elegant/metro/studio/vivid, which 4.0 deleted; base uses the system stack.\n  The ./styles/fonts subpath, src/fonts/, src/styles/fonts.css and the\n  build:fonts step go with them.\n\n- Deduplicate _tokens.css. `uikit bundle` appends a theme section instead of\n  replacing it, so the file held two complete copies — every token declared\n  four times, with success/warning silently disagreeing between them and\n  later-wins hiding it. Kept the values actually in effect, so visually a\n  no-op. 20 KB -> 8 KB; dist/theme.css 21 KB -> 10 KB.\n\n- Chart ramp becomes five hues instead of one hue in five tints. The old\n  #0EA5E9/#38BDF8/#7DD3FC/#BAE6FD/#E0F2FE was unreadable in a donut. This is\n  the only visual change in the release.\n\n- Remove 18 --voila-* tokens and 3 helper classes: zero component references,\n  absent from every agent-facing doc.\n\n- Four hygiene guards, each verified by reintroducing the bug: no duplicated\n  token block, no font bundle, no --voila-*, and a hue-spread check.\n\nVerified by installing the tarball into a consumer running its own Tailwind:\npalette lockdown holds, chart utilities compile, components SSR-render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"017bb119be46998511f5c1673bb18f0809264aa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/017bb119be46998511f5c1673bb18f0809264aa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/51354e74f8f345a694bea0cce0fa990613c951ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","