s://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/c01efc930f3739615faaa90062454f83c229cb7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:20:09Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:20:09Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"chore: prune 12 unreferenced dependencies\n\nDeleting the 4.0 components left their packages in `dependencies`, so every\nconsumer kept installing them. Verified zero references across src/, bin/,\nscripts/, tests/, examples/ and cookbook/ before removal, then reinstalled\nfrom scratch: build clean, 130 tests green, tarball verified in a consumer\nthat runs its own Tailwind.\n\ndependencies 35 -> 23; puppeteer + sharp also drop from peerDependencies\n(they existed only for the removed prerender/optimize commands).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d4ef9a1b88e45d4a060af193a2e1e694db49d9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/5d4ef9a1b88e45d4a060af193a2e1e694db49d9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/c01efc930f3739615faaa90062454f83c229cb7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs"