thub.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/ef50b90a4c8abab1b808269d0e6a80ecb715e8d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:16:33Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:16:33Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"chore: gitignore npm pack output\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"366965ac58f92c33a6909c8dc8cdbe4f71d626bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/366965ac58f92c33a6909c8dc8cdbe4f71d626bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/ef50b90a4c8abab1b808269d0e6a80ecb715e8d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/ef50b90a4c8abab1b808269d0e6a80ecb715e8d3","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGVmNTBiOTBhNGM4YWJhYjFiODA4MjY5ZDBlNmE4MGVjYjcxNWU4ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492","sha":"8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492"}],"sha":"ef50b90a4c8abab1b808269d0e6a80ecb715e8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/ef50b90a4c8abab1b808269d0e6a80ecb715e8d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:52:28Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:52:28Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: uikit 4.0.0 — library, not framework\n\nRemoves app chrome and whole-app scaffolding. 299 files, ~34,900 lines.\nPublic exports 197 -> 139; export subpaths 70 -> 43.\n\nRemoved\n- Layouts and sections: AdminLayout, PageLayout, AuthLayout, BlankLayout,\n  PopupLayout, MobileLayout, Header, Footer, Container, SafeArea, TabBar.\n  Every app built on this library replaced them within weeks. Replaced by\n  the layout-route + <Outlet/> pattern with page-owned headers.\n- 14 never-imported primitives (Skeleton, Separator, Motion, Calendar, ...).\n- Theme presets elegant/metro/studio/vivid. _tokens.css 60 KB -> 19 KB.\n- The scaffolding CLI: `uikit create` and its single/spa/multi/fbca\n  templates, plus serve/build/deploy/prerender/optimize. These duplicated\n  @bloomneo/bloom and were built on the chrome this release deletes.\n- useTheme().getDefaultTone() — every key named a removed layout.\n\nFixed (all pre-existing, found while verifying)\n- @bloomneo/uikit/theme shipped a stale token system. src/styles/theme.css\n  was a 2025 voila-bundle artefact with an inline copy of every token and\n  no `@import \"./_tokens.css\"`, so the build''s inline step was a silent\n  no-op and the 4.0 cleanup never reached consumers. Now a thin wrapper;\n  guarded by 5 assertions verified against a reintroduced bug.\n- 27 export subpaths pointed at files that no longer build.\n- package.json declared a `voila-bundle` binary whose file is absent from\n  the published tarball. Verified against the live 3.0.2 tarball.\n- The drift gate stripped inline code spans, so a backticked <AdminLayout>\n  in a skill''s markdown table passed. Now matches raw lines; hardening it\n  surfaced usePagination promising a removed <Pagination>.\n- CLI templates emitted <PageLayout> and text-gradient-primary, a class\n  that exists in no stylesheet.\n- README linked five guides that do not exist.\n\nVerified end to end: packed the tarball, installed it into a consumer that\nruns its own Tailwind, confirmed the palette lockdown, SSR-rendered the\ncomponents, and drove the installed CLI through generate + bundle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da967cecf7144ed7f55d71c03a2b186989137b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/da967cecf7144ed7f55d71c03a2b186989137b54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDhiZGIwYjI3NjEzMjYwM2JjOGIzYWY1NTkzMDYxNGIwNzgzNDA0OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90","sha":"20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90"}],"sha":"8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/8bdb0b276132603bc8b3af55930614b078340492"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:52:20Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:52:20Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v3.0.2 — theme presets carry the tokens 3.0 added\n\nApps built with uikit''s own CLI lost the new tokens.\n\n`uikit bundle` regenerates an app''s globals.css from its theme presets, and\nthe presets had no success/warning/contrast entries — so the regenerated CSS\ndefined --color-destructive and none of the tokens 3.0 added. In an app\nscaffolded by `uikit create` (which imports its own bundled globals.css rather\nthan @bloomneo/uikit/theme), bg-contrast, bg-success and bg-warning resolved\nto nothing. uikit''s own Header, Footer, AdminLayout and form components use\nthose, so their contrast surfaces and status colours rendered unstyled.\n\nRoot cause: 3.0 added the tokens to the stylesheet directly, but the presets\nare the source the bundler reads. The two drifted.\n\nFixed in both places so there is one source of truth: the shipped presets and\nthe template `uikit generate theme` emits.\n\nVerified through the real CLI pipeline rather than by inspection —\ncreate --fbca, generate theme, bundle, then check every token in the\nregenerated globals.css.\n\nBloom-scaffolded apps were never affected; they import the theme directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf87e97c188ca2eb90bbe3df58d311eb923ee9bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/cf87e97c188ca2eb90bbe3df58d311eb923ee9bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDIwYzQ0MDNiYWJiOWQzOWUwZmQ3ZmMyYmM1MmE3ZGMwZDIyZjNkOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0","sha":"43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0"}],"sha":"20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/20c4403babb9d39e0fd7fc2bc52a7dc0d22f3d90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:34:33Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:34:33Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v3.0.1 — fix the theme import, declare tailwind as a peer\n\n3.0.0''s headline feature was unusable. CSS tooling resolves package imports\nvia the `style` export condition; the exports map declared only import and\nrequire, so Tailwind failed outright:\n\n  Error: \"./theme\" is not exported under the condition \"style\"\n\nEvery consumer following the upgrade guide hit this on their first build.\n`style` is now declared for ./theme, ./styles, ./styles/permissive and\n./styles/fonts.\n\nHow it got through: the pre-publish test compiled a consumer app but imported\nthe theme by RELATIVE PATH, which resolves without any exports field. It\nproved the mechanism and never exercised the string a user actually writes.\nThe test now uses the package specifier, and was verified to fail when the\nstyle condition is removed.\n\nAlso declares tailwindcss ^4.0.0 as an OPTIONAL peer dependency. The theme\nfile is imported into the consumer''s build and uses v4-only syntax (@theme,\n--color-*: initial), so a v3 app cannot parse it and an app with no Tailwind\nhad no signal it needed one. Optional because prebuilt /styles consumers need\nno build of their own.\n\nTailwind v4 is the stable line (latest 4.3.3; v3 is v3-lts). uikit builds\nagainst 4.1.x and the lockdown is now verified against 4.3.3 — the version a\nfresh consumer install actually gets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b87960f46500cba597291f36e9fca1d2f653e4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/1b87960f46500cba597291f36e9fca1d2f653e4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDQzNTM5ZWY3NWJlM2VhM2E0MTRmNzVhNDNjNWE4MWU2MGNkYmU0YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4","sha":"b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4"}],"sha":"43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/43539ef75be3ea3a414f75a43c5a81e60cdbe4a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:26:19Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:26:19Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"docs: rewrite the 3.0.0 changelog as an upgrade document\n\nThe entry had grown into a chronological list of what changed, which is not\nwhat someone upgrading needs. Restructured around the decision they actually\nface.\n\nLeads with the one idea (the theme can no longer be bypassed), then a 5-step\nupgrade plan before any of the detail:\n\n1. Pick the right import — the step people get wrong, and the one that fails\n   SILENTLY: choose wrong and the palette simply still works, so you believe\n   you upgraded when you did not. Table maps app type to import.\n2. Decide migrate-now vs defer, with permissive as the documented deferral.\n3. Find what breaks — a copy-pasteable grep.\n4. Replace with tokens — a was/use table covering every common case,\n   including the new success/warning/contrast sets.\n5. Verify by re-running the grep.\n\nPlus a note that Bloom-scaffolded apps get no benefit until their index.css\nimports @bloomneo/uikit/theme, since that is a bloom-side change.\n\nVerified rather than asserted: the documented grep was run against a fixture\ncontaining violations (finds them) and against uikit''s own migrated source\n(silent), and all 14 tokens in the \"Use\" column were compiled to confirm they\nexist. A wrong upgrade guide is worse than none — it costs trust at exactly\nthe moment someone is mid-migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c8d91cd837b4727b7cc08e7c5170d6e855b19f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/3c8d91cd837b4727b7cc08e7c5170d6e855b19f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGI4Mzg1MTM5NzdmM2U1ZmQxZjI5NTk0NWY5ODI3YzBiNDViMzI2YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5","sha":"be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5"}],"sha":"b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b838513977f3e5fd1f295945f9827c0b45b326c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:16:49Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T05:16:49Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: the palette lockdown now reaches consumer apps\n\nCaught by pre-publish verification. 3.0 was one check away from shipping a\nheadline promise that was false in the only situation it mattered.\n\nA prebuilt stylesheet cannot constrain a consumer''s build. Every Bloom\ntemplate runs its own `@import \"tailwindcss\"`, so its Tailwind generates\nwhatever utilities its source uses — bg-blue-600 included — regardless of what\nuikit ships. The lockdown worked inside uikit and nowhere else. Verified by\ncompiling a simulated consumer app: bg-blue-600 still worked.\n\nShips @bloomneo/uikit/theme: the tokens plus the reset, as SOURCE, so they\nparticipate in the build that scans the app''s code.\n\n  @import \"tailwindcss\";\n  @import \"@bloomneo/uikit/theme\";\n\n/styles stays for apps with no build step; /styles/permissive stays for\nmigration. README, AGENTS.md and the skill now lead with which import an app\nactually needs, because the wrong one fails silently.\n\nSix new assertions compile a real consumer app and assert bg-primary works\nwhile bg-blue-600 does not. Also fixed a nested comment terminator in\ntheme.css that made `@import \"tailwindcss\"` inside a comment become live CSS —\nthe same class of bug as the earlier `green-*/` one.\n\nAlso verified and fixed while here: AGENTS.md claimed v2.1.4 and the skill\nv2.1.5 against a 3.0.0 package; skills still framed raw palette classes as\n\"theme-blind\" rather than \"emit no CSS\"; theming.md claimed 29 tokens when\nthere are 42. Ported appkit''s version-consistency gate, and verified it fails\non a deliberately wrong version.\n\nSuite 167 -> 173 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d62c1e69c98aed45fdfdae27f77776763f488b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/2d62c1e69c98aed45fdfdae27f77776763f488b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGJlMzBlMjFjYzVjZDM5NTI5OGQ2YjcxZTE5NzI1ZjRhMTAxODU1ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e","sha":"1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e"}],"sha":"be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/be30e21cc5cd395298d6b71e19725f4a101855e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:53:23Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:53:23Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix: migrate uikit''s own components off the palette 3.0 removes\n\nCaught by a follow-up review, not by the build — the first cut of 3.0.0\nshipped broken.\n\nTwelve component files were built on a hardcoded zinc-* scale for\ntone=\"contrast\", plus green-*/orange-* for status and gray-* for muted badges:\n80 classes. Under the new default stylesheet every one compiled to nothing, so\nthe contrast surface of Header, Footer, AdminLayout, MobileLayout, PopupLayout\nand BlankLayout would have rendered unstyled. Source looked fine, typecheck\npassed, build succeeded, component had no colour.\n\nThe migration needed tokens that did not exist: a contrast set (surface,\nforeground, muted, muted-foreground, border) and success/warning. There was a\ndestructive token but never success or warning, which is exactly why\ncomponents reached for raw green and orange. Values match the scales they\nreplace, so 3.0 looks identical — but the contrast surface is now themeable\nrather than zinc regardless of theme.\n\nAdded a gate: 57 assertions scan every file under src/components and fail on\nany raw palette class, plus a guard against a vacuous pass if the scan finds\nno files. Also fixed a JSDoc example in blank.tsx that taught bg-blue-600.\n\nOne CSS lesson worth recording: the first token insertion broke the build\nbecause a comment containing \"green-*/\" closed itself early. The @theme block\nthen parsed as garbage.\n\nSuite 110 -> 167 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c6387451c5c0ac2cd920cbb2366e58e990a6eba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/6c6387451c5c0ac2cd920cbb2366e58e990a6eba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDE4ODJhYTA5NjkyZTFlZjNiNDFiYThiOTJjMGUzZjU0NzJhMThiMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865","sha":"766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865"}],"sha":"1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1882aa09692e1ef3b41ba8b92c0e3f5472a18b0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:46:30Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:46:30Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v3.0.0 — the palette is locked to the theme\n\nBREAKING: @bloomneo/uikit/styles now emits only the theme''s semantic tokens.\nbg-primary works; bg-blue-600, text-gray-900 and border-red-400 compile to\nnothing. @bloomneo/uikit/styles/permissive is 2.x verbatim for migration.\n\nWhy: the theme system was the headline feature and the least-used part of the\nlibrary. One production app accumulated 1,547 hardcoded palette classes\nagainst 196 semantic ones; another 209 against 74. Not carelessness — both\nwere equally available and the raw palette needed no lookup. A rule that lives\nonly in documentation gets bypassed at the rate the codebase grows.\n\nRemoving the alternative is the only version of the rule that holds, and it\nasks very little of an agent: not \"adopt our component library\", just \"use the\none class that exists\". The failure is loud — an unstyled element, seen\nimmediately — instead of drift nobody notices until the brand stops matching\nitself.\n\nThe stylesheet split (globals / permissive / _tokens) is load-bearing:\nTailwind v4 resolves `--color-*: initial` against the LAST @import\n\"tailwindcss\" it sees, so a reset before a nested framework import is silently\nundone. The first attempt looked correct, built clean, and did nothing — hence\n28 tests that run the real Tailwind CLI and inspect emitted CSS, with a guard\nagainst an empty-output false pass.\n\nAlso: removed 9 dead duplicate token declarations from the root @theme block,\nand documented the six exports that collide with lucide-react icon names\n(Badge, Calendar, Command, Container, Sheet, Table).\n\nThe 68 -> ~15 export cull is deliberately deferred: the case for it rested on\n18% adoption measured while the raw palette was freely available, which is a\nconfound this release removes. Re-measure on 3.0 first.\n\nSuite 82 -> 110 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47b3de1891d96b251aebc0d7825c32bf27480107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/47b3de1891d96b251aebc0d7825c32bf27480107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDc2NmI3OGFlNzNmYTE0YTJiMzc4YWZlMWQ0YmE3MGZlMDNjMTU4NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1fdb95ebc80cbb49a5364c73605f4d73c7e56f5a","sha":"1fdb95ebc80cbb49a5364c73605f4d73c7e56f5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1fdb95ebc80cbb49a5364c73605f4d73c7e56f5a"}],"sha":"766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/766b78ae73fa14a2b378afe1d4ba70fe03c15865"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1fdb95ebc80cbb49a5364c73605f4d73c7e56f5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:40:02Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:40:02Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v2.2.0 — strict stylesheet, so the theme can''t be bypassed\n\nAdds @bloomneo/uikit/styles/strict: the semantic tokens with Tailwind''s\ndefault palette removed. bg-primary works; bg-blue-600 compiles to nothing.\n\nWhy: the theme system was the headline feature and the least used part of the\nlibrary. One production app accumulated 1,547 hardcoded palette classes\nagainst 196 semantic ones; another 209 against 74. Not carelessness — both\nwere equally available and the raw palette needed no lookup. A rule that lives\nonly in documentation gets bypassed at the rate the codebase grows.\n\nRemoving the alternative is the only version of the rule that holds, and the\nbar is low: the model does not have to adopt a component library, it just has\nto use the one class that exists. A mistake shows as an unstyled element\nimmediately rather than surviving review.\n\nNOT breaking. @bloomneo/uikit/styles is unchanged and still ships the full\npalette, so existing apps upgrade without losing styles. Strict is recommended\nfor new apps; existing ones migrate their hardcoded colours first.\n\nThe stylesheet split (globals.css / strict.css / _tokens.css) is load-bearing,\nnot cosmetic: Tailwind v4 resolves `--color-*: initial` against the LAST\n@import \"tailwindcss\" it sees, so a reset placed before a nested framework\nimport is silently undone. The first attempt looked correct, built without\nerror, and did nothing — hence 28 tests that run the real Tailwind CLI and\ninspect the emitted CSS, plus a guard against an empty-output false pass.\n\nSuite 82 -> 110 passing. Strict sheet is 6.5 KB smaller than permissive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad80c115ffa4af0dd2f4c7fe595e9547226ded10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/ad80c115ffa4af0dd2f4c7fe595e9547226ded10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/1fdb95ebc80cbb49a5364c73605f4d73c7e56f5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g