ilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/0b2cf455add6abff3acd7a02742a1303bd50ef1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:56:26Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:56:26Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release 2.1.5: drop @voilajsx/uikit references from user-facing docs\n\nCosmetic cleanup. No API changes, no runtime impact.\n\nRemoved:\n- README tagline + \"Scope change (1.5.0)\" migration section\n- AGENTS.md never-rule #7 (don''t-import-voilajsx) — renumbered 8→7, 9→8\n- .cursor/rules/uikit.mdc never-line\n- 5x skills/.../SKILL.md: \"voilajsx\" keyword, \"Previously published\"\n  blurb, \"Never @voilajsx/uikit\" critical-rule bullet\n- docs/AGENT_CLARITY_ROADMAP.md stale TODO for a voilajsx codemod\n\nKept:\n- scripts/check-doc-drift.ts regex as CI guard against reintroduction\n- CHANGELOG.md history\n\n82/82 tests pass, doc-drift + anchor checks pass, build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec6c256877042b3e3cd93b071251e1faaa9d28a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/ec6c256877042b3e3cd93b071251e1faaa9d28a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/0b2cf455add6abff3acd7a02742a1303bd50ef1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://ap