ng\n\nBefore, clicking a second column header appended to the sort chain,\nso with unique values in the first column the second sort looked\nbroken (\"clicking the header does nothing\"). Plain click now replaces\nthe active sort (toggle asc → desc → off). Shift-click still appends\nfor multi-column sort. No public API change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"876d7394c50c9e2b598978ceacb77beb357b7adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/876d7394c50c9e2b598978ceacb77beb357b7adf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/a3ff2b4691a344db11b10340459eace8c238a2da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/a3ff2b4691a344db11b10340459eace8c238a2da","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGEzZmYyYjQ2OTFhMzQ0ZGIxMWIxMDM0MDQ1OWVhY2U4YzIzOGEyZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55","sha":"41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55"}],"sha":"a3ff2b4691a344db11b10340459eace8c238a2da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/a3ff2b4691a344db11b10340459eace8c238a2da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T02:41:05Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T02:41:05Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v2.1.1 — borders render soft gray, not near-black\n\nTailwind v4 made naked `border`, `border-b`, `border-t` utilities fall\nback to currentColor (dark text), so Table rows, Alert outlines, Dialog\nborders, and similar components rendered near-black despite each theme\ndefining `--color-border` as a soft gray. globals.css now sets\n`border-color: var(--color-border)` on `*`, `::before`, `::after` in a\nbase layer — explicit colors (`border-input`, `border-destructive`,\n`border-transparent`, etc.) still override via class specificity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1cee3406007424387f4f5da548e5a38cc0e70e8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/1cee3406007424387f4f5da548e5a38cc0e70e8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDQxYWRlNDQyMDJiN2VkNmFmN2U0OWI1NTdkNzU1MGYzMGY3MjhlNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e","sha":"6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e"}],"sha":"41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/41ade44202b7ed6af7e49b557d7550f30f728e55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T01:51:07Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T01:51:07Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v2.1.0 — sidebar collapses to bottom-nav on mobile\n\nPageLayout''s left/right sidebar now becomes a fixed bottom tab bar with\na \"More\" sheet below the md (768px) breakpoint, instead of disappearing\nwith max-md:hidden. Swap is pure CSS — the sidebar gets `hidden md:block`\nand the new BottomTabSheet gets `md:hidden`, so both live in the DOM and\nonly one paints per breakpoint. Safe-area insets handled for notched\ndevices. Zero API changes: consumers of `sidebar=\"left|right\"` get the\nmobile nav automatically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4edf4ac4d30fb60efe1c06c961cadcd71610edb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/4edf4ac4d30fb60efe1c06c961cadcd71610edb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDY3ODZlOTkyZDk4YjJiMzFiMDJhNDc3ZDhiYWUxMGYwYTYzN2M3NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5","sha":"3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5"}],"sha":"6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/6786e992d98b2b31b02a477d8bae10f0a637c75e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:35:19Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:35:19Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v2.0.1 — doc cleanup from 2nd-round review\n\nPure doc/comment fixes. No code behavior changes.\n\nVersion-string drift (the exact class of bug the appkit 4.0.0 review\ncaught and fixed):\n- AGENTS.md:3 header \"v1.5.1\" → \"v2.0.0\"\n- skills/bloomneo-uikit/SKILL.md frontmatter + H1\n- All 4 bin/templates/*/.claude/skills/bloomneo-uikit/SKILL.md\n- docs/NAMING.md stability claim\n\nREADME cross-platform honesty:\n- Removed \"Web, desktop, mobile, extensions from one codebase... The\n  only React UI kit that covers all four surfaces\" bullet. Replaced\n  with accurate framing: layout primitives + isTauri/isNative/isBrowser\n  detection helpers, plus an explicit \"components are React DOM; full\n  native/Tauri/extension adapters not yet shipped\" note. Matches the\n  package.json description corrected in 1.6.0.\n- \"Scope change (1.5.0)\" section labelled \"historical\" so it doesn''t\n  read as the current release.\n\nFormController export visibility:\n- src/index.ts:41 still re-exports FormField as FormController for\n  react-hook-form migrants. Component source and AGENTS.md rule \"Never\n  do #2\" both flag it as legacy, but a grep-first agent reading\n  src/index.ts sees only the name. Added inline @llm-rule AVOID:\n  comment on the export line itself.\n- Export kept (removal is breaking, queued for a future 3.0.0 if ever\n  justified).\n\nExplicitly NOT touched:\n- \"No one-rule equivalent\" — design observation, not fixable\n- @llm-rule WHEN NOT: cross-refs on 44 components — 44-file churn\n- Per-component bundle-size table — defer until complaint\n\nAll 74 public-surface tests green; tsc clean; check:docs + check:anchors\ngreen; llms.txt regenerated (36903 bytes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"713524a8cd3ba765173a43caff56ef5850a87bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/713524a8cd3ba765173a43caff56ef5850a87bbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDNkZGFiOWJkYTU4N2QyYTZjOGViOGI2NDVkZGQ0ZDExNTExOThhYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a","sha":"5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a"}],"sha":"3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/3ddab9bda587d2a6c8eb8b645ddd4d1151198aa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T04:14:49Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T04:14:49Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v2.0.0 — Combobox onValueChange (last naming inconsistency closed)\n\nOne breaking change on top of the 1.6.0 governance audit. Bundled as a\nfresh major since 1.6.0 was never published — latest on npm is still\n1.5.1, so this is a direct 1.5.1 → 2.0.0 jump for consumers.\n\nBreaking\n- <Combobox onChange={fn}> → <Combobox onValueChange={fn}>\n  Pre-2.0 Combobox used onChange(string | undefined) while Select used\n  onValueChange(string). Same-shape dropdowns with different names = the\n  single largest agent-friction surface in the library. Unified so every\n  value-not-event picker (Select, Combobox, Slider, Tabs, Accordion) uses\n  onValueChange; native HTML input wrappers (Input, Textarea,\n  PasswordInput) keep onChange(ChangeEvent). Drift-check bans the old\n  name so docs can''t reintroduce it.\n\nUpdated in the same commit so nothing drifts:\n- src/components/ui/combobox.tsx — ComboboxProps.onChange →\n  onValueChange; all three call sites updated.\n- examples/combobox.tsx, llms.txt (regenerated), docs/NAMING.md, AGENTS.md\n- skills/bloomneo-uikit/SKILL.md + all 4 bin/templates/*/.claude/skills/\n  SKILL.md files (prop cheat sheet row + ❌/✅ teaching pair flipped).\n- scripts/check-doc-drift.ts bans <Combobox onChange= pattern.\n\nFolds in 1.6.0 too (never shipped to npm):\n- Drift gates (check-doc-drift, check-readme-anchors, public-surface\n  test, CI).\n- UIKitError typed subclasses (DataTableError, FormFieldError,\n  ThemeError, ConfirmError, ToastError, PermissionError).\n- ''use client''; on all 44 src/components/ui/*.tsx files.\n- docs/NAMING.md, examples/use-api.tsx.\n- AGENTS.md + skills/ in files: so npm consumers actually get them.\n- Honest package.json description (no more cross-platform marketing).\n- pages/ subproject removed (487MB local-only, git-ignored).\n\nMigration from 1.5.1 (the latest on npm): one find-and-replace:\n  <Combobox onChange={ → <Combobox onValueChange={\n\nEvery other change in 1.6.0/2.0.0 is additive — existing code for\nSelect, Input, providers, DataTable, etc. keeps working unchanged.\n\nAll 74 public-surface tests green; tsc --noEmit clean; check:docs +\ncheck:anchors green; dist/ rebuilt; lockfile synced to 2.0.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d10902754893310004cc2ac474acb8b4ee9982c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/6d10902754893310004cc2ac474acb8b4ee9982c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDVjZTZjNjQ5ZTU3NzYxNmJkYTg3ODEzM2JjMTE0Y2NlZmI1OTU0MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc","sha":"b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc"}],"sha":"5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/5ce6c649e577616bda878133bc114ccefb59541a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T03:39:08Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T03:39:08Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"release: v1.6.0 — governance + agent-friendliness audit\n\nCloses the gap between @bloomneo/uikit and @bloomneo/appkit@4.0.0''s\ndrift-gate discipline. Pure additive — no breaking changes.\n\nDrift gates\n- scripts/check-doc-drift.ts — scans docs, examples, cookbook, skills,\n  scaffolding templates, and src/ for stale scope (@voilajsx/uikit),\n  hallucinated callbacks (<Combobox onValueChange>, <Select onChange>),\n  renamed aliases (FormController), and wrong <DataTable data={undefined}>.\n  Handles ❌/✅ teaching pairs and diff-block migration lines.\n- scripts/check-readme-anchors.ts — verifies every UIKitError docs URL\n  resolves to a real heading in llms.txt.\n- tests/public-surface.test.ts — 74 assertions over every expected export\n  (components, hooks, utilities, error types, provider pairings).\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml — runs check:docs + check:anchors + test:unit +\n  typecheck + build on Node 18/20/22 for push + PR.\n- npm test reorganised: main \"test\" runs checks + vitest; test:unit is\n  vitest-only; test:watch is interactive mode.\n\nError taxonomy\n- UIKitError now has 6 typed subclasses re-exported from the root:\n  DataTableError, FormFieldError, ThemeError, ConfirmError, ToastError,\n  PermissionError. Consumers catch `instanceof UIKitError` once and\n  match every uikit error.\n\nNext.js App Router compatibility\n- ''use client''; added to all 44 files in src/components/ui/. Consumers on\n  Next.js 13+ no longer need wrapper components.\n\nDocs\n- docs/NAMING.md — React-library naming conventions (PascalCase components,\n  use-prefixed hooks, onValueChange vs onChange rules, ref forwarding,\n  error handling, component-picker decision tree).\n- examples/use-api.tsx — the missing example for useApi<T>().\n\nHonesty\n- package.json description no longer claims cross-platform web/desktop/\n  mobile/extensions support. Reality is web-first React DOM with\n  platform-detection helpers. Stale keywords (react-native, tauri, expo,\n  chrome-extension, oklch, cross-platform, popup-layout) removed.\n- AGENTS.md provider order now matches cookbook + llms.txt: ThemeProvider >\n  ToastProvider (sibling) + ConfirmProvider (wraps children).\n- package.json files: now includes AGENTS.md and skills/ so both ship in\n  the npm tarball (README tells agents to read AGENTS.md first — it wasn''t\n  shipping).\n\nCleanup\n- pages/ directory removed (487MB bloomneo.github.io nested subproject,\n  git-ignored, never shipped, no references from build).\n\nAll 74 public-surface tests green; tsc --noEmit clean; check:docs +\ncheck:anchors green; dist/ rebuilt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3885c402c0df0e6da38e17f0f8908cb0789cbde6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/3885c402c0df0e6da38e17f0f8908cb0789cbde6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGI3MGIzMDY2OWFmMzliNWQyNjU4MzAzM2Q5MDVhZDM2ODFmOGQwZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3","sha":"1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3"}],"sha":"b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/b70b30669af39b5d26583033d905ad3681f8d0fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T15:43:14Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T15:43:14Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix(agents): wire providers in templates, correct foucScript docs, tag version\n\nScaffolded apps now mount ConfirmProvider + ToastProvider so useConfirm()\nand toast.* work out of the box. AGENTS.md replaces the invalid\nindex.html pseudo-import with real Next.js and Vite setup patterns.\nSKILL.md gains a version tag so agents can detect drift between the\ninstalled skill and the package.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c4c74a5987f0a0ad890814d8cd42c3de9b34c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/7c4c74a5987f0a0ad890814d8cd42c3de9b34c58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDE2NDVhMTgxMGQ3ZmI3Njg0MGZjZTRlMDg4NDcxZjAwZjkyZTJiZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e","sha":"146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e"}],"sha":"1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1645a1810d7fb76840fce4e088471f00f92e2be3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T14:13:36Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T14:13:36Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"feat(templates): flat imports, ship agent skill, fix build-breakers\n\nScaffolded apps now land clean and agent-ready. Verified: `npm run\nbuild` (tsc + vite) passes on single/spa/multi/fbca; `uikit generate\npage/component/feature` produce compiling code.\n\n- Flat `@bloomneo/uikit` imports across all 5 templates (single, spa,\n  multi, fbca, generate) — matches the canonical one-way rule.\n- Ship `.claude/skills/bloomneo-uikit/` (SKILL + theming + new\n  scaffolding sub-rule) via CLI in every user-facing template;\n  taught bin/commands/create.js to copy .claude/ to project root.\n- Drop UIKIT_{CLI,COMPOSITE_UI_SYSTEM,LLM,THEME}_GUIDE.md from\n  template docs (~13K lines of drifted duplicates that taught the\n  opposite import pattern). Canonical refs live in node_modules +\n  shipped skill. QUICKSTART remains for humans.\n\nBuild-breakers fixed along the way (pre-existing):\n- multi/Login: `Github` was removed from lucide-react; replaced\n  with inline SVG (shadcn pattern).\n- fbca: vite.config imported plugin-react-swc but package.json\n  installed plugin-react — aligned to plugin-react.\n- single/spa/multi tsconfig.node.json missing composite:true and\n  had noEmit:true, breaking `tsc` project references.\n- single App: unused `setMode` destructure.\n- spa App: unused `item` parameter in handleNavigation.\n- fbca page-router: `process.env.NODE_ENV` (Node-only global) →\n  `import.meta.env.DEV` (Vite-idiomatic, properly typed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d33ebae5e488a7e8155b881326a053843595f3a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/d33ebae5e488a7e8155b881326a053843595f3a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDE0NmU3N2Q1ZmE2ZDU4YTU3ZGFmOGFiZjk5MmRmZGMwNjA1Y2I5NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c","sha":"1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c"}],"sha":"146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/146e77d5fa6d58a57daf8abf992dfdc0605cb94e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T10:13:00Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T10:13:00Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"fix(cookbook): remove inline providers, document app-root assumption\n\nAll 5 cookbook recipes previously mounted <ToastProvider /> and/or\n<ConfirmProvider> inline in their export. Copying a recipe into an app\nthat already mounts these at root (as it should) would trip UIKit''s\nduplicate-mount warnInDev guard and produce doubled behavior in prod.\n\nFix: recipes now assume providers are mounted at app root (the correct\npattern). Each recipe file leads with a comment stating the assumption.\ncookbook/README.md gains a \"Prerequisite: app-root providers\" section\nwith the canonical setup snippet.\n\nChanges per file:\n- login.tsx: drop <ToastProvider />, drop fragment wrapper\n- settings.tsx: drop <ToastProvider />, drop fragment wrapper\n- crud-page.tsx: drop <ConfirmProvider>/<ToastProvider />, flatten\n  UserListInner helper into CrudPageRecipe (removes one indirection)\n- delete-flow.tsx: drop <ConfirmProvider>/<ToastProvider />, flatten\n  DeleteResource helper into DeleteFlowRecipe\n- dashboard.tsx: add assumption comment (uses no providers, no code change)\n- README.md: add setup snippet, add \"Needs\" column to recipe table\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdf13998cf9069674e89a3ae34eaf7f34c124f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/fdf13998cf9069674e89a3ae34eaf7f34c124f6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKDFjMzExNDA0OGRhZGNhZDY3N2ZiYWFlNTA1OTM4YmRiOTMwNzIxNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab","sha":"a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab"}],"sha":"1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/1c3114048dadcad677fbaae505938bdb9307215c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T10:03:18Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T10:03:18Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"feat: Claude Skill package + theming sub-rule + AGENTS.md setup fix\n\n- skills/bloomneo-uikit/SKILL.md: Claude Skill with YAML front-matter\n  (name, description, allowed-tools) so Cursor/Claude Code auto-invoke\n  it when @bloomneo/uikit is a project dependency. Consolidates critical\n  rules, controlled-prop cheat sheet, Incorrect/Correct pairs, component\n  selection table, CLI reference, and workflow.\n\n- skills/bloomneo-uikit/rules/theming.md: focused sub-rule for theme\n  generation and customization — OKLCH primer, 29-variable contract,\n  custom theme CLI workflow, dark-mode lightening rule, 6 Incorrect/\n  Correct pairs, FBCA paths, theming troubleshooting. Addresses the\n  highest-risk agent workflow not covered by per-component JSDoc.\n\n- AGENTS.md: fix broken setup example. ThemeProvider prop was\n  `defaultTheme` (nonexistent) — should be `theme` + `mode`. ToastProvider\n  was wrapping children — it''s self-closing and sits as a sibling to\n  ConfirmProvider. Now matches llms.txt and cursor rules.\n\nModeled on shadcn/ui''s skills/shadcn/ pattern (SKILL.md + rules/*.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa8337a7e0127357748cc3b3d40bc3ee771c6d52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/fa8337a7e0127357748cc3b3d40bc3ee771c6d52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGE1ZjM0MzFkMzMxMTRlNjNmNjdiOGYwYTgxN2ZlYjk2MzBjZmFhYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/cc46a1d1a621b110ba79527144c1ebdbf55f79a2","sha":"cc46a1d1a621b110ba79527144c1ebdbf55f79a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/cc46a1d1a621b110ba79527144c1ebdbf55f79a2"}],"sha":"a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/a5f3431d33114e63f67b8f0a817feb9630cfaaab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/commits/cc46a1d1a621b110ba79527144c1ebdbf55f79a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T04:55:13Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T04:55:13Z","email":"kt@voilacode.com","name":"Krishna Teja"},"message":"feat: agent-clarity v3 — prop cheat sheet, duplicate guards, common mistakes, Radix/custom labels\n\nFive targeted improvements to make uikit even clearer for AI coding agents:\n\n1. Controlled prop cheat sheet in llms.txt — 18-row table mapping every\n   stateful component to its exact value prop, change handler, and handler\n   signature. Disambiguates Radix `onValueChange`/`onCheckedChange` vs\n   custom Combobox `onChange` vs native Input `onChange`.\n\n2. Duplicate-mount runtime guards on ConfirmProvider and ToastProvider.\n   Module-level flag + useEffect fires warnInDev when mounted twice —\n   previously a silent failure.\n\n3. \"Common mistakes and fixes\" table in AGENTS.md — 10 symptom/fix rows\n   covering DataTable undefined, Select vs Combobox handler confusion,\n   missing ThemeProvider, bare Input without FormField, etc.\n\n4. DataTable `data: T[]` already disallows undefined at TS level plus\n   runtime guard in place — verified, no change needed.\n\n5. Radix vs custom component labels on every component file:\n   - 20 Radix wrappers get `@llm-rule NOTE: Radix wrapper — props pass through`\n   - 6 custom components get `@llm-rule NOTE: Custom component — …` with\n     library attribution (react-day-picker, cmdk, sonner, react-hook-form)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35b55ed8ced3fa2fe3f9ff478c7bf292b83f88cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/35b55ed8ced3fa2fe3f9ff478c7bf292b83f88cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/cc46a1d1a621b110ba79527144c1ebdbf55f79a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/cc46a1d1a621b110ba79527144c1ebdbf55f79a2","node_i