o use the component\n- @llm-rule AVOID: what NOT to use it for (with correct alternative)\n- @llm-rule NOTE: controlled/uncontrolled API, nesting rules, variants\n- @see link to canonical llms.txt documentation\n\nMatches the appkit annotation pattern for consistent agent experience\nacross the @bloomneo ecosystem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11bf83435e1c48aadd2e3f71e914e09fcbd6ab52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/trees/11bf83435e1c48aadd2e3f71e914e09fcbd6ab52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bloomneo/uikit/git/commits/e344d7d8e73b3e0dc1763fff3cb286d788c4245c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127661911?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ktvoilacode","id":127661911,"login":"ktvoilacode","node_id":"U_kgDOB5v3Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktvoilacode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/e344d7d8e73b3e0dc1763fff3cb286d788c4245c","node_id":"C_kwDOR_kgPdoAKGUzNDRkN2Q4ZTczYjNlMGRjMTc2M2ZmZjNjYjI4NmQ3ODhjNDI0NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bloomneo/uikit/commit/089b05edc13c9045f1a9c8067764f761d