b.com/ZeroStack","id":5520338,"login":"ZeroStack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjAzMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commits/3bc6dc0a61741c602a49e81aa3bca6201c058c99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T19:48:17Z","email":"zerostack@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zerostack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T19:48:17Z","email":"zerostack@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zerostack"},"message":"The [`docs/debugging/ultimate-debugging-prompt.md`](docs/debugging/ultimate-debugging-prompt.md) has been updated with mandatory instructions for the AI agent to save all debugging findings.\n\n## What Was Added (lines 629-738)\n\n### Mandatory Save Instruction\nThe prompt now explicitly instructs AI agents to:\n1. **Create or update** `docs/debugging/debugging-findings.md`\n2. **Structure findings by priority**: P0 → P1 → P2 → P3\n3. **Include for each finding**: file path with line number, description, severity, evidence, recommended fix, and status\n4. **Include a summary table** at the top with counts by severity\n5. **Preserve existing findings** (append, don''t overwrite)\n6. **Update status** of resolved findings\n\n### Findings File Template Included\nA complete markdown template is provided in the prompt that the AI agent should use, including:\n- Header with metadata (date, investigator, related bug)\n- Summary table (Severity | Count | Open | Resolved)\n- Four priority sections (P0 Critical, P1 High, P2 Medium, P3 Low)\n- Structured finding template with all required fields\n\n## How to Use\n1. Open Kilo Code in debug mode\n2. Copy the entire content of [`docs/debugging/ultimate-debugging-prompt.md`](docs/debugging/ultimate-debugging-prompt.md)\n3. Paste it as your prompt\n4. The AI agent will follow the debugging phases AND save all findings to `docs/debugging/debugging-findings.md`","tree":{"sha":"bf5a345940de6dbbcb45a0a15b1101c21991c6a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/git/trees/bf5a345940de6dbbcb45a0a15b1101c21991c6a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/git/commits/3bc6dc0a61741c602a49e81aa3bca6201c058c99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5520338?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZeroStack","id":5520338,"login":"ZeroStack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjAzMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commit/3bc6dc0a61741c602a49e81aa3bca6201c058c99","node_id":"C_kwDOR_lC99oAKDNiYzZkYzBhNjE3NDFjNjAyYTQ5ZTgxYWEzYmNhNjIwMWMwNThjOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commit/e8b35b34ed2a8c7639a51c717b1b8fd9545af8