_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commits/74fc7f90355c775da73ec19cc34a014e88a5f6e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T16:55:08Z","email":"zerostack@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zerostack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T16:55:08Z","email":"zerostack@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zerostack"},"message":"## Advanced Model Filtering — Complete ✅\n\nThe advanced filter panel is now live in the **left sidebar model browser** (the `models/` MFE that loads in the left sidebar).\n\n### What Changed\n\n**3 files modified in the `models/` MFE:**\n\n| File | Changes |\n|------|---------|\n| [`models/src/app/services/model-registry.service.ts`](models/src/app/services/model-registry.service.ts) | Replaced basic API mapping with `mapApiModelToAIModel()` for enriched data. Added `filterState` signal, `showFilters` signal, `filteredModels` computed, `providerGroups` computed, and 10+ filter mutation methods. Enriched fallback models with pricing, capabilities, speed tiers, and categories. |\n| [`models/src/app/components/model-browser/model-browser.component.ts`](models/src/app/components/model-browser/model-browser.component.ts) | Added full filter panel UI between search and model list: capability toggles, category chips, context window presets, speed tier buttons, provider chips, sort dropdown. Wired all inputs/outputs to the registry service. |\n| [`models/src/app/components/model-search/model-search.component.ts`](models/src/app/components/model-search/model-search.component.ts) | Added filter toggle button with active filter count badge, result count display, and \"Clear filters\" link. |\n\n### Filter Dimensions Available\n\n| Filter | UI Control | Description |\n|--------|-----------|-------------|\n| 🔍 **Text search** | Debounced input (150ms) | Searches id, name, provider, description |\n| 👁 **Vision** | Toggle pill | Models with image/vision capability |\n| 🔧 **Tools** | Toggle pill | Function calling support |\n| 📋 **JSON** | Toggle pill | JSON mode support |\n| 🧠 **Thinking** | Toggle pill | Reasoning/thinking models |\n| ⚡ **Streaming** | Toggle pill | Streaming support |\n| 🌐 **Browser** | Toggle pill | Web browsing tools |\n| 💻 **Top Coding** | Category chip | Curated top coding agents |\n| 🧠 **Top Reasoning** | Category chip | Curated top reasoning models |\n| 💰 **Budget** | Category chip | Cost-effective models |\n| 📏 **Context** | Preset buttons | 8K+, 32K+, 128K+, 200K+, 1M+ |\n| 🏎 **Speed** | Radio buttons | Any, Fast, Medium, Slow |\n| 🏢 **Provider** | Multi-select chips | Filter by provider with colored dots |\n| 📊 **Sort** | Dropdown | Name, Price ↑↓, Context ↓, Speed ↓, Provider |\n\n### Build Status\n- ✅ `nx build models` — passes\n- ✅ `nx build shell` — passes (includes models MFE dependency)\n\n### Shared Utilities (reused from previous work)\n- [`libs/shared/models/src/lib/model-metadata.ts`](libs/shared/models/src/lib/model-metadata.ts) — Curated model lookup tables\n- [`libs/shared/models/src/lib/model-mapper.ts`](libs/shared/models/src/lib/model-mapper.ts) — API response → enriched `AIModel` mapper\n- [`libs/shared/models/src/lib/model-filter.utils.ts`](libs/shared/models/src/lib/model-filter.utils.ts) — Pure filter/sort/count functions\n- [`libs/shared/models/src/lib/interfaces.ts`](libs/shared/models/src/lib/interfaces.ts) — Extended `AIModel` + `ModelFilter` types","tree":{"sha":"025489309272f6ab89bfc330db417550f3d50741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/git/trees/025489309272f6ab89bfc330db417550f3d50741"},"url":"https://