"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commits/e52936df075bc7dc54b2056eb4e50198864c285b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T09:05:33Z","email":"zerostack@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zerostack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T09:05:33Z","email":"zerostack@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zerostack"},"message":"feat: rebrand UI to Kilo Gateway Chat with mobile-responsive layout and enhanced features\n\nRebrand from \"Polyglot AI\" / \"pgai\" prefix to \"Kilo Gateway Chat\" / \"app\" prefix\nacross all shell, chat, models, and params microfrontends and shared libraries.\n\nKey changes:\n\n- UI/UX overhaul: dark theme redesign matching kilo-chat.html reference with\n  glass morphism surfaces, violet accent palette, and polished typography\n- Mobile responsive: add sidebar overlay, mobile detection via HostListener,\n  collapsible sidebars with slide animations, and hide-on-mobile utilities\n- Module Federation fixes: use ''./'' prefix in expose paths, switch remote\n  entry routes to `export default` with `m.default` consumption in host\n- Chat enhancements: welcome screen, token usage display with detail dropdown,\n  prompt enhance workflow with revert/original support, clear chat, system\n  prompt prepend, and max_tokens capping at 128k\n- Model registry: fetch from /api/models with provider color coding, grouped\n  display with collapsible sections, skeleton loading states, and fallback data\n- Params dashboard: tabbed UI (presets/basic/advanced), rich preset cards with\n  emoji and tags, info tooltips on sliders, seed/stop/response_format controls,\n  system prompt textarea, and stream toggle\n- New components: ApiKeyModalComponent, ModelsModalComponent, ToastService\n- Gateway: inject KILO_API_KEY server-side when no Authorization header present\n- Build: add webpack watchOptions to ignore .nx-data/dist/.angular cache dirs,\n  add proxy.conf.json for shell dev server, fix tsconfig paths with ''./'' prefix\n- Styles: add 400+ lines of global CSS for surfaces, range sliders, toggles,\n  toasts, markdown content, code blocks, modals, and sidebar transitions","tree":{"sha":"8b2c24c5cf9f48e27a66e7a9302ed2659ba1d5e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/git/trees/8b2c24c5cf9f48e27a66e7a9302ed2659ba1d5e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/git/commits/e52936df075bc7dc54b2056eb4e50198864c285b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5520338?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZeroStack","id":5520338,"login":"ZeroStack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjAzMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZeroStack","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commit/e52936df075bc7dc54b2056eb4e50198864c285b","node_id":"C_kwDOR_lC99oAKGU1MjkzNmRmMDc1YmM3ZGM1NGIyMDU2ZWI0ZTUwMTk4ODY0YzI4NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aiEmployee-eu/polyglot-ai/commit/b29ece56d89c841a1c28dbd62dc5be687f1a59ff","sha":"b29ece56d89c841a1c28dbd62dc5be687f1a59ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aiEmplo