0-08T22:34:58.840Z","repositoryId":1207791438,"sha":"fcdd7bdfb335d22b7f02cf0669798b57efc6627a"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:58.840Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/eb44c47afb462b838827c90860967dcd7fcb9336/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:58:18Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:58:18Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Group Quote Builder stops reloading over unsaved edits; groups list keeps groups being redone\n\nThe builder reloaded from the saved quotes whenever the fee defaults object\nchanged, and the defaults were refetched on every profile refresh (token\nrenewal) — so typed figures could snap back to what was saved. Defaults now\nload once per user, the builder never reloads once anything is typed, and\nleaving with unsaved changes asks first.\n\nThe Groups list hid any group whose quotes were all deleted, which made MRG\nvanish mid-redo. Only Delete Group removes a group now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3370bf1fc9e65ace3a80c03128ff87d9ad2e551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/f3370bf1fc9e65ace3a80c03128ff87d9ad2e551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/eb44c47afb462b838827c90860967dcd7fcb9336","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/eb44c47afb462b838827c90860967dcd7fcb9336","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKGViNDRjNDdhZmI0NjJiODM4ODI3YzkwODYwOTY3ZGNkN2ZjYjkzMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/e0d6f1005c9af2d42acc3fcc95e4a0810a42191f","sha":"e0d6f1005c9af2d42acc3fcc95e4a0810a42191f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/e0d6f1005c9af2d42acc3fcc95e4a0810a42191f"}],"sha":"eb44c47afb462b838827c90860967dcd7fcb9336","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/eb