s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/98ea71bb06d5158cd057cfc5399913dc58719f04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:04:12Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:04:12Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Quotes from the Group Quote Builder open in Edit with their inputs\n\nThe builder saved only £ lines, so the individual quote form opened them with\nevery section blank. It now also writes the *_detail fields the form reads\n(accounts, directors, bookkeeping, payroll, management accounts, review\nmeetings, CFO), with rates refitted wherever an override or discount means the\ndrivers alone don''t reproduce the line. VAT and MTD take their returns-per-year\nfrom the builder''s inputs instead of assuming quarterly.\n\nThe builder now reads the detail fields over its own stored inputs, and always\nre-derives overrides from the saved lines, so an individual edit made since\nshows through.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cada39375e4b71f6cc73763a5d9e9d03a9472d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/3cada39375e4b71f6cc73763a5d9e9d03a9472d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/98ea71bb06d5158cd057cfc5399913dc58719f04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: