"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/1395eec3e1e7a51fdb92bb14531398fed22f47c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:23:46Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:23:46Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Group Quote Builder remembers its inputs\n\nSaving from the builder stored only the £ lines, so reopening it showed every\ndriver blank and every figure as a bare override. Each quote now carries the\ndrivers and overrides it was built from (quotes.builder_inputs, sql/356) and\nthe builder reads them back. Services absent from the quote open at £0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68432d47764859fe93ba0c53add8016037c09559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/68432d47764859fe93ba0c53add8016037c09559"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/1395eec3e1e7a51fdb92bb14531398fed22f47c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/1395eec3e1e7a51fdb92bb14531398fed22f47c9","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDEzOTVlZWMzZTFlN2E1MWZkYjkyYmIxNDUzMTM5OGZlZDIyZjQ3Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d","sha":"792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d"}],"sha":"1395eec3e1e7a51fdb92bb14531398fed22f47c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/1395eec3e1e7a51fdb92bb14531398fed22f47c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:21:08Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:21:08Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Group page: \"Edit Group Quote\" once quotes exist; Export PDF styled like its neighbours\n\nThe builder already reopens saved quotes for editing, but the button still\nread \"Build Group Quote\", so it looked like a way to start again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"884bf138a24900080515bbfa05338a2b3003fe04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/884bf138a24900080515bbfa05338a2b3003fe04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDc5MmU4NmViMDlmMjA1ZGExMTQxNWMyNDQ4Y2EyNTY5YWFlNmQ1MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/834fd2e073b7835f15eaef807ec1618a43ce2c1d","sha":"834fd2e073b7835f15eaef807ec1618a43ce2c1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/834fd2e073b7835f15eaef807ec1618a43ce2c1d"}],"sha":"792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/792e86eb09f205da11415c2448ca2569aae6d50d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/834fd2e073b7835f15eaef807ec1618a43ce2c1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:18:05Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:18:05Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Group quote: opt-in services start at £0 for clients with no quote yet\n\nBuilding a fresh group quote switched on every driverless service for every\nclient, so Sole Trader Accounts (£450), Auto-Enrolment (£60) and MTD (£140)\nlanded on limited companies nobody ticked. Now a Ltd starts with Accounts & CT\nand Confirmation Statement only; a sole trader with their own accounts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b7a5250a052ef863cbeda87aa6f91b41b229b9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/6b7a5250a052ef863cbeda87aa6f91b41b229b9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/834fd2e073b7835f15eaef807ec1618a43ce2c1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/834fd2e073b7835f15eaef807ec1618a43ce2c1d","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDgzNGZkMmUwNzNiNzgzNWYxNWVhZWY4MDdlYzE2MThhNDNjZTJjMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/d0028b20e4faf5afb405df7faeaeb299dd9ffcb3","sha":"d0028b20e4faf5afb405df7faeaeb299dd9ffcb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/d0028b20e4faf5afb405df7fae