","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/b4f9137253b866972157b2caf0ecc2e2b1914f3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:17:25Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:17:25Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Billing: approving and pushing invoices is for billing approvers only\n\nStaff & Permissions already had Billing → Submitter / Approver (can_approve_billing),\nbut nothing enforced it: billing_items'' update policy let any billing user set\nstatus = ''approved'', and the push edge functions only checked \"is staff\".\n\n- sql/353: triggers on billing_items and live_billing refuse approval (status,\n  approved_by/at, recurring approval_status, go-live approval) unless the caller\n  is an approver, service_role or a no-JWT session. A submitter can still send an\n  approved bill back to draft but not change its figures. Carve-out: the fixed\n  £20 + VAT Companies House ID-check invoice raised by the CH codes flow.\n- qbo-push, qbo-push-billing-items, qbo-push-recurring: a live push (and\n  assign_numbers) needs can_approve_billing; dry runs and read modes don''t.\n  Deployed as v43, v36, v17.\n- Billing, Recurring review and Fee uplift pages hide Approve / Push for\n  non-approvers and show \"Awaiting approval\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"