","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/493ae92e8586c4f244f2c64d1868d3cf0250eb81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:20:04Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:20:04Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Priority: expedite placement applies to self assessment too\n\nOnly the YE+3 month floor is accounts-only; an expedited client is placed\njust below the last job near its deadline on either board.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"001a46baaa8d7292626d5861a5a33bb4c53de2ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/001a46baaa8d7292626d5861a5a33bb4c53de2ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/493ae92e8586c4f244f2c64d1868d3cf0250eb81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/493ae92e8586c4f244f2c64d1868d3cf0250eb81","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDQ5M2FlOTJlODU4NmM0ZjI0NGYyYzY0ZDE4NjhkM2NmMDI1MGViODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/2bc2a175d53c23c463b81169445bd63f989077e1","sha":"2bc2a175d53c23c463b81169445bd63f989077e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/2bc2a175d53c23c463b81169445bd63f989077e1"}],"sha":"493ae92e8586c4f244f2c64d1868d3cf0250eb81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/493ae92e8586c4f244f2c64d1868d3cf0250eb81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/2bc2a175d53c23c463b81169445bd63f989077e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:17:38Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:17:38Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Priority: SA split (directors follow their company), deprioritise, 3-6 month target, expedite\n\nSelf assessment (sql/351): directors of a current company client ride with\nthe company''s accounts internal review date and aren''t dragged; everyone\nelse is a draggable sole-trader queue (a director whose company is done\ngoes to its top). A director''s return waits while any other-income item is\noutstanding: personal items on a company''s records request are tagged to a\ndirector in the picker and land in sa_income_items, ticked received from\nthe tile menu or the task modal (\"Other income…\").\n\nDeprioritise / Back in the queue on the tile menu: the existing client flag\n(Ready Now, Job Selector), now written through job-plan with a line in\nentity_priority_log; deprioritised jobs leave the queue and the email.\n\nAccounts target window (sql/352, settings on Scheduled Jobs): reviews not\nbefore YE+3 months, \"Behind target\" after YE+6 months. Expedited clients\nwhose year end has passed skip the floor and go just below the last job\nwithin 30 days of its deadline, never above it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d8373d00461f39f1837a4b661a6139df194aeb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/5d8373d00461f39f1837a4b661a6139df194aeb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/2bc2a175d53c23c463b81169445bd63f989077e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"