"id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/8069da92602655ac0bc7f3f941a01b3c10ea65e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:35:56Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:35:56Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Duplicate people: blocked pairs can be merged with a reason, and say what links them\n\nA blocked pair (names differ) had no way through the screen, yet a name\nchange looks exactly like one: Laura Wright -> Laura Clark shares BM ref\nWRIGL01, CH code, email and birth month. \"Same person (name changed) —\nmerge\" now asks why, stores it (sql/342 decision_note on the review row),\nthen merges.\n\nThe import''s block_reason claimed \"same person reference\", but the absorbed\nrow never has one; the only link is a shared client, which is usually an\nold contact BM has replaced (Protective Paint Coatings: Callum Alldridge vs\nBenjamin Devlin). The chip now says which case it is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fba58ba0d59c0683c6be332847efaf355ed214c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/9fba58ba0d59c0683c6be332847efaf355ed214c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/8069da92602655ac0bc7f3f941a01b3c10ea65e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"