XG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/321b7ec32061dd5a631b45dda149dfb29f1db0f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:18:42Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:18:42Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"CH-code escalations notify; a screen for the BM duplicate-people queue\n\nEscalate used to set escalation_status and nothing else: reminders stopped,\nthe person left the Wednesday call list, and the only trace was a Monday\nemail line worded like a plain \"call needed\". Two had sat since 19 Aug.\n\n- sql/341: trigger on ch_code_requests notifies the chaser''s owners\n  (ch_code_chase_config.weekly_recipient_ids, else portal admins) the\n  moment a chase is escalated, from any write path; backfills the two\n  standing escalations.\n- ch-code-weekly v12: escalations sort above everything, in red, \"since\"\n  their date; call_needed is worded as its own rung.\n- Data Import > Duplicate people: the bm_person_merge_review queue had\n  RPCs but no screen, so 66 proposed merges (Andrew McGowan among them)\n  were never applied. One decision per row: Merge, or Not the same person.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fc50442f772d89486482ad41742b5be99a2660f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/8fc50442f772d89486482ad41742b5