te":"2026-09-27T17:28:13Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Payroll: tax year label (2026/27, not 2026/##), imported ticks dated by period, filter on any column header (sql/337)\n\n- payroll_periods.tax_year overflowed to ''##''; fixed in the data and in\n  the sql/333 expression for future clones.\n- Imported ticks and notes took the insert time as \"at\", so the sheet\n  read as if the runner had ticked two years of history tonight. They are\n  now dated at the end of their period and shown as \"from the spreadsheet\".\n- Every column header filters like the spreadsheet: click for the values\n  with counts, tick what to keep. A filtered header turns blue with a\n  funnel, and a chip in the bar says how many filters are on and clears\n  them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"477f7a3a79d539a423d880ec9727cc8e1721f36d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/477f7a3a79d539a423d880ec9727cc8e1721f36d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/f383bedc9850a926e21bb2ebf2d65a3a420fc6d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/f383bedc9850a926e21bb2ebf2d65a3a420fc6d5","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKGYzODNiZWRjOTg1MGE5MjZlMjFiYjJlYmYyZDY1YTNhNDIwZmM2ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/66e6307208ad060f77540911143ea6a5866d0ff9","sha":"66e6307208ad060f77540911143ea6a5866d0ff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/66e6307208ad060f77540911143ea6a5866d0ff9"}],"sha":"f383bedc9850a926e21bb2ebf2d65a3a420fc6d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/f383bedc9850a926e21bb2ebf2d65a3a420fc6d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/66e6307208ad060f77540911143ea6a5866d0ff9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:23:04Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:23:04Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Payroll: weekly side re-seeded from the right sheet; client modal; notes can be retired (sql/336)\n\n- The weekly workbook has two tabs out of order in 2024/25, which made the\n  parser bump the tax year twice and treat a 2024/25 sheet as the latest.\n  Runners, covers, pay days and the whole weekly history were wrong. The\n  parser now only starts a new tax year when the week number really\n  wraps; the weekly clients (20) and their ticks and notes were re-seeded\n  from week 26 of 2026/27, keeping today''s hand links. Every payroll\n  client''s name now mirrors its Athena client.\n- Clicking a payroll opens a centred modal, not a side panel.\n- Notes are for live updates: Retire takes a note off the sheet (kept,\n  restorable); the grid counts live notes only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1ca337910eee2e5cc91e0f8525db01f90517841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/f1ca337910eee2e5cc91e0f8525db01f90517841"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/66e6307208ad060f77540911143ea6a5866d0ff9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/