url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/f7efde2c31044b03d0332b82c474f0d28c882c01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:10:45Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:10:45Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Data Import: task-type ticks apply at Import, and say what they close\n\nUnticking a task type used to save to app_settings on the click, and on\nthe next import the disappearance sweep marked every planned Athena task\nof that type completed, raising a \"completed with no time\" flag for\neach. Nothing on screen said so.\n\nTicks now change this run only and are saved when Import is pressed.\nThe panel, the Import bar and the confirm step count the planned Athena\ntasks the exclusions would close; changed types are marked, with \"Back\nto saved choices\". Tiles are titled by the prefix they actually match\n(the rule name hid that \"Self Assessment\" covers prep and submission).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed976b03d2b2647f3f15eb89eaa8e475a7d72d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/ed976b03d2b2647f3f15eb89eaa8e475a7d72d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/f7efde2c31044b03d0332b82c474f0d28c882c01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt