"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/7b704c5c7923ae05e62e838e461e0e0e9d3b2d3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:04:33Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:04:33Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"BM import: no prospect match for a client we already have (sql/336)\n\nmatch_bm_prospects offered BM''s Riverbank Commercial (CLUB01) as a\nconversion of the prospect \"Agn Commercial\" on a 52% name match. CLUB01\nis already an active client, and a name-only match blocks Import until\nsomeone clicks, so it was a forced click on every import for a match\nthat can never be right.\n\nThe name-only step now skips a row whose BM reference or company number\nalready belongs to a non-prospect entity. Company-number and reference\nmatches are unchanged (both unique on entities).\n\nAlso moves the reference-change migration back to sql/334, the name it\nwas applied under: Payroll renumbered its own file to 335 at the same\nmoment this one moved to 335.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b063ba9cb328730c6190f06c4c600be377a07d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/b063ba9cb328730c6190f06c4c600be377a07d8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/7b704c5c7923ae05e62e838e461e0e0e9d3b2d3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://