om>","tree":{"sha":"e73c9c939abaddbf33c0a14c908e04039684d560","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/e73c9c939abaddbf33c0a14c908e04039684d560"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/75d574df23d7af17b52ec56cedb1e472049f431e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/75d574df23d7af17b52ec56cedb1e472049f431e","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDc1ZDU3NGRmMjNkN2FmMTdiNTJlYzU2Y2VkYjFlNDcyMDQ5ZjQzMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574","sha":"df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574"}],"sha":"75d574df23d7af17b52ec56cedb1e472049f431e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/75d574df23d7af17b52ec56cedb1e472049f431e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:42:54Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:42:54Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Data Import: stepped layout, Import bar pinned in view, nothing hidden\n\nThe import screen buried its one real action under every panel, hid the\nfindings that change what an import does behind folded audit logs and\ntext links, and used its own ghost-link button style.\n\n- Upload -> Review -> Import steps across the top; BM export\n  instructions beside the drop zone instead of behind \"Pull export\".\n- \"Check the file\" shows it is working and says nothing is written yet.\n- Review leads with \"Check before importing\": prospect matches (now\n  worded as Convert prospect / Keep separate, with why it matched),\n  reference changes, departures; for tasks the unknown clients,\n  unmapped assignees (mapped inline, no expander) and missing rules.\n- \"Won''t import\" rows always on screen; skipped tasks name their client.\n- Client warnings grouped by cause and visible, not a folded audit log.\n- Ignored references that still carry BM tasks are named, and no longer\n  counted in \"To check\" while being hidden from the panel.\n- The Import bar sticks to the bottom of the screen: what will happen,\n  what blocks it (with Show me), then an inline \"Yes, import\" confirm.\n- Every button uses the shared BTN styles; table names (\"entities\",\n  \"bm_task_schedule\") replaced with clients / tasks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"826dc9b6c74f4ece0322f6430743306b724a3689","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/826dc9b6c74f4ece0322f6430743306b724a3689"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKGRmNzMwNDdkYmVjZTcwZDhhNzZmZjJhYWIxMWEwODhjNjkyZDk1NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/4a03a0f8c04282b5a394a2ddeb04e9ebcbbf789d","sha":"4a03a0f8c04282b5a394a2ddeb04e9ebcbbf789d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/4a03a0f8c04282b5a394a2ddeb04e9ebcbbf789d"}],"sha":"df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/df73047dbece70d8a76ff2aab11a088c692d9574"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/4a03a0f8c04282b5a394a2ddeb04e9ebcbbf789d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:28:51Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:28:51Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"BM import: a changed Internal Reference is not a departure (sql/334)\n\nBrightManager re-referenced two clients (LITT01 -> LMG001, GLAM001 ->\nLTVAC001) with their company numbers unchanged. The client import read\nthat as two clients leaving and two arriving: the incoming rows failed on\nentities_company_number_uniq and the old ones were offered for archiving,\nticked by default. Approving would have archived both live clients and\nimported neither.\n\nThe preview now asks preview_bm_ref_changes which would-be archive\ncandidates are in the upload under a new reference (same company number;\nor, with no company number either side, the same name and type). They\nshow in their own panel, company-number matches ticked, and never appear\nas archive candidates. On approve, rekey_bm_clients moves each ticked\nclient to its new reference before the upsert, so the upsert updates the\nexisting client. A new reference already taken is refused, not forced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b20f11d1a254677f928a0498e036cb50bfffb3b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/b20f11d1a254677f928a0498e036cb50bfffb3b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/4a03a0f8c04282b5a394a2ddeb04e9ebcbbf789d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":fa