gallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:56:59Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Payroll: a payroll client is always an Athena client\n\nNo free-text names. The grid shows the linked client''s name; the drawer\npicks the client and cannot save without one; the edge function refuses a\ncreate without entity_id and sets the name from the entity. 14 of the 20\nunlinked rows linked by hand today; the rest are being worked through.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6726a097ec68f3dd6eeae4a0458ba7c1bdb2b454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/6726a097ec68f3dd6eeae4a0458ba7c1bdb2b454"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/23915e3c264e9b5a8c9d5c27c061e22181a83b02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/23915e3c264e9b5a8c9d5c27