tax week 27).\n- payroll_clients: one row per payroll client with pay date, cut-off,\n  runner, cover, pay type, batch flag, not-applicable steps and the\n  standing note held once. Linked to the Athena client and the BrightPay\n  employer where the names matched (106 of 126); the rest link from the\n  drawer.\n- payroll_periods: tax weeks and months 2023/24 to 2027/28.\n- payroll_ticks: done / n/a per client, period and step, with who and\n  when. payroll_period_notes for the period''s notes.\n- payroll-tracker edge function does all writes; the browser reads.\n- PayrollView: Weekly / Monthly / Controls sheets, period picker, tall\n  wrapped headers with frozen client and pay-date columns, rows grouped\n  by pay date and Batch, click cycles a cell open → done → n/a, red when\n  past cut-off, Team chips filter to one runner, outstanding-only filter,\n  a client drawer for the once-per-client facts and period notes.\n  \"Journal posted\" is live from the journal control check via\n  payroll_journal_status(), the one definer function, gated to staff.\n  Controls is marked in development: team vs QuickBooks today, BrightPay\n  and HMRC to follow.\n- History seeded from both workbooks: 26,222 ticks and 3,919 notes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1564629dc8c6b40dd7e373eee6b8142eca58248f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/1564629dc8c6b40dd7e373eee6b8142eca58248f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/7ec0ffcd254e0076684e0eefaacd98bf802e2f65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_