d), tracker_payroll_realms() (guarded read of\n  the payroll schema), run_tracker_bank_recs_nightly() + cron 05:00 UTC, registry row.\n- dashboard-qbo-pull bank_recs metric: TransactionList filtered to reconciled,\n  latest date per account, incremental, upserts tracker_bank_recs.\n- tracker edge function: set_cell, save_line, delete_line, refresh_recs.\n- TrackerView: her columns, live cells green, typed cells edit in place, dates tint\n  by age, stale-only filter, client drawer with accounts, journal check, control\n  lines and a refresh from QuickBooks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b52ee643fffaca8b87e4e1dd871c2f2f5d5cf651","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/b52ee643fffaca8b87e4e1dd871c2f2f5d5cf651"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/7df69fed7ea7db647c60406e447eca2098f5a803","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/