ql/331: deadline override on bm_task_schedule with a BEFORE trigger,\n  like the assignee override. Editing a BM job''s due date in the task\n  modal (job-plan set_bm_deadline) sets it in Athena, raises an admin task\n  to change it in BrightManager, and the override clears itself and\n  confirms the task when an import shows BM agreeing.\n- A plan stage''s due date is editable in the modal too (move_milestone).\n- Day plan menu: Move to today, Move to <the day in view>, Reschedule… to\n  a chosen day. The hover strip gains a reschedule arrow and a comment\n  icon that opens the task with the comment box focused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a1f211a56f1faeea5a1a23d8192fbadc7ac3ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/3a1f211a56f1faeea5a1a23d8192fbadc7ac3ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/a4afcbe06e7fe65b33b2ba2e63675f367d832b41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url"