","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/a3f286493066a68a5b9210fbcc1ab5a91d890490/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:21:23Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:21:23Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Work: Job Selector in the same + New menu on every tab; Stage board opens the task modal; \"Open the workflow\"\n\n- + New is identical on every task tab: Quick task, Block, Holiday, Job\n  Selector. Tabs other than Day plan and Planner host the selector at\n  module level, defaulting to today.\n- A Stage board card opens the task modal (the next stage when the job\n  is planned, else the BM job) instead of jumping to the workflow.\n- The workflow is a button in the modal: on a stage as before, and now on\n  a BM job that belongs to a committed workflow. \"Open the plan\" is\n  \"Open the workflow\" everywhere.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"674b8fb623e116137d2a324692caa4e3496cf1cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/674b8fb623e116137d2a324692caa4e3496cf1cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/a3f286493066a68a5b9210fbcc1ab5a91d890490","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_