ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:08:58Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Work: click a job row to open it, Actions menu on the row, Log time everywhere, Reassign on plan stages\n\n- Overview drill lists: the whole row opens the task; the Open button is\n  an Actions menu with the task modal''s actions (open, open the client,\n  mark complete, log time, move to today, reassign, email).\n- Log time… on every task kind (job-plan log_time): a timesheet entry for\n  the caller against the client and service, task stays open, note on\n  the thread.\n- Reassign… on a plan stage (job-plan reassign_stage): one-off moves the\n  stage; permanent moves every pending stage of that role on the job and,\n  for the preparer, the client''s accounts preparation in BM terms via the\n  same override + allocation draft. The BM reassign body is now a shared\n  helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc3c9df7a63bb132a22a8e5f65860c3c3bfb375d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/bc3c9df7a63bb132a22a8e5f65860c3c3bfb375d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/fbeea16eccc9f096322d14ccbc27032ca3b1a72c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https:/