ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/5b21864623b40147f78eba52eb32f3ddd49cbc69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:03:43Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:03:43Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Work filter bar shows only what each tab reads; override migration renumbered to sql/330\n\nAudit of the task tabs: no view reads Status, so it is gone. Client shows\non Quick Tasks, Planner, Stage board and Completed; Service on Quick\nTasks, Blocks, Planner and Completed. Day plan keeps Team only.\n\nsql/328 clashed with a migration in flight elsewhere (now 329), so the\nassignee override is sql/330. Same content; references updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8048c486d062cf6391087cfc4767b5a56dc15592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/8048c486d062cf6391087cfc4767b5a56dc15592"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/5b21864623b40147f78eba52eb32f3ddd49cbc69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/5b21864623b40147f78eba52eb32f3ddd49cbc69","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDViMjE4NjQ2MjNiNDAxNDdmNzhlYmE1MmViMzJmM2RkZDQ5Y2JjNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/99ff4109fc36058275adee47d55e5980771b0e98","sha":"99ff4109fc36058275adee47d55e5980771b0e98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/99ff4109fc36058275adee47d55e5980771b0e98"}],"sha":"5b21864623b40147f78eba52eb32f3ddd49cbc69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/5b21864623b40147f78eba52eb32f3ddd49cbc69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/99ff4109fc36058275adee47d55e5980771b0e98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:53:10Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:53:10Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Work: Reassign a BM job (one-off or permanent), team view on Overview, one + New menu, Overview filters tidied (sql/328)\n\n- sql/328: assignee override columns on bm_task_schedule with a BEFORE\n  trigger, so a reassignment made in Athena survives the nightly import\n  and clears itself once BM agrees.\n- job-plan reassign_bm_job: one-off moves the task; permanent moves the\n  client''s tasks in the same allocation family and writes the\n  allocation_changes draft the Allocations screen would, so it lands on\n  the admin task list to be moved in BrightManager. Assignee or manager.\n- Task modal: Reassign… on a BrightManager job.\n- Overview dashboard: Task view / Team view. Team rows are people; hover\n  splits by task type; click opens their jobs grouped by type with a\n  count per type and a total. Row totals drill too.\n- One + New menu (Quick task, Block, Holiday, Jobs onto a day) on every\n  task tab; Guide stays on the Planner.\n- Overview filter bar shows only the Team chips (nothing else applied),\n  and the filter no longer snaps back to me on every return to the tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"991bf1b0657395403bfe8f5cfdce29b49bd84c08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/991bf1b0657395403bfe8f5cfdce29b49bd84c08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/99ff4109fc36058275adee47d55e5980771b0e98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followe