ccounting/athena-portal/commits/7d05796cb66371e56accc06482296c711c5e97c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:19:50Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:19:50Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Overview tiles: weeks end on Friday with the w/e date; Other tasks = NSTs + quick tasks; task list gone\n\n- This week runs from today to the coming Friday, so it shrinks a day at a\n  time and resets to seven on Saturday morning; Next week and Week after\n  next follow, each tile showing its w/e date.\n- Other tasks is the quick_tasks table: BrightManager''s non-standard tasks\n  (source bm_nst) plus tasks added in Athena. Hover for the person split,\n  click for the list, Open goes to the task.\n- The My Tasks list under the dashboard is removed from Overview; it is\n  detail, and the Quick Tasks tab still has it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b79da6eea8972b6abb39e6e9bf1a794ffdce4ec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/b79da6eea8972b6abb39e6e9bf1a794ffdce4ec4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/7d05796cb66371e56accc06482296c711c5e97c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/7d05796cb66371e56accc06482296c711c5e97c3","node_id":"C_kwDOR_1vTtoAKDdkMDU3OTZjYjY2MzcxZTU2YWNjYzA2NDgyMjk2YzcxMWM1ZTk3YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commit/fcdd7bdfb335d22b7f02cf0669798b57efc6627a","sha":"fcdd7bdfb335d22b7f02cf0669798b57efc6627a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/fcdd7bdfb335d22b7f02cf0669798b57efc6627a"}],"sha":"7d05796cb66371e56accc06482296c711c5e97c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/7d05796cb66371e56accc06482296c711c5e97c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/commits/fcdd7bdfb335d22b7f02cf0669798b57efc6627a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:06:45Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:06:45Z","email":"bobbygallacher@gmail.com","name":"Robert Gallacher"},"message":"Overview: counts are filings so they reconcile with the digest; date tiles replace the stage lists\n\n- A count is one job: for accounts, corporation tax, VAT and self assessment\n  only the \"... Submission ...\" task counts, matching v_deadline_buckets\n  (SA to 31 Jan 2027 = 254 both ways). Hours still add every task.\n- Corporation tax gets its own row instead of hiding inside Accounts.\n- Five tiles under the grid: Overdue, This week, Next week, Week after next,\n  Other tasks. Same hover split and drill as the grid. Overdue loads\n  everything still planned, not just this month''s.\n- Grid columns equal width; the 6-months column bolder.\n- The per-stage Overdue / This week / Next two weeks lists and the\n  \"Actions and quick tasks\" heading are gone, with their dead code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"979867221677155660627f005fd44e394f0f89fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/trees/979867221677155660627f005fd44e394f0f89fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/almondvalleyaccounting/athena-portal/git/commits/fcdd7bdfb335d22b7f02cf0669798b57efc6627a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270166685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DXG3/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DXG3","id":270166685,"login":"DXG3","node_id":"U_kgDOEBpqnQ",