rker and CSV localise headers, title,\nsheet and enum values. Status colours stay keyed by the raw value.","tree":{"sha":"8d13a1944d650a7f2c8a80a9431aa0c95b8e4ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/8d13a1944d650a7f2c8a80a9431aa0c95b8e4ac8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/c411d0e8254c0ef8cebce1d812a19e099b16b5d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/c411d0e8254c0ef8cebce1d812a19e099b16b5d4","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGM0MTFkMGU4MjU0YzBlZjhjZWJjZTFkODEyYTE5ZTA5OWIxNmI1ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86","sha":"e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86"}],"sha":"c411d0e8254c0ef8cebce1d812a19e099b16b5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/c411d0e8254c0ef8cebce1d812a19e099b16b5d4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T00:12:31Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T00:12:31Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(mfe-transactions): localise table status/type/category cells\n\nEnum values resolve through es/en label maps driven by the shell\nlanguage. Free-text descriptions stay as data.","tree":{"sha":"f441d3d1f7e22699bf5375c4ac9f5ef18b93e591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/f441d3d1f7e22699bf5375c4ac9f5ef18b93e591"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGUwNDFjOTJhMzU2OTM4MzA2MWY2NzkzZWYwYWY5YjdlYjFkZmRkODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f","sha":"4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f"}],"sha":"e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e041c92a3569383061f6793ef0af9b7eb1dfdd86"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:45:29Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:45:29Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"test(e2e): align specs with localised MFEs and guard the contract\n\nWith payments/transactions now following the shell language, the\nexisting specs (written when MFEs were hardcoded Spanish) had to\nassert the English defaults of the shell:\n\n- payments-mfe: expects \"International Payments\" heading.\n- transactions-mfe: expects \"Transactions\" heading.\n- transactions-filter: \"Clear\" button + \"Filtered rows\" stat card.\n- transactions-export: \"Export Excel\" button + \"Export completed.\"\n  success alert.\n\nAdded mfe-language-sync.spec.ts as a regression guard: navigates\nto /payments and /transactions, toggles the shell language, and\nasserts both MFEs re-render in Spanish.\n\nSuite remains 9/9 green (8 previous + 1 new).","tree":{"sha":"481bf31e4672073ecaec28823dd6b8605cad59b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/481bf31e4672073ecaec28823dd6b8605cad59b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDQ4MjU3NTU2NTg1MzZlNjAxNWI4NWM4OGY2MzkzZTU4NDBkZGIyOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4","sha":"684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4"}],"sha":"4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/4825755658536e6015b85c88f6393e5840ddb28f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:45:04Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:45:04Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(mfe-transactions): localise UI through a shared LanguageStore\n\nSame contract as mfe-payments (MutationObserver on <html lang>) but\nvia a single LanguageStore service injected into the 3 components\nof the MFE (root + stats + table) - one observer instead of three.\n\n- transactions.text.ts: TRANSACTIONS_I18N record keyed by ''es''|''en''.\n  The const TRANSACTIONS_TEXT is preserved as an alias of the es\n  variant so existing specs and any external consumer that compared\n  by reference keep working.\n- i18n/language.store.ts: providedIn root, owns the lone observer\n  and exposes a Signal<TxLang>. Cleans up via DestroyRef.\n- components: TRANSACTIONS_TEXT references replaced by lang-aware\n  getters/computed that read from the store. Templates untouched.","tree":{"sha":"a07d7f5ae3721523769e5ef38c12b39054743fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/a07d7f5ae3721523769e5ef38c12b39054743fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDY4NGMwMzMyYzQ5NmY3MTU4ZDZkNjkyYzI1Nzk3OTEwNmMxYTMwZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b","sha":"985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b"}],"sha":"684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/684c0332c496f7158d6d692c257979106c1a30f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:44:36Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:44:36Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(mfe-payments): localise UI by observing the shell language attribute\n\npayments was rendering hardcoded Spanish (\"Pagos Internacionales\",\nKPI titles, status labels, footer) while the shell defaulted to\nEnglish - visible inconsistency for any reviewer who toggled the\nshell language.\n\nReplicated the contract the analytics React MFE already follows:\nthe shell reflects the active language on <html lang>, MFEs observe\nit via MutationObserver and re-render. Zero changes in the shell.\n\n- payments.i18n.ts: es/en dictionaries + detectLang() helper.\n- payments.component.ts: signal<PaymentsLang> driven by an attribute\n  observer on documentElement; columns become computed so labels\n  track the language without mutating the constant.\n- payments.component.html: bound text expressions to t() and\n  columns().\n- payments.component.spec.ts: assertions updated for the new shape\n  (key preservation still verified by reference, labels asserted\n  against the active dictionary). One spec added: header switches\n  to English when <html lang>=en at instantiation.","tree":{"sha":"2e5d53f0283d035f9bb0ea08aca241c571b17b89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/2e5d53f0283d035f9bb0ea08aca241c571b17b89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDk4NWMwOTlmZDc3MzE2N2Y4MmJiNDFhNjg5ZTViMTgxNDgwNjhkNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403","sha":"693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403"}],"sha":"985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/985c099fd773167f82bb41a689e5b18148068d6b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:10:24Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:10:24Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"docs: finalize README v9 with audit trail, hero/architecture images and proposal PDF\n\n- README updated with 3 new audit & hardening entries (nginx headers\n  inheritance fix, CSP/critters trade-off, gzip enablement).\n- docs/CapitalFlow_Propuesta_Tecnica_v9.pdf attached (technical proposal,\n  linked from the Documentation section).\n- docs/img/01-hero.png: shell home screenshot from Docker port 8081.\n- docs/img/02-architecture.png: Module Federation diagram.\n- docs/lighthouse-desktop.png + lighthouse-mobile.png: defense evidence\n  (desktop 98 / mobile improved after gzip).","tree":{"sha":"c3f60862af3aba614212ca714668b87762d8b4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/c3f60862af3aba614212ca714668b87762d8b4aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDY5M2I5NDNmZjliOGJhNDEwYTg0NWM1ZjMwMmQ2YTU2NTY0OGI0MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67","sha":"3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67"}],"sha":"693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/693b943ff9b8ba410a845c5f302d6a565648b403"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:04:36Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T23:04:36Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"Merge: nginx security headers inheritance + CSP/critters + gzip","tree":{"sha":"e728bd2f163a8852c6789f36837d234d7c03aa97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/e728bd2f163a8852c6789f36837d234d7c03aa97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDMxNDhhZDhmZWFiNDY1OTBkNTUyMzlmYWE5ZDYyN2M4YTQ4NTZiNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","sha":"e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c","sha":"b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c"}],"sha":"3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3148ad8feab46590d55239faa9d627c8a4856b67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T22:56:13Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T22:56:13Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"perf(nginx): enable gzip compression across the 4 nginx surfaces\n\nLighthouse mobile Slow 4G flagged ''Document request latency: no\ncompression applied'' with main.js travelling at 482 KB uncompressed.\nnginx had no gzip directive, so static assets were served raw.\n\nEnabled gzip on shell + 3 MFE nginx.conf with:\n- gzip on\n- gzip_comp_level 6\n- gzip_min_length 1024\n- gzip_vary on\n- gzip_proxied any\n- gzip_types covering JS, CSS, JSON, SVG, WOFF/WOFF2, WASM, manifest\n\nVerified transfer size: main.js 482308 B -> 141374 B (-70.7%).\nstyles.css and i18n JSON also compress. Total page payload dropped\nfrom 4079 KiB to 187 KiB on Lighthouse mobile.\n\nBREACH not a concern: every gzipped response is public static content\nwith no secrets in the body. Cookies stay untouched (no compression on\nSet-Cookie). Documented in the inline configuration block.\n\nPlaywright e2e 8/8 still green. 7-header security set intact across the\n6 verification points.","tree":{"sha":"e728bd2f163a8852c6789f36837d234d7c03aa97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/e728bd2f163a8852c6789f36837d234d7c03aa97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGI1OTJkMTYwYTZkZWY0YWZlY2Y1Y2IwMzMxZmU1MGVlYzYxZjNkNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671","sha":"2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671"}],"sha":"b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/b592d160a6def4afecf5cb0331fe50eec61f3d5c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T22:19:20Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T22:19:20Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(shell): disable critical-CSS inlining so the strict CSP applies cleanly\n\nAngular production builds (inlineCritical, on by default) emit deferred\nstylesheets as <link media=print onload=this.media=''all''>. The new\nscript-src ''self'' CSP blocks that inline onload handler, so this.media never\nflips to ''all'' and styles.css stays print-only: the dark theme and every\nnon-critical style never reach the screen, and the blocked handler logs\nconsole errors that drag the Best Practices score down.\n\nSet optimization.styles.inlineCritical=false in the production config so the\nbuild emits a plain <link rel=stylesheet>. Minification stays on, so the\n549 kB initial budget and FCP are unchanged.\n\nVerified on the Docker stack: served index.html has no inline onload, 0 CSP\nconsole errors, theme toggle flips body background light<->dark, Playwright\ne2e 8/8 green.","tree":{"sha":"f91815ab84a728cfd8b00811b8c7b0467ece1c13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/f91815ab84a728cfd8b00811b8c7b0467ece1c13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDJlZjg2Y2M2ZTgxN2Y1M2Q5M2FmY2NiOWIwMTlhOGEyNWQ1MGM2NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923","sha":"8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923"}],"sha":"2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/2ef86cc6e817f53d93afccb9b019a8a25d50c671"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T21:55:32Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T21:55:32Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(nginx): make security headers inherit into location blocks across all surfaces\n\nThe shell and 3 MFE nginx.conf files declared Content-Security-Policy,\nStrict-Transport-Security and Permissions-Policy at the server level but\nredeclared a subset (XFO + XCTO + Referrer-Policy) inside their location\nblocks. nginx does not merge add_header across scopes: a location with its\nown add_header completely replaces the server-level set, dropping CSP, HSTS\nand Permissions-Policy from every response that location serves. In the\nshell this was masked further -- requests to / internally redirect to\n/index.html and match `location = /index.html`, so the main document never\ncarried CSP at all.\n\nFix:\n- Repeat the full security header set inline in every location that emits\n  its own add_header (chosen over a shared include because the Dockerfiles\n  copy only nginx.conf, not auxiliary .conf files).\n- Add Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin across all four surfaces; it\n  was missing entirely.\n\nVerified with curl -I against /, /transactions (SPA route) and\n/remotes/payments/ (reverse proxy) on the shell plus the root of each MFE:\nall six responses now carry the full 7-header set. Playwright e2e 8/8 green\nagainst the Docker stack, including the three Module Federation remotes\nrendering under the newly-active CSP + COOP.","tree":{"sha":"58bc7c7029f456f9a83859abb4d0ec23d597ab36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/58bc7c7029f456f9a83859abb4d0ec23d597ab36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDhiNTJhY2NjNmJkMDQyNWExZGVhMWNkMGIxZGIyZjgzMDUzOTQ5MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","sha":"e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d"}],"sha":"8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/8b52accc6bd0425a1dea1cd0b1db2f8305394923"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:28:50Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:28:50Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"Merge: cap-modal-legacy rename + drop legacy CTA","tree":{"sha":"7447c9796336b65cf97d3e3862a7566d5bcbaf7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/7447c9796336b65cf97d3e3862a7566d5bcbaf7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGUyMDRiZTE1N2E3NjRkM2Y0NWZhY2Q0MzNlOWMzZjBhYTRhNDZkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","sha":"ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2","sha":"665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2"}],"sha":"e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e204be157a764d3f45facd433e9c3f0aa4a46d4d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:27:33Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:27:33Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"refactor(shell): rename ie11 banner to cap-modal-legacy and drop the legacy portal CTA\n\nThe legacy overlay was visually a modal (centered card on opaque backdrop)\nbut its identifiers used the word \"banner\", and the call-to-action linked\nto a placeholder URL (.example.com) that does not resolve. Both points\ncame up during the pre-defense audit.\n\nChanges:\n- Rename ie11-banner.{js,css} to cap-modal-legacy.{js,css}\n- Rename CSS selectors and id from cap-legacy-banner to cap-modal-legacy\n- Update index.html link, script and the aria-labelledby pair\n- Remove the \"Ir al portal legacy\" anchor: the legacy portal ships in\n  phase 5 of the migration plan, advertising a non-existent destination\n  is misleading\n- Rewrite the body copy to point users at modern browsers (Chrome, Edge,\n  Firefox, Safari) instead of an unavailable portal\n- Detection logic via documentMode and the body scroll lock are preserved","tree":{"sha":"7447c9796336b65cf97d3e3862a7566d5bcbaf7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/7447c9796336b65cf97d3e3862a7566d5bcbaf7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDY2NWQwNTZiMzY5MzdhZjAzYjAzMDgyMzU2YjA2MDNhOTAwNWQ2ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","sha":"ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8"}],"sha":"665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/665d056b36937af03b03082356b0603a9005d6e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T12:51:58Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T12:51:58Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"Merge: ie11 banner becomes blocking overlay","tree":{"sha":"f23ff3e224079393fa50cbce68149ab4b93036b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/f23ff3e224079393fa50cbce68149ab4b93036b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGVhM2Y0NGJlZWRjZjIwNzY3YmM1ZTBhMjc0ZmYwOTIxNzE3M2Q3ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","sha":"93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6","sha":"3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6"}],"sha":"ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/ea3f44beedcf20767bc5e0a274ff09217173d7e8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T12:50:17Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T12:50:17Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(shell): make ie11 banner a blocking overlay with legacy portal redirect\n\nThe previous implementation rendered a passive notice while allowing\nusers to keep interacting with the Shell (route changes, XLSX export,\netc). The proposal Section 4 promises automatic redirection to the\nlegacy portal, so the banner must block the Shell entirely.\n\nChanges:\n- Full-screen fixed overlay with opaque background and z-index 99999\n- Body scroll locked while the overlay is active\n- Single primary action linking to the legacy portal placeholder URL\n- No dismiss button — IE11 users must navigate away\n- Detection logic via documentMode preserved","tree":{"sha":"f23ff3e224079393fa50cbce68149ab4b93036b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/f23ff3e224079393fa50cbce68149ab4b93036b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDNmYzllZmJmNGVhZDRkMWM3N2Y1MzI0YWEzNDIzOGJkYzcyMDY1YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","sha":"93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c"}],"sha":"3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3fc9efbf4ead4d1c77f5324aa34238bdc72065b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:52:46Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:52:46Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"revert(mfes): restore dompurify dependency in payments and transactions\n\nThe previous chore commit removed dompurify from these two MFEs assuming\nit was unused — it is not. shared-ui ships SafeHtmlPipe which imports\ndompurify, and the library is exposed via ng-package.json''s\nallowedNonPeerDependencies. Consumers of shared-ui that resolve it via\npath mapping (../shared-ui/dist) need dompurify physically present in\ntheir own node_modules so the emitted FESM2022 bundle can resolve the\nimport at compile time.\n\nshell already kept the dependency and built green in GitLab CI. The two\nMFEs broke with:\n\n  ../shared-ui/dist/fesm2022/capitalflow-shared-ui.mjs:3:0-45\n  Error: Module not found: Error: Can''t resolve ''dompurify''\n\nThe local test run masked the issue because node_modules/dompurify was\nstill present from an earlier install before the original removal.","tree":{"sha":"a065d5a48ba7bc48fc32a1d4b010d6024c00e136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/a065d5a48ba7bc48fc32a1d4b010d6024c00e136"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDkzZmIzYWFmNDk0ZjM2MTA1YTNlZDUxMDU4NzIyYjkwNjg4MGQzMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/251229b1c9e36435473ef5706f4b825a16c59098","sha":"251229b1c9e36435473ef5706f4b825a16c59098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/251229b1c9e36435473ef5706f4b825a16c59098"}],"sha":"93fb3aaf494f36105a3ed51058722b906880d30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanas