ttps://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/11fc1818b9bcfb30c66465a0a88b23067f1d552b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/11fc1818b9bcfb30c66465a0a88b23067f1d552b","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDExZmMxODE4YjliY2ZiMzBjNjY0NjVhMGE4OGIyMzA2N2YxZDU1MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03","sha":"517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03"}],"sha":"11fc1818b9bcfb30c66465a0a88b23067f1d552b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/11fc1818b9bcfb30c66465a0a88b23067f1d552b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:54:57Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:54:57Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(shell): legacy browser banner for IE11 / Trident on index.html\n\nInline banner shown only when document.documentMode is defined or the user\nagent matches Trident or MSIE. Sits in normal document flow so it pushes\napp-root down without dynamic padding math; this fixes the case where the\nbanner wraps to four lines on narrow viewports and would otherwise overlap\nthe cap-header. Text is bilingual (es + en) because ngx-translate is not\nloaded yet when the banner runs. Inline style + script are covered by the\nexisting nginx CSP allowances for ''unsafe-inline''.","tree":{"sha":"8c925fcbc1fc4f5e4d51259b8a5b4536e715c2eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/8c925fcbc1fc4f5e4d51259b8a5b4536e715c2eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDUxN2Y5NDgxNDdmOWIxN2NmNGQyMjFiYjQ5ZTJlYjA4NDY3Y2JiMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499","sha":"3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499"}],"sha":"517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/517f948147f9b17cf4d221bb49e2eb08467cbb03"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:35:23Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:35:23Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(shell): restore IconName enum used by DashboardMetric typing\n\nThe previous refactor that moved icon rendering into shared-ui''s cap-metric-card\nalso removed the enum that types DashboardMetric.icono, leaving home.component\nand dashboard.model importing from a deleted module. Keep the enum local — it\ncatalogues the names available in the shell''s own sprite (assets/icons.svg),\nwhich is shell scope, not library scope.","tree":{"sha":"41a597504725feacf07cd2dc72b7263e57af4917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/41a597504725feacf07cd2dc72b7263e57af4917"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDNiYjYxMWNlY2UxNGIzZTNkYWRhZjZlNDE1ZWFiYzJiOTEzNmI0OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96","sha":"7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96"}],"sha":"3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3bb611cece14b3e3dadaf6e415eabc2b9136b499"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:20:16Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:20:16Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(shell): i18n single-load, tablet button stretch, restore Observable service test\n\nresolveInitialLanguage in language.constants picks the language once from\nlocalStorage / navigator.language and uses it for both setDefaultLang and\nuse, so only the active locale''s translation JSON is fetched on bootstrap.\n\nhome.component.scss stretches the action buttons to 100% under the tablet\nbreakpoint so they no longer cling to the left edge.\n\nanalytics.service.ts drops the LAZY_GENERATION_THRESHOLD_MS warn that\nleaked into the console and renames the mock-row locals to English; the\nmatching constant is removed from analytics.constants.ts. The spec is\nupdated to subscribe to the Observable returned by getTransactions instead\nof awaiting the previous synchronous shape.","tree":{"sha":"05904e1f3ddedc77d10d14e53322e7e48472fef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/05904e1f3ddedc77d10d14e53322e7e48472fef9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDdkNTVmMmI0ZmJkNDFlZWNhMTVlYjhiYTYwOWVlZmY0MmM2OGNiOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06","sha":"2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06"}],"sha":"7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/7d55f2b4fbd41eeca15eb8ba609eeff42c68cb96"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:20:02Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:20:02Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"build(shell): switch to custom-webpack builder, source-import shared-ui, bundle CSV worker\n\n@angular-builders/custom-webpack replaces the default browser/dev-server/karma\nbuilders so a single webpack.config.js with resolve.modules can deduplicate\nthe Angular runtime across shell + shared-ui sources at build time, fixing\nthe bindingStartIndex: null crash that the duplicated copies caused.\n\nshared-ui is now consumed via source-import: tsconfig.json maps\n@capitalflow/shared-ui to shared-ui/src/public-api-source.ts and adds\nfallback paths for @angular/*, rxjs and tslib so the type-checker can\nresolve them while compiling sources that live outside the shell project\nroot. tsconfig.app.json''s include is reduced to the slim entry point so\nlegacy *.module.ts files do not get pulled in as orphans.\n\nwebWorkerTsConfig + a dedicated tsconfig.worker.json hand the export.worker\nto the Angular CLI''s worker plugin, which produces a real chunk\n(src_app_workers_export_worker_ts.js) and rewrites the new Worker(new URL...)\ncall. Without this, the URL stayed as file:/// and the SecurityError\n\"cannot be accessed from origin http://localhost:4200\" surfaced on every\nCSV export.","tree":{"sha":"43bff66de3cf8316b2a08eafd0ad076ac53c56d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/43bff66de3cf8316b2a08eafd0ad076ac53c56d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDJmODMwZDMzYmE2MmFjMjQyODlkYzY5YTQ3OWY3ZjNkNmRlM2VjMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03","sha":"9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03"}],"sha":"2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/2f830d33ba62ac24289dc69a479f7f3d6de3ec06"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:44Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:44Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"refactor(shell): consume entire design system from shared-ui\n\nApp, home, analytics, analytics-stats, analytics-table and analytics-wrapper\nnow import their building blocks (cap-header, cap-button, cap-spinner,\ncap-stat-card, cap-metric-card, cap-table, cap-data-grid, cap-status-badge)\nfrom @capitalflow/shared-ui. The local shell/shared/{cap-header,icon,spinner}\ncopies are removed. styles.scss adds the consumer-side tokens that the new\ncomponents read (cap-status-*, cap-table-*).","tree":{"sha":"370237513d16cb38b2e18d2757c98cf0de8ee2a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/370237513d16cb38b2e18d2757c98cf0de8ee2a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDlmNTQxYjRmMDExZDMxZjQ0NjVhOWE3ZGRiZjA2ZGUxZjdlNDllMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95","sha":"e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95"}],"sha":"9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/9f541b4f011d31f4465a9a7ddbf06de1f7e49e03"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:34Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:34Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"chore(shared-ui): wire new components in public-api, add slim source-import entry, drop dead spanish tsconfig comments\n\nSharedUiModule and public-api.ts now expose the new components for ng-packagr\nconsumers. public-api-source.ts is a slim entry point that exports only the\nstandalone classes; it is consumed by the shell via TypeScript path mapping\nso source-imported builds never pull in the legacy NgModule chain that\nreferences non-standalone DirectivesModule and PipesModule.\n\nThe tsconfig comment headers (Opciones generales, Modo estricto, etc.) were\ndescriptive of what the keys already say; deleted.","tree":{"sha":"765aef812a559d3bd3436b674f81d1b8a01eaf35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/765aef812a559d3bd3436b674f81d1b8a01eaf35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGU4MTQyOTI1MmVkMDkwNWEyZDU5ZjJmMTJiZDY5NzNjYmYwNDRjOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a","sha":"05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a"}],"sha":"e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/e81429252ed0905a2d59f2f12bd6973cbf044c95"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:24Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:24Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(shared-ui): cap-header mobile UX (blue dropdown, click-outside, resize, navigation auto-close)\n\nThe white surface dropdown clashed with the blue header bar; switching it to\n--cap-primary with translucent dividers reads as a continuation of the bar.\nTheme/lang actions move out of the dropdown so they stay reachable while the\nnav is collapsed. The menu now closes automatically on NavigationEnd, on a\ndocument click outside the host, and when the viewport widens past the\nmobile breakpoint.","tree":{"sha":"973e742f6085793d54168f2e408bcafbbee94040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/973e742f6085793d54168f2e408bcafbbee94040"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDA1MDQ2ZmExN2NiOTk0NGEyZDE2MzBjODg1N2Q5MjFlMWQyOGRlNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252","sha":"3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252"}],"sha":"05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/05046fa17cb9944a2d1630c8857d921e1d28de6a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:16Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:16Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(shared-ui): add capitalflow-primary, capitalflow-secondary, capitalflow-outline button variants\n\nThe three variants drive their colours from --cap-primary, --cap-secondary,\n--cap-bg-surface and --cap-border so consumers can rebrand by overriding\ntokens without forking the button. Extends the ButtonVariant union accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"ed7177f1b50aa8b792a547d3f32f36b1e4c43006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/ed7177f1b50aa8b792a547d3f32f36b1e4c43006"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDNkMzI0ZGUwNzI1MTBjNGYzMGQwNDhjZjk0NDNhZWY5ODBjY2UyNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6","sha":"eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6"}],"sha":"3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3d324de072510c4f30d048cf9443aef980cce252"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:08Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:19:08Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(shared-ui): add cap-table and cap-data-grid with templated cells and CDK virtual scroll\n\ncap-table renders typed columns with content-projected cell templates\n(CapCellTemplateDirective) so consumers can customise rendering without\nforking the component. cap-data-grid extends the same API with a\ncdk-virtual-scroll-viewport for 100k+ row datasets and a single horizontal\nscrollbar shared between header and body. Replaces the legacy data-grid.","tree":{"sha":"3b700fcea6ae50423dc30d5120aef0b408fbd92e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/3b700fcea6ae50423dc30d5120aef0b408fbd92e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGVhY2I3Y2Y2ODg0YWFmYjlmODFiMmMxYjQ3YjNkNDUxMjNiZmQwYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1","sha":"f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1"}],"sha":"eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/eacb7cf6884aafb9f81b2c1b47b3d45123bfd0a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:18:52Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T22:18:52Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"feat(shared-ui): add cap-status-badge, cap-spinner, cap-icon, cap-stat-card, cap-metric-card\n\nFive standalone components covering status pills, loading state, sprite-based\nicon rendering, KPI summaries and dashboard metric tiles. All consume the\nshared design tokens via CSS Custom Properties so consumers stay theme-agnostic.","tree":{"sha":"7c91c2e00100b20f293e558e37aa5dfde95087d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/7c91c2e00100b20f293e558e37aa5dfde95087d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGY1ZDlhMDdhMmM3ZjFlYjUzOTg4ZTc4ZTI0NTFiYjk5NTUzNWZlZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d","sha":"f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d"}],"sha":"f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/f5d9a07a2c7f1eb53988e78e2451bb995535fef1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T12:19:56Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T12:19:56Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"refactor(home): replace emoji icons with Lucide icons via app-icon\n\n- Add 4 entries to IconName enum (MetricTreasury, MetricPayments,\n  MetricReconciliation, MetricAlert)\n- Extend assets/icons.svg with 4 new <symbol> from Lucide\n  (landmark, credit-card, circle-check, triangle-alert) preserving\n  stroke=\"currentColor\" and the rest of the original attributes verbatim\n- Tighten DashboardMetric.icono: string -> IconName so the type system\n  rejects any future emoji or arbitrary string in dashboard metrics\n- Replace 4 emojis in home.component.ts with IconName references\n- Replace the inline emoji span with <app-icon> in home.component.html\n- Style .metrica-icono with width/height 1.5rem and color: var(--cap-primary)\n  so icons inherit theme color in both light and dark modes\n- Convert remaining 2 px media queries in home.component.scss to em\n  (768px -> 48em, 576px -> 36em) per the Block 4 SCSS rule","tree":{"sha":"4b703bfe66d119be53fed892f2dcf5add0aa163d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/4b703bfe66d119be53fed892f2dcf5add0aa163d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGY4ODk4NmJmYjA0YmUwYmYwYzhmZGM3MGNjNTc5MDU3Y2I3ZjM1N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0","sha":"c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0"}],"sha":"f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/f88986bfb04be0bf0c8fdc70cc579057cb7f357d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:51:57Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:51:57Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"fix(scripts): drop | Out-Host so docker stderr is not treated as error\n\nBug surfaced during validation of the previous Docker chore: stop.ps1 was\naborting halfway through with a NativeCommandError red block. Root cause:\n\"docker compose down\" writes informational progress (Container ... Stopping)\nto stderr. PowerShell 5.1, when a native command''s stderr is piped via\n| Out-Host, wraps each line as ErrorRecord. Combined with the script-wide\n$ErrorActionPreference = ''Stop'', the first stderr line aborted the script\nand only the first container was stopped.\n\nFix: remove | Out-Host after the docker calls. Without the pipe, docker\nwrites directly to the host console and PowerShell does not interpret\nstderr as a fatal error. The pre-existing 2>$null on the docker compose ps\nquery inside stop.ps1 is left untouched: it already redirects stderr\ncorrectly for that specific call.\n\nValidation:\n- .\\stop.ps1 now stops all 3 containers and removes the network end to end\n  with [OK] and exit 0, no red block.\n- .\\start.ps1 brings up the 3 services with [OK] in seconds, no red block.","tree":{"sha":"81bbb2bcced241961dd5f82f70081e5d75a9726e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/81bbb2bcced241961dd5f82f70081e5d75a9726e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGMxNDRlNjBiNTUxNzEwMTZmZGVlOTZlOTExOGRjMjI4YWMxMzE4ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4","sha":"362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4"}],"sha":"c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/c144e60b55171016fdee96e9118dc228ac1318d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:48:53Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:48:53Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"chore(docker): remove obsolete version key from compose to silence warnings\n\nThe top-level \"version\" key was deprecated in Compose v2 and is now obsolete.\nCompose ignores it but emits a warning on every command that reads the file\n(\"`version` is obsolete\"). Dropping the line removes that noise without\nchanging functional behavior.","tree":{"sha":"7c5ad1e8cd92c393da364bdf3a9db023bb51589a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/7c5ad1e8cd92c393da364bdf3a9db023bb51589a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKDM2MmYzNjRiZjY1MjVlN2Y5ZmZmMzczYmZiNmJjZjE0MWY4ODhhYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3dce1f2095cbef09332215c5d8aa651147a3aa04","sha":"3dce1f2095cbef09332215c5d8aa651147a3aa04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3dce1f2095cbef09332215c5d8aa651147a3aa04"}],"sha":"362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/362f364bf6525e7f9fff373bfb6bcf141f888ac4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3dce1f2095cbef09332215c5d8aa651147a3aa04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:27:59Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T11:27:59Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","name":"FranciscoLiebanas"},"message":"refactor(shell): extract inline SVGs to sprite + app-icon component\n\n- Add lucide-static@^1.14.0 as devDependency for sourcing SVG assets\n- Add shell/LICENSES.md with ISC attribution for Lucide\n- Create assets/icons.svg sprite with 3 <symbol>: nav-toggle,\n  theme-light, theme-dark (Lucide menu / sun / moon)\n- Create assets/svgs/spinner.svg with loader-2 from Lucide as <symbol id=loader>\n- Create assets/svgs/brand-logo.svg with the existing CapitalFlow logo\n- Add IconComponent (standalone, OnPush) with input.required<IconName>()\n  and computed href; host sized 1.5rem default, color via currentColor\n- Add IconName enum (NavToggle, ThemeLight, ThemeDark) and ICON_SPRITE_PATH\n- Replace inline SVGs in shell cap-header.component.html with <img> for the\n  brand logo and <app-icon> for nav-toggle / theme-light / theme-dark\n- Replace inline SVGs in spinner and analytics-wrapper templates with\n  <svg><use href=/assets/svgs/spinner.svg#loader/>\n- Simplify spinner SCSS: drop track + dasharray, single rotation animation\n- Simplify analytics-wrapper SCSS: drop circle + dasharray, single rotation\n- Refactor cap-header SCSS: BEM modifiers --md and --lg for icon sizing,\n  remove svg-element selectors no longer applicable","tree":{"sha