omputed reacts automatically)\n- Add takeUntilDestroyed(destroyRef) to ExportService subscribe\n- Migrate HomeComponent.tabActiva to signal<DashboardTabId>\n- Tighten Transaction model: estado: TransactionStatus, tipo: TransactionType,\n  categoria: TransactionCategory; add DashboardTabId enum;\n  tighten DashboardTab.id and DashboardOperation.estado\n- Replace string literals with enum references in templates\n  (transactionStatus.Completed, dashboardTabId.Summary, appLanguage.Es)\n- Convert media query 768px -> 48em in cap-header.component.scss\n- Replace inline magic numbers/strings with named constants in\n  analytics-wrapper, analytics-stats, analytics-table","tree":{"sha":"ce5fc5da156dc4cb0b03202f20b84a4d3470c580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/trees/ce5fc5da156dc4cb0b03202f20b84a4d3470c580"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/git/commits/d1e8f3961ed5871561b37696d1048ee9e0ab683e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/d1e8f3961ed5871561b37696d1048ee9e0ab683e","node_id":"C_kwDOR_2t3NoAKGQxZThmMzk2MWVkNTg3MTU2MWIzNzY5NmQxMDQ4ZWU5ZTBhYjY4M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commit/3afef9dea87c81bc2c67abb86daf45e0e704632b","sha":"3afef9dea87c81bc2c67abb86daf45e0e704632b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3afef9dea87c81bc2c67abb86daf45e0e704632b"}],"sha":"d1e8f3961ed5871561b37696d1048ee9e0ab683e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/d1e8f3961ed5871561b37696d1048ee9e0ab683e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franciscoliebanastalavera/expert/commits/3afef9dea87c81bc2c67abb86daf45e0e704632b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T10:26:33Z","email":"francisco.liebanas@nter.es","nam