s/charlesw-salesforce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlesw-salesforce","id":168678941,"login":"charlesw-salesforce","node_id":"U_kgDOCg3WHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commits/a4fe21cd8723cce265475a68a572fe53d4c045a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:26:55Z","email":"168678941+charlesw-salesforce@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Charles Watkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:26:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(recipes): drop out-of-order query responses in debounced/refetch recipes (#87)\n\n* fix(recipes): drop out-of-order query responses in debounced/refetch recipes\n\nDebouncing cancels a not-yet-fired timer but not an already-dispatched query, so a slow earlier response could resolve after a newer one and overwrite it. Track a monotonic request id per component and discard any response that is no longer the latest. Applied to the filtered list, sorted results, and route-parameters detail recipes (React + Angular) and React''s searchable account list, matching the guard Angular''s searchable account list already used. Regression test added for the debounced filtered-list case in both frameworks.\n\nCloses #82\n\n* fix(read-data): keep the filtered list empty when the search is cleared\n\nAn in-flight query dispatched before the search was cleared could resolve afterward and repopulate the list. Gate the results branch on an active search (matching React''s visibleContacts), so a cleared search shows nothing regardless of a late response. Also switches the out-of-order regression test to fake timers so it can''t flake under CI load.\n\n* test(routing): cover out-of-order detail responses in route-parameters\n\nRapid :accountId changes can leave an earlier detail query resolving after a newer one; assert the request-id guard drops the stale response.","tree":{"sha":"94f7f6f3ff9287a5833d473f68d70c7bf6a969c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/trees/94f7f6f3ff9287a5833d473f68d70c7bf6a969c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/commits/a4fe21cd8723cce265475a68a572fe53d4c045a6","verification":{"payload":"tree 94f7f6f3ff9287a5833d473f68d70c7bf6a969c6\nparent 01ff0ef651b2ee4f90848d135a058b45f9430af4\nauthor Charles Watkins <168678941+charlesw-salesforce@users.noreply.github.com> 1790699215 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790699215 -0700\n\nfix(recipes): drop out-of-order query responses in debounced/refetch recipes (#87)\n\n* fix(recipes): drop out-of-order query responses in debounced/refetch recipes\n\nDebouncing cancels a not-yet-fired timer but not an already-dispatched query, so a slow earlier response could resolve after a newer one and overwrite it. Track a monotonic request id per component and discard any response that is no longer the latest. Applied to the filtered list, sorted results, and route-parameters detail recipes (React + Angular) and React''s searchable account list, matching the guard Angular''s searchable account list already used. Regression test added for the debounced filtered-list case in both frameworks.\n\nCloses #82\n\n* fix(read-data): keep the filtered list empty when the search is cleared\n\nAn in-flight query dispatched before the search was cleared could resolve afterward and repopulate the list. Gate the results branch on an active search (matching React''s visibleContacts), so a cleared search shows nothing regardless of a late response. Also switches the out-of-order regression test to fake timers so it can''t flake under CI load.\n\n* test(routing): cover out-of-order detail responses in route-parameters\n\nRapid :accountId changes can leave an earlier detail query resolving after a newer one; assert the request-id guard drops the stale response.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu+bPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC4wQACoP9kggH+5ydDDnay5DJh6d\nezFu06NL/d2CTtci7XIF2VMVOmgoHYSsRv5/XpwUlazMo72rtk27kfzQ+CXl2oCP\nsNjKDEeCBgKnZGcSoZ9/Oioa1XX2yOBYbbJ7U7u6xXa9jATWnbW55bIKx8+ORP/c\n9P0Zr6+aG3DlzaIyt9W0YIk7bUXdbYEPJeiAcWCMxykvbPQP5RreyWZ2PpYdF3hy\nHys6z1mms4JZe3rFVigP/uOaz270LT421/aQC743lJjD9pDsgtm+GzUxhbcc+Ar5\nPux3I3FYTuoV56c1LE2x3nDq24+iXI90CUrgesSXh5A8dRVIBNetInvpD0FkzqeI\nO7jDG9dKFtsKCTv+Y/BblHCowUA7vusbx95MRyZTdma8w2SG9Qzs8MK8Ud06Bo1x\nrhlIoYizJKQUM/KwyWGkq9F5lQj3fcjMZrrB+wQvVhkcWy71222dnxQjwi5HtnUy\nerWdeEaCBOYfB8ZlN9tT3uA2GXKXwLMZNdxd2Gf3OkU+2f/yhw07mQe+7Ux57bZ0\nJOwU0IBCfnCwW+AK0xtAdCe+Y9Z0S9KrSaCYDZDDjPSZZ5QYzVwQeA57fRz6gcYN\nAe0rTKynRxbbt2BoEdQI/GEngp0+WZvspPOl4RlqIagbPRdWYoQ9h4U6/8vgki3/\ntZhGTQarLLRqqI7+276c\n=X09y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T16:26:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/