rl":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commits/fdc492a580e762a515cdbe334c4f569e7e8d0a32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:18:22Z","email":"168678941+charlesw-salesforce@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Charles Watkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:18:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"add prefetch to RouteParameters (#103)\n\n* add prefetch to RouteParameters\n\n* Remove pre-change references from RouteParameters comments\n\n* Fix LWC equivalent comment to use @wire(graphql)\n\n* Show ''Not found.'' when GraphQL query returns no records\n\nPreviously the fetch threw when the query succeeded but returned no\nmatching Account, which routed through <Await>''s errorElement and\nsurfaced the generic ''Request failed'' message. Return null in that\ncase instead, and render a distinct ''Not found.'' branch so real\nrequest errors keep their own error state.\n\n* Remove not-found test for RouteParametersDetail\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mike Burr <mburr@salesforce.com>","tree":{"sha":"1edf2c453624f8df9e94b1a4676898482069e7bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/trees/1edf2c453624f8df9e94b1a4676898482069e7bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/commits/fdc492a580e762a515cdbe334c4f569e7e8d0a32","verification":{"payload":"tree 1edf2c453624f8df9e94b1a4676898482069e7bb\nparent 05d5b12e053e0f93dc512b6bda3cdb7b5535d6f6\nauthor Charles Watkins <168678941+charlesw-salesforce@users.noreply.github.com> 1790626702 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790626702 -0700\n\nadd prefetch to RouteParameters (#103)\n\n* add prefetch to RouteParameters\n\n* Remove pre-change references from RouteParameters comments\n\n* Fix LWC equivalent comment to use @wire(graphql)\n\n* Show ''Not found.'' when GraphQL query returns no records\n\nPreviously the fetch threw when the query succeeded but returned no\nmatching Account, which routed through <Await>''s errorElement and\nsurfaced the generic ''Request failed'' message. Return null in that\ncase instead, and render a distinct ''Not found.'' branch so real\nrequest errors keep their own error state.\n\n* Remove not-found test for RouteParametersDetail\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mike Burr <mburr@salesforce.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqusuOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8QAQAEtDw1Gg9u2L3hoz8eWdv4nf\nvmQaXkmNWP0iHhso7NwJt/oDHzzSaQoaq44o7RZ6ThvZmBrURf9z2dx2rdrvwWvu\nXYcG4nF4OImx+mpfPUKsSI1G0i5vEmXl2D1AlKCN78ZPap7WhdKCESkDuoCc5z+/\n8mbg6C6at0sL64noPgJ+6HbnKV0vPrwvuAsRC81oMivcGGiUlDmLsnJsYcEv1+Q3\nOKEs2Mc77WyC4wqw5p2g1I2bAJzt1qCCcDsPRh/ZjfePOYIc9ZRgfzQRDiFFAJcC\n6Hg3b/bkYf+1xZjPNnn2zC778SLpKdAsj705bAXH7rlR3OoJDkBgwLZIO+KH6x7+\n1Tqx6JLYGe1z8+7SO4iZZ5Jx91v7xPSKrrQPaa9pByjaZ/MCOO1hd1MgJxf4U7N5\nRk/cNhKD5+hhaWbik1RFCck5a/oq9RFnL444IOYh/U0ESdsfGobXz0Lhp38p776l\neygEZLo67TOaLSR351B6+6Z0CfWTpUZJl0t30wtv5ma6QEUsZyaoyz9o/f47ljNc\nu7wHhEg48JLYiVdzZTDEjZFePvGL9fGu9HaS3czyWn5uMpd9dpQeuVAP9o4txYvj\nyiTPbiH64aXrppf3OqqvnsH2L9/Y43eN7Y4SUmNm55Aw9Tjycc+hGH0DeA9odeYQ\nlnYG3IraG5ol2M0V/1Vz\n=CLoF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T20:18:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","r