6.16.0.\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/ljharb/qs/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/ljharb/qs/compare/v6.15.2...v6.16.0)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: qs\n  dependency-version: 6.16.0\n  dependency-type: indirect\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ce0e7e1f9a25d5cac45b716203f74a3bc88373e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/trees/2ce0e7e1f9a25d5cac45b716203f74a3bc88373e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/commits/569074a8328f7b870e188f46d0b469b7e7ff825c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commit/569074a8328f7b870e188f46d0b469b7e7ff825c","node_id":"C_kwDOSACgc9oAKDU2OTA3NGE4MzI4ZjdiODcwZTE4OGY0NmQwYjQ2OWI3ZTdmZjgyNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commit/0321947daebde3a3f1bb6a9f68943d78644f993f","sha":"0321947daebde3a3f1bb6a9f68943d78644f993f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commits/0321947daebde3a3f1bb6a9f68943d78644f993f"}],"sha":"569074a8328f7b870e188f46d0b469b7e7ff825c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commits/569074a8328f7b870e188f46d0b469b7e7ff825c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168678941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlesw-salesforce","id":168678941,"login":"charlesw-salesforce","node_id":"U_kgDOCg3WHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlesw-salesforce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/commits/0321947daebde3a3f1bb6a9f68943d78644f993f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:43:32Z","email":"168678941+charlesw-salesforce@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Charles Watkins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:43:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add Micro-Frontend Recipes (#61)\n\n* chore: bump @salesforce platform SDK and UI bundle to v11.45\n\n* feat(microfrontend-recipes): add LWC host components\n\nSeven LWC bundles that act as the Salesforce-side host for each\nembedding recipe. Each renders a <lightning-embedding> element and\nwires Account fields from getRecord into its props.\n\n  microfrontendRecipesLauncher — app home page; queries the first\n    Account via graphql and navigates there\n  uiEmbeddingBasicRender — minimum viable embed; shows annotated\n    <lightning-embedding> attribute reference\n  uiEmbeddingReadHostData — subscribes to live host updates via\n    getRecord wire; includes a side-by-side edit form\n  uiEmbeddingSendToHost — dispatches score CustomEvent; host\n    translates to updateRecord\n  uiEmbeddingAutoResize — no-SDK-call auto-resize via EmbeddingResizer\n  uiEmbeddingThemeTokens — sends theme name via props; guest owns\n    the palette mapping\n  uiEmbeddingUnsavedChanges — markDirtyState / clearDirtyState loop\n    with a Saved/Unsaved badge on the host side\n\nCo-authored-by: AMAN SINGH <36499868+aman06it@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(microfrontend-recipes): add org metadata for the app\n\nInstalls the Microfrontend Recipes app into a scratch org or sandbox:\n\n- MicrofrontendRecipes custom app with an Account record page override\n  (active only inside this app, so the stock Account page is unchanged\n  in every other app)\n- Microfrontend_Recipes_Account flexipage — accordion of the six\n  embedding recipes using the uiEmbedding* LWC bundles\n- Microfrontend_Recipes_Home flexipage — app home with the launcher\n  banner that navigates to a demo Account\n- CSP trusted site for localhost:5173 (the React Recipes dev server)\n- Permission set additions: MicrofrontendRecipes app visibility and\n  Microfrontend_Recipes_Home tab\n- Account compact layout (Account_Scoring) showing the fields the\n  recipes write to\n- Sample data: Type field added to all ten seed Accounts so the\n  SendToHost and UnsavedChanges recipes have real picklist values\n\n* feat(microfrontend-recipes): add React guest recipes\n\nSix React guest components served by the React Recipes dev server (or\nany static host) under /embedding/* routes. Each is an independently\nrunnable recipe that teaches one embedding concept:\n\n  GuestLayout     — pathless route layout; registers the ui-embedding\n                    bootstrap listener and applies the .embedding-guest\n                    root class. No SDK plumbing — each recipe fetches\n                    its own instance via getViewSDK(), which caches the\n                    in-flight promise (Strict-Mode-safe, no duplicates).\n  BasicRender     — minimum viable embed; reads Account props via\n                    viewSDK.getUiState()\n  ReadHostData    — subscribes to live host updates; shows update count\n                    and a pulse animation on each push\n  SendToHost      — 3×3 scoring matrix; fires a score CustomEvent in\n                    the guest''s own vocabulary (engagement + fit);\n                    the host maps those to Salesforce fields\n  AutoResize      — add/remove items; the bundled EmbeddingResizer\n                    sends resize notifications automatically — no SDK\n                    call needed from recipe code\n  ThemeTokens     — host sends a theme name (light | dark | salesforce);\n                    guest flips a root class and CSS variables cascade\n  UnsavedChanges  — calls markDirtyState / clearDirtyState; includes\n                    a save-timeout recovery if the host never confirms\n\nEach recipe has a co-located test file (vitest + RTL + vitest-axe) that\nmocks @salesforce/platform-sdk''s getViewSDK() directly.\n\nroutes.tsx gains a pathless layout route for /embedding/* that sits\noutside AppLayout so the iframe renders a clean page with no navbar.\nglobal.css adds a .dark theme block and .embedding-guest overrides so\nembedded pages have a transparent background and no default chrome.\n\nCo-authored-by: AMAN SINGH <36499868+aman06it@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: update READMEs and home page for multiframework recipes\n\nRoot README now describes both apps (React Recipes and Microfrontend\nRecipes), covers shared org setup, and links to each app''s README.\nAdds a react-recipes README for the on-platform app.\nApp title and home page link updated to the multiframework guide.\n\n* chore: vite config and gitignore updates for embedding guest routes\n\nvite.config.ts: allow the Vite dev server to read LWC source files\noutside the UI bundle tree (needed for ?shiki syntax-highlight imports\nin the recipe source viewer); bump chunkSizeWarningLimit for SLDS CSS.\nvite-plugin-shiki.ts: add a gql injection grammar for GraphQL inside\ntagged template literals; twoslash falls back on error.\nvite-env.d.ts: declare ?shiki module shapes.\n.gitignore: add dist/, *.tsbuildinfo, e2e-org/, .gus/.\n\n* docs: add hero images for the top-level README and each app\n\n* build: pin npm 11.19.0 and regenerate lockfile to fix CI install\n\n* chore: disable unfixable SLDS hardcoded-value rule for recipe CSS\n\n* test: add Jest smoke tests for microfrontend LWC host components\n\n* feat: surface microfrontend recipes in the React Recipes app\n\n* docs: reconcile READMEs and hero images with main structure\n\n* feat: gate Microfrontend Recipes behind a developer-preview opt-in\n\n* docs: document Microfrontend Recipes as a developer preview\n\n* fix: upgrade @salesforce UI-bundle and Platform SDK to v12 for embedding compatibility\n\n* feat: expose baseUrl as a configurable targetConfig on the embedding hosts\n\n* feat: seed Account Rating so Read Host Data shows data on load\n\n* fix: ship the localhost CSP trusted site only with the preview package\n\n* fix: release the Unsaved Changes save guard if the host save fails\n\n* docs: correct developer-preview framing and emphasize both permission sets\n\n* chore: align gallery ordering with the accordion and add the Small form factor\n\n* test: cover launcher error/no-accounts branches and guest unmount teardown\n\n* chore: rename Microfrontend to Micro-Frontend in labels and prose\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: AMAN SINGH <36499868+aman06it@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"50bb8a9ed090f740b901ba81204f1567d1434395","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/trees/50bb8a9ed090f740b901ba81204f1567d1434395"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trailheadapps/multiframework-recipes/git/commits/0321947daebde3a3f1bb6a9f68943d78644f993f","verification":{"payload":"tree 50bb8a9ed090f740b901ba81204f1567d1434395\nparent 9ed005fb1ef15c9b214341ce37277f6cadc1fe7a\nauthor Charles Watkins <168678941+charlesw-salesforce@users.noreply.github.com> 1788457412 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788457412 +0000\n\nfeat: add Micro-Frontend Recipes (#61)\n\n* chore: bump @salesforce platform SDK and UI bundle to v11.45\n\n* feat(microfrontend-recipes): add LWC host components\n\nSeven LWC bundles that act as the Salesforce-side host for each\nembedding recipe. Each renders a <lightning-embedding> element and\nwires Account fields from getRecord into its props.\n\n  microfrontendRecipesLauncher — app home page; queries the first\n    Account via graphql and navigates there\n  uiEmbeddingBasicRender — minimum viable embed; shows annotated\n    <lightning-embedding> attribute reference\n  uiEmbeddingReadHostData — subscribes to live host updates via\n    getRecord wire; includes a side-by-side edit form\n  uiEmbeddingSendToHost — dispatches score CustomEvent; host\n    translates to updateRecord\n  uiEmbeddingAutoResize — no-SDK-call auto-resize via EmbeddingResizer\n  uiEmbeddingThemeTokens — sends theme name via props; guest owns\n    the palette mapping\n  uiEmbeddingUnsavedChanges — markDirtyState / clearDirtyState loop\n    with a Saved/Unsaved badge on the host side\n\nCo-authored-by: AMAN SINGH <36499868+aman06it@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat(microfrontend-recipes): add org metadata for the app\n\nInstalls the Microfrontend Recipes app into a scratch org or sandbox:\n\n- MicrofrontendRecipes custom app with an Account record page override\n  (active only inside this app, so the stock Account page is unchanged\n  in every other app)\n- Microfrontend_Recipes_Account flexipage — accordion of the six\n  embedding recipes using the uiEmbedding* LWC bundles\n- Microfrontend_Recipes_Home flexipage — app home with the launcher\n  banner that navigates to a demo Account\n- CSP trusted site for localhost:5173 (the React Recipes dev server)\n- Permission set additions: MicrofrontendRecipes app visibility and\n  Microfrontend_Recipes_Home tab\n- Account compact layout (Account_Scoring) showing the fields the\n  recipes write to\n- Sample data: Type field added to all ten seed Accounts so the\n  SendToHost and UnsavedChanges recipes have real picklist values\n\n* feat(microfrontend-recipes): add React guest recipes\n\nSix React guest components served by the React Recipes dev server (or\nany static host) under /embedding/* routes. Each is an independently\nrunnable recipe that teaches one embedding concept:\n\n  GuestLayout     — pathless route layout; registers the ui-embedding\n                    bootstrap listener and applies the .embedding-guest\n                    root class. No SDK plumbing — each recipe fetches\n                    its own instance via getViewSDK(), which caches the\n                    in-flight promise (Strict-Mode-safe, no duplicates).\n  BasicRender     — minimum viable embed; reads Account props via\n                    viewSDK.getUiState()\n  ReadHostData    — subscribes to live host updates; shows update count\n                    and a pulse animation on each push\n  SendToHost      — 3×3 scoring matrix; fires a score CustomEvent in\n                    the guest''s own vocabulary (engagement + fit);\n                    the host maps those to Salesforce fields\n  AutoResize      — add/remove items; the bundled EmbeddingResizer\n                    sends resize notifications automatically — no SDK\n                    call needed from recipe code\n  ThemeTokens     — host sends a theme name (light | dark | salesforce);\n                    guest flips a root class and CSS variables cascade\n  UnsavedChanges  — calls markDirtyState / clearDirtyState; includes\n                    a save-timeout recovery if the host never confirms\n\nEach recipe has a co-located test file (vitest + RTL + vitest-axe) that\nmocks @salesforce/platform-sdk''s getViewSDK() directly.\n\nroutes.tsx gains a pathless layout route for /embedding/* that sits\noutside AppLayout so the iframe renders a clean page with no navbar.\nglobal.css adds a .dark theme block and .embedding-guest overrides so\nembedded pages have a transparent background and no default chrome.\n\nCo-authored-by: AMAN SINGH <36499868+aman06it@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: update READMEs and home page for multiframework recipes\n\nRoot README now describes both apps (React Recipes and Microfrontend\nRecipes), covers shared org setup, and links to each app''s README.\nAdds a react-recipes README for the on-platform app.\nApp title and home page link updated to the multiframework guide.\n\n* chore: vite config and gitignore updates for embedding guest routes\n\nvite.config.ts: allow the Vite dev server to read LWC source files\noutside the UI bundle tree (needed for ?shiki syntax-highlight imports\nin the recipe source viewer); bump chunkSizeWarningLimit for SLDS CSS.\nvite-plugin-shiki.ts: add a gql injection grammar for GraphQL inside\ntagged template literals; twoslash falls back on error.\nvite-env.d.ts: declare ?shiki module shapes.\n.gitignore: add dist/, *.tsbuildinfo, e2e-org/, .gus/.\n\n* docs: add hero images for the top-level README and each app\n\n* build: pin npm 11.19.0 and regenerate lockfile to fix CI install\n\n* chore: disable unfixable SLDS hardcoded-value rule for recipe CSS\n\n* test: add Jest smoke tests for microfrontend LWC host components\n\n* feat: surface microfrontend recipes in the React Recipes app\n\n* docs: reconcile READMEs and hero images with main structure\n\n* feat: gate Microfrontend Recipes behind a developer-preview opt-in\n\n* docs: document Microfrontend Recipes as a developer preview\n\n* fix: upgrade @salesforce UI-bundle and Platform SDK to v12 for embedding compatibility\n\n* feat: expose baseUrl as a configurable targetConfig on the embedding hosts\n\n* feat: seed Account Rating so Read Host Data shows data on load\n\n* fix: ship the localhost CSP trusted site only with the preview package\n\n* fix: release the Unsaved Changes save guard if the host save fails\n\n* docs: correct developer-preview framing and emphasize both permission sets\n\n* chore: align gallery ordering with the accordion and add the Small form factor\n\n* test: cover launcher error/no-accounts branches and guest unmount teardown\n\n* chore: rename Microfrontend to Micro-Frontend in labels and prose\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: AMAN SINGH <36499868+aman06it@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmbHECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0KkQABUyymZlpiu8EOiv2eBseDTI\nk0rSbvedi7jtj2zqc4a0uDEaYz7IXvnqs/LP8FfOsDq0kl+buZdDp/9vuRHW9dJI\nUeo8OkpB4hd+AYXz8nY9DU0yuezBkQRsAM57dhs0mPAb7S4nygXEf2pzzsFkvizN\nnKTf7OEn+XF29SVDRrsV/9r18jammVrPRtqW4ji2/DfYKpwL3ui4QrGKCz7ek+EB\niZYhxPTCmmLvgFA+75rVP5WobZdjE6xMioZkTj1r/Q7wJL3/YYaetFgxOXwCRzic\nFTGLEqGTwXiNM56bvTxio/G+bA6oDIvhv3o94mXgsTJiPkaecaslbPYjxHZUwSsH\nsojf3MfUlcmq4FWTCQ0KNsy9lrpB1pNstf8f4hhgmgMiC4fLI1Z6DFvNmb3JmD2u\nLJZI+ypE3gcQviU7/DoOadUablCMb2Iq8YUPzH+eYmI2Giv2dQhQliNurYXtictL\nmviaz0/NcMlaMB7Nrp6TmY2KfYp60urE0ITe30DkysRuASSQBzS5i6mwMSiW855a\n6fqoBSt4Cv4z2XyF6ws+j5W/0W/A7SmkR8WOH50ZRJEMBjn4fGxJyCD9Ngj1chde\nnD8Pe0MwTtWth6pYtSayUU4UtHUsKGouTtK0PwwYpGVz/ri9eSlYX0ZNbsSROMee\n+NIsgSZVOr3Mv8+FzHGF\n=TFBL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",