ews items based on source\n  cross-coverage, recency, tier weight, summary quality, and keyword density\n- Sort controls: date, relevance, trending, source A-Z\n- Cache-busting refresh button that clears backend cache on demand\n- Normalize all dates to ISO 8601 for correct chronological sorting\n- News source picker widget, recommended/trending views, digest generation\n- Global audio player, nav bar, detail level options\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"aae14949608f4546779fa95fa2ed4728d0c9f4d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcusudd/briefme/git/trees/aae14949608f4546779fa95fa2ed4728d0c9f4d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcusudd/briefme/git/commits/d525e3d0892736d297c8fd8d2d43d51fdcb431d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210091427?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcusudd","id":210091427,"login":"marcusudd","node_id":"U_kgDODIW9ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcusudd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcusudd/briefme/commit/d525e3d0892736d297c8fd8d2d43d51fdcb431d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSAFeo9oAKGQ1MjVlM2QwODkyNzM2ZDI5N2M4ZmQ4ZDJkNDNkNTFmZGNiNDMxZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.co