ic, control_device, set_alarm, call,\n   send_message, navigate, weather_query, set_reminder, unsupported).\n   Confusion matrix is diagonal (no cross-action confusion).\n\n   The intent cascade (iter 52) → live pipeline (iter 66 spans) →\n   /api/intent endpoint (iter 51) is now backed by an adapter that\n   produces correct JSON 100 % of the time on the canonical test set.\n\nTotal iter-52..137 test count: 640 / 640 green.\n85 commits stacked since iter 51.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6831deba89aaf80f4b87260b96a8721edd6cfa25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/6831deba89aaf80f4b87260b96a8721edd6cfa25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/45f2c48a1f7d3e531acf91e6ebbe5b6f1c713220","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit