3, simplify_vocab=False, tts_rate_multiplier=1.0,\n  font_scale=1.0).\n- Active state with all overrides round-trips correctly.\n- to_dict() returns the exact 9-key shape the WS layer ships.\n- to_dict() output is json.dumps-safe.\n- Inactive defaults match normal-UI behaviour (no surprise UI shift\n  when the controller hasn''t activated).\n\nTotal iter-52..134 test count: 631 / 631 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4d0e625c73f39fb021214b733925286464d9bf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/a4d0e625c73f39fb021214b733925286464d9bf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/fd089d0f6321a83e309cfd5d568d4687f10f5fc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/fd089d0f6321a83e309cfd5d568d4687f10f5fc1","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKG