n 0.37 s)\n- reset is idempotent (3 consecutive calls don''t raise).\n- reset after 100 records correctly zeroes totals.\n- Per-instance CostTracker.reset() doesn''t affect the global singleton.\n- After reset_global_cost_tracker(), get_global_cost_tracker()\n  returns a different instance.\n- Records after reset start a fresh aggregate (no leakage).\n\nTotal iter-52..130 test count: 621 / 621 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44e3391dcde8e18e3668730ccb253ccbc72930ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/44e3391dcde8e18e3668730ccb253ccbc72930ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/f5ea4528acc356fa94a8e61408bb8153e5f23c65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/f5ea4528acc356fa94a8e61408bb8153e5f23c65","node_id":"C_kwDO