bubble\n\"adaptation rewrite\" chip in the chat tab.\n\nTESTS (6 / 6 green in 0.32 s)\n- Returns a (text, log) tuple.\n- text is str, log is list.\n- Empty response falls back to safe default + empty log.\n- Each log entry has axis / value / change keys.\n- High cognitive_load (0.95) on a 6-sentence input emits a log\n  entry recording the trim.\n- Neutral adaptation on short text doesn''t crash.\n\nTotal iter-52..129 test count: 616 / 616 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ebf83464345e27e18912821dbdd011dfeaf2bb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/5ebf83464345e27e18912821dbdd011dfeaf2bb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/1f5ffc9cc7705ce8c713df9e054168bb03602921","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/1f5ffc9cc770