ses ValueError.\n- fisher_epsilon < 0 raises ValueError.\n- Initial state empty (fisher={} / star_params={} / num_tasks=0).\n- penalty_loss() = 0.0 when no consolidation has happened.\n- reset() clears fisher / star_params / num_tasks.\n- state_dict() returns a dict with fisher + star_params keys.\n- model property returns the wrapped nn.Module.\n\nTotal iter-52..126 test count: 604 / 604 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3941abcd8bddf38d84ba73a4632182a82068090f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/3941abcd8bddf38d84ba73a4632182a82068090f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/03f3343dd73fda8bad23e3dd1122f39055776cf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/03f3343dd73fda8bad23e3dd1122f39055776cf5","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f