ve masking sketch + sample-weighted FedAvg).\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 1.09 s)\n- Pairwise-mask cancellation: two clients with shared seed → masks\n  cancel under aggregation, leaving the unmasked mean.\n- Sample-weighted aggregation: 1× and 9× example counts produce\n  weighted mean 9.0 (unmasked path).\n- Aggregate raises on empty pending updates.\n- Aggregate raises on zero total examples.\n- Aggregate raises NotImplementedError on dropped_clients (sketch\n  doesn''t implement Bonawitz §3.3 dropout recovery).\n- clear() resets the pending queue.\n- generate_shared_seed returns int.\n- 50 generate_shared_seed() calls produce 50 distinct integers.\n\nTotal iter-52..125 test count: 596 / 596 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cd5b498d93584b6d3f4898a74d6b1b14c85dffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/5cd5b498d93584b6d3f4898a74d6b1b14c85dffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/21b56a92c27e3dab5955df0d50702503fa02b311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","