7T03:05:57Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T03:05:57Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 124: HMAFIntent / HMAFResponse Pydantic model tests\n\n9 tests pin the HMAF (Hybrid Multi-Agent Framework) data contracts\nthat the iter-51 agentic_core_runtime exposes for HarmonyOS-aligned\nintent routing.\n\nTESTS (9 / 9 green in 0.28 s)\n- HMAFIntent minimal construction (defaults populate correlation_id\n  + timestamp).\n- HMAFIntent with parameters dict.\n- HMAFIntent rejects extra fields (extra=''forbid'').\n- HMAFIntent rejects empty name (min_length=1).\n- HMAFIntent rejects empty source_device.\n- HMAFIntent allows caller-supplied correlation_id.\n- HMAFResponse minimal construction with all 7 required fields.\n- HMAFResponse model_dump() preserves payload contents.\n- HMAFIntent round-trips through model_dump_json + json.loads.\n\nTotal iter-52..124 test count: 588 / 588 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f947b3ab16fe94d3ec9dbccec3f21fdb5183952d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/f947b3ab16fe94d3ec9dbccec3f21fdb5183952d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/a05a2bf6d85955c51b27dfaa0cbe861af2841e48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"ht