 only) + default factories.\n- ExplainPlan.to_dict() shape (topic / sub_questions / sub_answers\n  / composite_answer).\n- to_dict() round-trips through json.dumps cleanly.\n- Default-factory isolation across instances.\n\nTotal iter-52..117 test count: 558 / 558 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e88c6fa8fbca7f32b82f124449fe61d29ef2a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/5e88c6fa8fbca7f32b82f124449fe61d29ef2a62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/218bbd665fae0e62289f789c34982a3652e81a11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/218bbd665fae0e62289f789c34982a3652e81a11","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDIxOGJiZDY2NWZhZTBlNjIyODlmNzg5YzM0OTgyYTM2NTJlODFhMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-intera