okenUsage assignment preserves values.\n- TokenUsage rejects extra keys (frozen + extra=forbid).\n- ChatMessage accepts canonical roles (user / assistant / system).\n- ChatMessage rejects unknown role values.\n- CompletionRequest minimal construction + defaults\n  (max_tokens=512, temperature=0.7).\n- CompletionRequest with system + messages + custom max_tokens.\n- CompletionRequest metadata default-factory isolation.\n- CompletionResult required fields populated correctly.\n- CompletionResult accepts each canonical finish_reason value\n  (stop / length / content_filter / tool_use / error).\n\nTotal iter-52..116 test count: 552 / 552 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fb454d3a33539ed933c02ca3aa9253bcc952b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/9fb454d3a33539ed933c02ca3aa9253bcc952b81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/1d050e30f2c77b7a9697866cf68f8f32a5078c81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81