hy that MultiProviderClient routes on\n(AuthError / RateLimitedError / TransientError / PermanentError),\nall rooted at ProviderError.  isinstance() matters for the chain''s\nfall-through behaviour.\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.33 s)\n- All 4 classes inherit from ProviderError.\n- provider attribute preserved across all classes.\n- provider is optional on the base ProviderError.\n- str() / args[] contains the message text.\n- The 4 classes are distinct siblings (no class-of-class confusion).\n\nTotal iter-52..114 test count: 542 / 542 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbcad955912854ff24c2c2b0cba58ef296a2f346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/cbcad955912854ff24c2c2b0cba58ef296a2f346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/b08454bb1cde6b02e3c90be1b2b501b4f51788f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"}