"Tamer"},"message":"iter 113: PrivacyBudget redaction + sensitive-category accumulation tests\n\n5 tests pin the iter-51 privacy-budget bookkeeping that the dashboard\nPrivacy tab depends on for live PII-redaction counters.\n\nTESTS (5 / 5 green in 0.30 s)\n- pii_redactions_total aggregates across calls (2 + 3 = 5).\n- bytes_redacted_total aggregates across calls (15 + 22 = 37).\n- sensitive_categories dict aggregates per-category counts across\n  calls (email 1+1=2, phone 1, ssn 1).\n- Explicit bytes_in / bytes_out override prompt/response string\n  lengths (avoids billing 100-char string when the cloud only saw\n  10 bytes).\n- Per-session isolation: alice''s s1 calls don''t show in s2 snapshot.\n\nTotal iter-52..113 test count: 534 / 534 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd5ea1c5ed4fb247a721857f48e03d2275f3f9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/cd5ea1c5ed4fb247a721857f48e03d2275f3f9d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/a282d690384859da2a13c0eaf1c3b29b84bba027","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/a282d690384859da2a13c0eaf1c3b29b84bba027","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGEyODJkNjkwMzg0ODU5ZGEyYTEzYzBlYWYxYzNiMjliODRiYmEwMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/4d907713dae742e477ff8e9f1dd62fbb4506275d","sha":"4d907713dae742e477ff8e9f1dd62fbb4506275d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/4d907713dae742e477ff8e9f1dd62fbb4506275d"}],"sha":"a282d690384859da2a13c0eaf1c3b29b84bba027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a282d690384859da2a13c0eaf1c3b29b84bba027"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/4d907713dae742e477ff8e9f1dd62fbb4506275d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:46:04Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:46:04Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 112: explain_decomposer pattern + topic-keyword tests\n\nPins the trigger regex set and topic-keyword extractor that drives\nthe multi-step explain decomposition (Phase B.3 / iter 51 surface).\n\nTESTS (17 / 17 green in 0.28 s)\n- 7 explain-pattern variants match correctly: explain X, tell me\n  about X, describe X, how does X work, what is X, walk me through X.\n- 6 non-explain texts (greetings, commands, thanks, yes, no, opinion)\n  correctly NOT matched.\n- _topic_keywords strips function-word stopwords (the / of / explain).\n- _topic_keywords returns a set.\n- _topic_keywords handles empty / whitespace-only input.\n- _topic_keywords lowercases all keywords.\n\nTotal iter-52..112 test count: 529 / 529 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00d85da0466d4289052d57613b232ed780fd14a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/00d85da0466d4289052d57613b232ed780fd14a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/4d907713dae742e477ff8e9f1dd62fbb4506275d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a