ttps://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/5810388d1f3ddd0f5b271c4e06e816fd9e0dd4ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:44:24Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:44:24Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 111: ContextualThompsonBandit convergence + posterior-shape tests\n\nPins the long-horizon convergence + read-only-sampling invariants of\nthe iter-89 bandit.\n\nTESTS (7 / 7 green in 19.30 s)\n- Beta-Bernoulli alpha grows substantially with 50 positive rewards.\n- Beta-Bernoulli beta grows substantially with 50 negative rewards.\n- total_pulls aggregates correctly across both arms.\n- total_rewards aggregates correctly to 1.5 from [0.5, 0.7, 0.3].\n- select_arm() does NOT mutate posterior state (read-only sampling).\n- Cold-start: both arms picked between 30 % and 70 % of 500 samples\n  (no degenerate single-arm bias).\n- History deque is capped (50 000 updates → < 50 000 entries; iter-51\n  audit hardening verified).\n\nTotal iter-52..111 test count: 512 / 512 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c9ef9471a22c4f563a215c07ae80697d10dd659","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/9c9ef9471a22c4f563a215c07ae80697d10dd659"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/5810388d1f3ddd0f5b271c4e06e816fd9e0dd4ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/foll