ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/4433caca2c07974f528301a0ec94e3d1d0f80b76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:42:54Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:42:54Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 110: Pipeline._build_error_output safe-degradation tests\n\nThe error path is the safety net at the bottom of process_message.\nA bug here means a single unhandled exception kills the chat instead\nof degrading gracefully — these 9 tests pin the contract.\n\nTESTS (9 / 9 green in 0.27 s)\n- _fallback_response_for_error returns a non-empty user-friendly string.\n- Fallback NEVER leaks Python internals (traceback / Exception class\n  names / file paths) to user-visible text.\n- _build_error_output returns a valid PipelineOutput.\n- Inner exception''s message + class name are NOT exposed in the\n  response_text.\n- route_chosen labelled ''error_fallback''.\n- engagement_score is 0.0 (so the bandit doesn''t reward failures).\n- messages_in_session is 0.\n- baseline_established is False.\n- routing_confidence sums to ≤ 1.0 (valid probability mass).\n\nTotal iter-52..110 test count: 505 / 505 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"472042ef04508b02922e20adc19f1a5abb65f555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/472042ef04508b02922e20adc19f1a5abb65f555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/4433caca2c07974f528301a0ec94e3d1d0f80b76",