ounded growth past 500 stages).\n\nTotal iter-52..105 test count: 481 / 481 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16f32b71d17a2880399d34c71fdd11fadcbe0075","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/16f32b71d17a2880399d34c71fdd11fadcbe0075"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/cce2e84ef6406cf0f4731e160aa6d7f8ae8fa86a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/cce2e84ef6406cf0f4731e160aa6d7f8ae8fa86a","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGNjZTJlODRlZjY0MDZjZjBmNDczMWUxNjBhYTZkN2Y4YWU4ZmE4NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/336b74a67f120b07a24404cd213355ff6bc3a0a9","sha":"336b74a67f120b07a24404cd213355ff6bc3a0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-inte