ve for non-trivial models.\n- _serialised_size_mb scales with model size (small < large).\n- _to_dtype_copy converts to bf16 / fp16 correctly.\n- _to_dtype_copy preserves parameter shapes.\n- _percentile median / p95 / empty / single-element correctness.\n- EdgeReport.to_dict() round-trips with all 19 fields.\n\nTotal iter-52..104 test count: 473 / 473 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b230d0cf49c763c59e03bf63cb5ad68d8dcea034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/b230d0cf49c763c59e03bf63cb5ad68d8dcea034"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/336b74a67f120b07a24404cd213355ff6bc3a0a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/336b74a67f120b07a24404cd213355ff6bc3a0a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDMzNmI3NGE2N2YxMjBiMDdhMjQ0MDRjZD