kefile target to include the 3 new test files\n(dedupe_sentences, response_postprocess, linguistic_analyzer).\n\nVERIFICATION\n- Aggregate iter-52..102 sweep: 462 / 462 green.\n- 52 commits stacked since iter 51 (52 → 103 inclusive).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"182c6816a7b349a2e8a471ef166e169cd32d32c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/182c6816a7b349a2e8a471ef166e169cd32d32c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/f5b093703c7622827d9ecb9ac8db056f68dce943","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/f5b093703c7622827d9ecb9ac8db056f68dce943","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGY1YjA5MzcwM2M3NjIyODI3ZDllY2I5YWM4ZGIwNTZmNjhkY2U5NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1","sha":"cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1"}],"sha":"f5b093703c7622827d9ecb9ac8db056f68dce943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/f5b093703c7622827d9ecb9ac8db056f68dce943"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:32:08Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:32:08Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 102: LinguisticAnalyzer feature-extraction invariant tests\n\nPins the 12+ linguistic features that flow into the user-state\nTCN encoder.  A regression in any of these silently destabilises\nthe user-state vector + downstream adaptation.\n\nTESTS (13 / 13 green in 0.29 s)\n- type_token_ratio in [0, 1] across hostile inputs.\n- type_token_ratio: repeats lower than diverse text (monotonicity).\n- mean_word_length positive for non-empty input, 0 for empty.\n- count_syllables: hello ≥ 1; syllabification ≥ 4.\n- flesch_kincaid_grade returns float, never NaN.\n- question_ratio / exclamation_ratio / formality_score all in [0, 1].\n- formality_score: formal text ≥ informal text (monotonicity).\n- emoji_count detects 😂; returns 0 on plain text.\n- sentiment_valence in [-1, 1].\n- sentence_split returns list with ≥ 2 entries for 3-sentence input.\n- compute_all returns dict of ≥ 5 finite numeric features.\n\nTotal iter-52..102 test count: 462 / 462 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ebad4422893e69d5249faabeee93016057ee105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/4ebad4422893e69d5249faabeee93016057ee105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGNiNzdjZTgwYzdmNzFhNTg5YjE3OTliMjQ0MzQ4ZDg3MGZkYTkzZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/e08d2a946c7339bb15ac0e185bee3ef334a0d1e6","sha":"e08d2a946c7339bb15ac0e185bee3ef334a0d1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/e08d2a946c7339bb15ac0e185bee3ef334a0d1e6"}],"sha":"cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/cb77ce80c7f71a589b1799b244348d870fda93d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/e08d2a946c7339bb15ac0e185bee3ef334a0d1e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:30:52Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:30:52Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 101: ResponsePostProcessor invariant tests\n\nPins the cloud-LLM postprocess pipeline that adapts cloud responses\nto the AdaptationVector (length / vocabulary / non-empty guarantee).\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.33 s)\n- Always returns a non-empty string.\n- Empty input → fallback string.\n- Whitespace-only input → fallback string (no empty bubble).\n- High cognitive_load (0.9) caps sentence count.\n- Low cognitive_load (0.1) preserves long responses.\n- High accessibility (0.9) enables simplification without crashing.\n- Idempotent: process(process(x)) == process(x).\n- Handles input without sentence terminators safely.\n\nTotal iter-52..101 test count: 449 / 449 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83c607d23e2eb636372c18b5c9f05a54b56fcfd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/83c607d23e2eb636372c18b5c9f05a54b56fcfd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/e08d2a946c7339bb15ac0e185bee3ef334a0d1e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.