cit-interaction-intelligence/commits/093b848698841208d2415b31a446f6264467f311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:29:25Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:29:25Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 100: MILESTONE — Pipeline._dedupe_sentences regression tests\n\nIter 100 marks 49 commits since iter 51 closed the JD-required\nbullets.  Picked the iter-51 sentence-dedupe helper as the milestone\nfocus because it''s the polish layer that makes the chat tab feel\n\"finished\" — every retrieval-then-SLM and KG-overview turn passes\nthrough it.\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.27 s)\n- Short / empty input unchanged.\n- Single sentence unchanged.\n- Distinct sentences both preserved.\n- Canonical iter-51 case: founded_by year-overlap correctly drops\n  the redundant founded_in sentence (Guido + 1991 mentioned once).\n- Distinct facts about the same subject (no token overlap) kept.\n- Input without sentence terminators returns unchanged.\n- Three identical sentences in a row collapse to one.\n- Terminator punctuation (? !) preserved on remaining sentences.\n\nMILESTONE TALLY (since iter 51, commit 2ee0d12)\n- 49 stacked commits.\n- 441 / 441 + 1 skipped tests green in the iter-test sweep.\n- New surfaces shipped: Qwen LoRA cascade arm B + Gemini cascade\n  arm C wired into live pipeline, dashboard cascade cards + live\n  latency ribbon, deep system-health endpoint, OpenTelemetry per-\n  arm spans, global CostTracker billing, redteam batch eval, edge\n  perf-regression guard, multilingual robustness, BPE corner cases,\n  privacy budget circuit-breaker, KG dedupe + canonicalisation +\n  per-predicate compose, encryption envelope round-trips, dashboard\n  HTML + JS + CSS contract tests, FastAPI route inventory smoke,\n  pricing-table integrity + priced-call cost integration.\n\nTotal iter-52..100 test count: 441 / 441 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) 