ructure).\n- The completion field is valid JSON with action + params keys.\n- Documented split-overlap upper bound (high by design; tests as a\n  stable property to flag a future regression).\n\nTotal iter-52..98 test count: 433 / 433 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a66e1fbb4bb5afaa7713f955003bf16b2239636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/9a66e1fbb4bb5afaa7713f955003bf16b2239636"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/588cca90fa1be2c433ac347ef6a33f2240566df0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/588cca90fa1be2c433ac347ef6a33f2240566df0","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDU4OGNjYTkwZmExYmUyYzQzM2FjMzQ3ZWY2YTMzZjIyNDA1NjZkZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/615