tract.\n\nTESTS (16 / 16 green in 0.18 s)\n- 6 wire functions defined: wireIntentTab, wireEdgeProfileTab,\n  wireFinetuneTab, wireFactsTab, wireResearchTab, wireJdmapTab.\n- 6 wire functions invoked from the boot block (one call each).\n- iter-53 renderCascadeArms function defined + invoked.\n- iter-55 renderCascadeLiveStats defined + consumes /api/cascade/stats.\n- iter-51 wireIntentTab references /api/intent.\n- Production JS has < 10 console.log statements (noise guard).\n\nTotal iter-52..97 test count: 427 / 427 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"255cd88b7d2df05cdc7b78dc3e55de621c261488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/255cd88b7d2df05cdc7b78dc3e55de621c261488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/6155bcfa29322ec618f471875530a9d8d27294a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http