":"iter 96: CSS class coverage tests for iter-51..62 chat chips + cascade cards\n\nThe chat-bubble chips (iter 51 affect/safety/adapt/intent + iter 62\narm-A/B/C/R/T) and the iter-53/55 cascade dashboard cards each rely\non a CSS class in huawei_tabs.css.  A missing rule silently renders\nunstyled chips.  These 13 tests pin the CSS class set.\n\nTESTS (13 / 13 green in 0.17 s)\n- iter-62 cascade chips: chip-arm + chip-arm-{a,b,c,r,t} all present.\n- iter-51 chat chips: chip-affect / chip-safety / chip-adapt / chip-intent.\n- iter-53 + iter-55 cascade cards: .cascade-arms-grid + .cascade-arm-card.\n- iter-51 stack subsystem pill: .huawei-status-pill + .ok variant.\n- iter-51 intent JSON syntax-highlight: .intent-json-block.\n\nTotal iter-52..96 test count: 411 / 411 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc450c9309d63d5e4db323f1019b28a8499f646e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/dc450c9309d63d5e4db323f1019b28a8499f646e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/a300753b5d2ce71f526293dfd5d49a5f76f13aa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/a300753b5d2ce71f526293dfd5d49a5f76f13aa4","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGEzMDA3NTNiNWQyY2U3MWY1MjYyOTNkZmQ1ZDQ5YTVmNzZmMTNhYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/f05a00048234789f9b27e4be16c0cff760ee0795","sha":"f05a00048234789f9b27e4be16c0cff760ee0795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/f05a00048234789f9b27e4be16c0cff760ee0795"}],"sha":"a300753b5d2ce71f526293dfd5d49a5f76f13aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a300753b5d2ce71f526293dfd5d49a5f76f13aa4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/f05a00048234789f9b27e4be16c0cff760ee0795/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:21:36Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:21:36Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 95: PipelineInput dataclass contract tests\n\nThe WS layer constructs PipelineInput on every chat turn.  These 6\ntests pin its shape so a refactor that breaks default factories or\noptional fields fails fast.\n\nTESTS (6 / 6 green in 0.26 s)\n- Minimal construction (7 required fields).\n- keystroke_timings defaults to empty list.\n- prosody_features / gaze_features / playground_overrides default to None.\n- keystroke_timings list is passed through correctly.\n- prosody_features dict is passed through correctly.\n- Each instance has its own keystroke list (default-factory isolation).\n\nTotal iter-52..95 test count: 398 / 398 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91d97faee254b17ffc399e488c9c5b4fcbb63052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/91d97faee254b17ffc399e488c9c5b4fcbb63052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/f05a00048234789f9b27e4be16c0cff760ee0795","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu