:"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/6570478f887648d923bcaf49c9fe89e8c8bbd745/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:20:23Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:20:23Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 94: KnowledgeGraph.compose_answer per-predicate + alias tests\n\nPins the slot-specific phrasing + the predicate-alias chain that\nthe chat tab depends on for \"who founded X\" / \"who discovered X\"\nstyle questions.\n\nTESTS (7 / 7 green in 0.31 s)\n- founded_by with year renders \"in YYYY\".\n- founded_by without year omits the year (no ''None'' in output).\n- discovered_by falls back to founded_by via the alias chain\n  (asks \"who discovered evolution?\" → answers from founded_by).\n- Unknown predicate returns \"\".\n- Unknown subject returns \"\".\n- Multi-object slot includes at least one of the listed objects.\n- Always returns a str (never None).\n\nTotal iter-52..94 test count: 392 / 392 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f98f8f104d667fd7c5388026364ed562951e9768","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/f98f8f104d667fd7c5388026364ed562951e9768"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/6570478f887648d923bcaf49c9fe89e8c8bbd745","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt