/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/2b40ea742ea2b61e18dc2dd31dde2d85faca48c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:18:50Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:18:50Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 93: CostTracker priced-call integration tests\n\nVerifies the cost-tracker correctly prices calls against the iter-92\npricing_2026.json table for known + unknown models.\n\nTESTS (6 / 6 green in 0.33 s)\n- Known model (claude-sonnet-4-5) → non-zero cost > 0.\n- Unknown (provider, model) → zero cost + entry in unknown_models\n  list (graceful unknown-pricing fallback).\n- Aggregate cost is the sum of per-call costs (within rounding).\n- Token totals aggregate correctly across two calls.\n- by_provider breakdown lists every provider that recorded a call.\n- Global reset zeroes the aggregates.\n\nOutcome.  The CostTracker''s pricing pipeline is now end-to-end\ncovered: pricing_2026.json schema (iter 92), record + report shape\n(iter 67), MultiProviderClient billing wiring (iter 88), and the\npriced calculation (iter 93).\n\nTotal iter-52..93 test count: 385 / 385 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05613e85db866cf455c3e35115fc8a1a0db3b746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/05613e85db866cf455c3e35115fc8a1a0db3b746"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/2b40ea742ea2b61e18dc2dd31dde2d85faca48c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/2b40ea742ea2b61e18dc2dd31dde2d85faca48c0","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDJiNDBlYTc0MmVhMmI2MWUxOGRjMmRkMzFkZGUyZDg1ZmFjYTQ4YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7","sha":"ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7"}],"sha":"2b40ea742ea2b61e18dc2dd31dde2d85faca48c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/2b40ea742ea2b61e18dc2dd31dde2d85faca48c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:17:29Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:17:29Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 92: pricing_2026.json table integrity tests\n\nThe CostTracker reads pricing_2026.json on every report().  A\nmalformed table silently zeros out cost calculations; these 8 tests\npin the schema + sanity invariants.\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.17 s)\n- Top-level metadata present (schema_version, as_of, currency, unit,\n  models).\n- Currency is USD.\n- Unit is per-million-tokens (M / million / 1e6 in the unit string).\n- models block is a non-trivial dict.\n- Every (provider, model) entry has both an input-rate and an\n  output-rate key (under any of the supported aliases).\n- No negative rates anywhere in the table.\n- Vendor coverage: anthropic + openai + (google or gemini) all\n  represented so the iter-52 cascade arm C is priced.\n- Round-trips through json.dumps cleanly.\n\nOutcome.  A future hand-edit that breaks the pricing table fails CI\nfast instead of silently zeroing /api/cost/report.\n\nTotal iter-52..92 test count: 379 / 379 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c69cf6685de592d9848a6bc68d1b502eb804ce1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/c69cf6685de592d9848a6bc68d1b502eb804ce1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGFjNjUyYWIwZGI5NTU2NmU5NzBkNDE2MGU4MDhiYmJkNTM3OTZiYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e","sha":"a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e"}],"sha":"ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/ac652ab0db95566e970d4160e808bbbd53796bc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:15:08Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:15:08Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 91: Qwen LoRA adapter / tokenizer / training-metrics alignment tests\n\nVerifies the committed Qwen LoRA artefact is structurally consistent.\nA future re-train that desyncs the adapter / tokenizer / training\nmetrics would silently produce garbage on the cascade-arm-B path;\nthese 8 tests catch that fast.\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.17 s)\n\nADAPTER CONFIG\n- adapter_config.json is valid JSON.\n- base_model_name_or_path field is present and references Qwen.\n- LoRA rank r is in the supported set {8, 16, 32, 64}.\n\nTOKENIZER\n- tokenizer.json or tokenizer_config.json present.\n- tokenizer_config.json is valid JSON.\n\nTRAINING METRICS\n- training_metrics.json valid JSON.\n- best_val_loss field recorded.\n- model field references Qwen.\n\nTests skip cleanly when the adapter checkpoint isn''t on disk (clean-\ncheckout safe).\n\nTotal iter-52..91 test count: 371 / 371 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"912e35a5959723980cf3f1287bce649126f6925b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/912e35a5959723980cf3f1287bce649126f6925b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGE1OGFhNmEyODQ4MDc1ODE1ZjIxMjU1MWRhYzg3YTAyYTk5MDYyN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277","sha":"807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277"}],"sha":"a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a58aa6a2848075815f212551dac87a02a990627e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:13:58Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:13:58Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 90: aggregate iter-82..89 sweep + Makefile + roadmap refresh\n\nDocuments iter 82 through iter 89 in the roadmap with one-line focus\n+ commit hash for each, and extends the test-iter Makefile target to\ninclude the 8 new test files (privacy snapshot, sensitivity,\ndiary lifecycle, dashboard HTML, server routes, stated_facts,\ncost-tracker integration, bandit invariants).\n\nVERIFICATION\n- Aggregate iter-52..89 sweep: 363 passed + 1 skipped in 9.11 s\n  across 31 test files.\n- 39 commits stacked since iter 51 (52 → 90 inclusive).\n\nOUTCOME\nThe roadmap doc records the full 39-iter trajectory; the test-iter\ntarget gives reviewers a single-command path to verify the entire\nstacked work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6195bad3e8c72d45b51d9881936cb36bf7ea5205","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/6195bad3e8c72d45b51d9881936cb36bf7ea5205"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDgwN2U4YWRlMzAwMjY0MWFjMmMyMDUxOTVmNzE3MzFmNzIyYjMyNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36","sha":"a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36"}],"sha":"807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/807e8ade3002641ac2c205195f71731f722b3277"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:11:45Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:11:45Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 89: ContextualThompsonBandit invariant tests\n\nPins the LinUCB-style bandit + Beta-Bernoulli fallback that drives\nedge/cloud routing.  The bandit is the heart of the iter-51 routing\ndecision pipeline; a regression here silently mis-routes turns.\n\nTESTS (13 / 13 green in 0.29 s)\n\nCONSTRUCTION\n- n_arms ≤ 0 raises ValueError.\n- context_dim ≤ 0 raises ValueError.\n- prior_precision ≤ 0 raises ValueError.\n\nSELECTION + UPDATE\n- select_arm returns valid arm index + per-arm confidence dict in [0, 1].\n- update increments total_pulls for the chosen arm only.\n- update accumulates rewards correctly (5 × 0.5 = 2.5).\n- After 40 rounds of clear evidence (arm 0 reward 1.0, arm 1 reward\n  0.0), 50 subsequent samples prefer arm 0.\n\nBETA-BERNOULLI FALLBACK\n- alpha increases on positive reward.\n- beta increases on negative reward.\n\nROBUSTNESS\n- select_arm handles all-zero context (cold-start).\n- select_arm with extreme 1e6 context produces no NaN/inf in confidence.\n- update with reward outside [0, 1] doesn''t crash.\n- update with out-of-range arm index either raises or no-ops; never\n  silently corrupts arm 0''s state.\n\nTotal iter-52..89 test count: 363 / 363 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b7d1352e6b77bd098dab6bfce2dfb839857f99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/5b7d1352e6b77bd098dab6bfce2dfb839857f99c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGE4NTliZGY2MTdhMDRkMzhjOGRmMzE1NTg1MmUzYTM3MTc1YzZmMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06","sha":"ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06"}],"sha":"a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/a859bdf617a04d38c8df3155852e3a37175c6f36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:09:41Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:09:41Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 88: wire CostTracker into MultiProviderClient\n\nThe iter-67 global CostTracker existed but no caller billed into it\n— /api/cost/report would always show zeros.  This iter wires the\nrecording into MultiProviderClient so every successful cloud call\nthrough the chain (Anthropic / OpenAI / Gemini / Mistral / etc.)\nupdates the shared ledger.\n\nCHANGES\n- i3/cloud/multi_provider.py — after a successful provider.complete,\n  call get_global_cost_tracker().record(provider, model, usage,\n  latency_ms).  Wrapped in a try/except — telemetry failure must\n  never block the result returned to the caller.\n\nTESTS (4 / 4 new + regression suite green; 17 / 17 total)\n- Successful call bills the tracker (total_calls=1, prompt/completion\n  tokens populated).\n- Two calls aggregate correctly.\n- Failed calls don''t bill (only the successful fall-through provider\n  appears in by_provider).\n- Cost telemetry does not block the CompletionResult.\n- Pre-existing iter-63 multi-provider tests still pass (8/8).\n- Pre-existing iter-67 cost-tracker tests still pass (5/5).\n\nOutcome.  /api/cost/report now reflects real cloud activity, not\nzeros.  The dashboard can render live spend.\n\nTotal iter-52..88 test count: 350 / 350 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4422e3584c7509d42243b96485eb1d163ac496b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/d4422e3584c7509d42243b96485eb1d163ac496b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGNlYjY3NmFmZmRiMTg0ZjQwZWNlZmQxNmUyM2YzMWQ4OGI2NWNlMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e","sha":"0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e"}],"sha":"ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/ceb676affdb184f40ecefd16e23f31d88b65ce06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:07:43Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:07:43Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 87: Pipeline._stated_facts cache invariants\n\nThe iter-49 multi-fact session memory + iter-50 cross-session\npersistence depend on a per-(user, session) dict.  These 6 tests\nexercise the helper directly and pin the isolation contract.\n\nTESTS (6 / 6 green in 0.31 s)\n- Per-user-per-session isolation: facts in (alice, s1) don''t bleed\n  into (alice, s2).\n- Per-user isolation: alice''s facts don''t bleed into bob''s.\n- setdefault returns the existing dict (not a fresh copy).\n- Keys are (user_id, session_id) tuples — no string-concat collision.\n- Intent parser starts as None (lazy load).\n- Iter-55 cascade classifier returns ''other'' for unknown paths.\n\nTotal iter-52..87 test count: 346 / 346 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc62cc45379f4429e71ca9aa93adcdcce9d26967","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/dc62cc45379f4429e71ca9aa93adcdcce9d26967"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDBjMWU0YjhiMGIyYjYwMzE3NWUzZTJkZTkwNWE5ZTAyMjk3Njg0MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097","sha":"fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097"}],"sha":"0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/0c1e4b8b0b2b603175e3e2de905a9e022976840e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:06:40Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:06:40Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 86: FastAPI app route inventory + smoke tests\n\nVerifies the app boots cleanly via TestClient, every iter-51..67\nroute is registered, and the basic happy-path responses come back.\n\nTESTS (8 passed, 1 skipped in 3.74 s)\n- iter-51 routes registered: /api/intent, /api/intent/status,\n  /api/profiling/report.\n- iter-55..67 routes registered: /api/cascade/stats, /api/health/deep,\n  /api/cost/report.\n- /api/health, /api/live, /api/ready all present.\n- /api/health → 200 with status=ok.\n- /openapi.json well-formed (skipped when OpenAPI disabled).\n- Unknown route → 404 (or 405).\n- /api/health/deep → 200 with slm_v2 / intent / cloud sections.\n- /api/cost/report → 200 with total_calls / by_provider.\n- POST /api/intent with empty body validates (400 / 422 / friendly\n  200), never 500.\n\nOutcome.  The server''s route surface is now CI-pinned end-to-end via\nTestClient; a future regression that drops a route or breaks app\nboot fails a fast (~4 s) test.\n\nTotal iter-52..86 test count: 340 / 340 green (1 skipped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9329ec974bba4f5912c2f91c22b66a4e352cf88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/e9329ec974bba4f5912c2f91c22b66a4e352cf88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGZiZTlkMTU3MTk1ZjgwNWNjNTUyMDg4NmViMmUzY2NmOWI2N2QwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1","sha":"aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1"}],"sha":"fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/fbe9d157195f805cc5520886eb2e3ccf9b67d097"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:05:09Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:05:09Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 85: dashboard HTML nav-link / tab-panel contract test\n\nThe tab router (web/js/tab_router.js) joins ``a[data-tab=X]`` nav\nlinks to ``#tab-X`` panels.  A nav link without its panel (or vice\nversa) silently breaks navigation.  This test reads the static\nindex.html and asserts the link/panel pairing is consistent.\n\nTESTS (7 / 7 green in 0.19 s)\n- Every nav link has a matching tab-panel id (no broken links).\n- The 7 iter-51 Huawei tabs (intent / edge-profile / finetune /\n  facts / multimodal / research / jdmap) all have panels.\n- The iter-51 Stack-tab subsystem grid (id=stack-subsystem-grid) is\n  present.\n- At least one Huawei nav link in the iter-51 set is rendered.\n- Required CSS / JS are referenced (huawei_tabs.css, huawei_tabs.js,\n  chat.js, app.js).\n\nOutcome.  A future refactor that drops the iter-51 tabs / chips /\npanels breaks a fast static test instead of silently breaking the\ndashboard.\n\nTotal iter-52..85 test count: 332 / 332 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"705a6bb176efc2ef522b5fbc6b0b035a0c572159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/705a6bb176efc2ef522b5fbc6b0b035a0c572159"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGFhMDUyZDgzNTViNmI0YTEwZTlhNjk5OWNkZWU2NmI5Y2JlZmE0YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade","sha":"446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade"}],"sha":"aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/aa052d8355b6b4a10e9a6999cdee66b9cbefa4c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:03:20Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:03:20Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 84: DiaryStore session-lifecycle round-trip tests\n\nExercises create_session → log_exchange → end_session → retrieval\nend-to-end against a temp SQLite db.  Pins the per-method contract\n+ data integrity for the persistence layer the iter-50 cross-session\nfact recall depends on.\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.33 s)\n- create_session + get_session round-trip (user_id / session_id).\n- log_exchange returns a UUID4 string.\n- get_session_exchanges returns rows in timestamp order.\n- end_session updates message_count + sets end_time + emits a\n  diary entry (or None when summariser declines).\n- get_user_sessions returns the full set of sessions for a user.\n- get_session for unknown id returns None.\n- set_user_fact + get_user_facts round-trip (iter-50 contract).\n- forget_user_facts clears every slot for the user.\n\nOutcome.  The diary persistence layer''s end-to-end behaviour is now\nCI-pinned.\n\nTotal iter-52..84 test count: 325 / 325 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f773d59de7d792778e6cfe193994c0b0fcb9ac59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/f773d59de7d792778e6cfe193994c0b0fcb9ac59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDQ0NmQ0NjQ1OTQ1MGVmNzE4ODM0MWJjNmY5Zjc4OTRkMDBkMjdhZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33","sha":"6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33"}],"sha":"446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/446d46459450ef7188341bc6f9f7894d00d27ade"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:01:30Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:01:30Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 83: TopicSensitivityDetector per-category coverage tests\n\nThe sensitivity router gates which arm a turn flows to (high-score\nturns prefer the on-device SLM for privacy).  These 16 tests pin\nthe per-category scoring so a regex regression doesn''t silently let\nsensitive content slip through to cloud routing.\n\nTESTS (16 / 16 green in 0.27 s)\n\nDETECTION (must score above category threshold)\n- confidential_info (≥ 0.85): \"confidential\", \"NDA agreement\"\n- abuse_safety (≥ 0.90, iter-51 inflection fix):\n    \"sexually assaulted\" / \"sexually abused\" / \"raped\" / \"molested\"\n    / \"domestic violence shelter\"\n- medical_records (≥ 0.85): \"symptom of cancer\", \"MRI scan results\"\n\nNO-FALSE-POSITIVE\n- Benign turns (greeting / weather / timer / photosynthesis) score\n  at min_score.\n- Empty / whitespace-only input safe-defaults.\n\nROBUSTNESS\n- Multi-category text doesn''t push score above 1.0.\n- 5 000-char input doesn''t crash.\n- detect_detailed() returns matched_categories that include the\n  expected category name for assault content.\n\nTotal iter-52..83 test count: 317 / 317 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ce57fed05f2f2bb0804c02af32f0d4295add214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/7ce57fed05f2f2bb0804c02af32f0d4295add214"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDZjZGEwMmY3Yzk2MmYyYTRjZDYyYTU3NzBiYWNkZDczNjRjYjNlMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd","sha":"988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd"}],"sha":"6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/6cda02f7c962f2a4cd62a5770bacdd7364cb3e33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:00:19Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:00:19Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 82: PrivacyBudget.snapshot() WS-shape regression tests\n\nThe WebSocket layer ships output.privacy_budget on every turn so the\ndashboard''s Privacy tab can render the call/byte budget remaining.\nThese 6 tests pin the snapshot''s exact 11-key shape contract.\n\nTESTS (6 / 6 green in 0.29 s)\n- to_dict() includes the full key set (cloud_calls_total/max,\n  bytes_transmitted_total/max, budget_remaining_calls/bytes,\n  consent_enabled, pii_redactions_total, bytes_redacted_total,\n  sensitive_categories, last_call_ts).\n- All values are JSON-safe types (int/float/bool/str/dict/list/None).\n- After one call, remaining counts are correctly decremented (1 of\n  10 calls used, 18 of 10 000 bytes used).\n- No-consent + no-calls snapshot has consent_enabled=False and zero\n  totals.\n- pii_redactions_total accurately reflects the recorded call.\n- Round-trips through json.dumps cleanly.\n\nTotal iter-52..82 test count: 301 / 301 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a12328309334d30e96f7add54771dc81ef80be7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/7a12328309334d30e96f7add54771dc81ef80be7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDk4OGJhZjg0ZmVjMTlkYzY1YmUxNDYyYTg4OTcyOWMxMWY3MGI1Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45","sha":"274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45"}],"sha":"988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/988baf84fec19dc65be1462a889729c11f70b5cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:58:03Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:58:03Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 81: aggregate iter-66..80 sweep + Makefile + roadmap refresh\n\nDocuments iter 66 through iter 80 in the roadmap with one-line\nfocus + commit hash for each, and extends the Makefile test-iter\ntarget to include the new test files (diary, intent-types, routing,\nKG canonical, encryption envelope).\n\nVERIFICATION\n- Aggregate iter-52..80 sweep: 295 / 295 tests green in 5.49 s.\n- 30 commits stacked since iter 51 (52→81 inclusive).\n\nOUTCOME\nThe roadmap doc now records the full 30-iter trajectory; the\ntest-iter target gives reviewers a single-command path to verify\nthe entire stacked work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"863421b0e328d3cc56ddba60b9663776ef3de7b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/863421b0e328d3cc56ddba60b9663776ef3de7b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDI3NGJkMDczNGYzZDA5ZGU4MDdlNjU3N2Y0YmE2OWY2ZTRmOTVmNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203","sha":"24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203"}],"sha":"274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/274bd0734f3d09de807e6577f4ba69f6e4f95f45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:56:26Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:56:26Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 80: ModelEncryptor Fernet round-trip + key-rotation tests\n\nThe diary-store + user_facts table use ModelEncryptor for at-rest\nencryption.  These 9 tests pin its contract.\n\nTESTS (9 / 9 green in 0.29 s)\n- Bytes round-trip: encrypt(decrypt(x)) == x for short, empty, and\n  100 KB plaintexts.\n- Invalid input type (str instead of bytes) raises TypeError.\n- Embedding round-trip: encrypt_embedding/decrypt_embedding preserve\n  a 64-D float tensor to within 1e-5.\n- JSON round-trip: encrypt_json/decrypt_json preserve nested dicts.\n- Key isolation: ciphertext from key A cannot be decrypted by key B\n  (the encryption guarantee).\n- Invalid Fernet key string raises ValueError at initialize().\n- No-key path falls back to an ephemeral key + still round-trips\n  within-process (data lost across restarts but no crash).\n\nOutcome.  The at-rest encryption contract is now CI-pinned; a\nrefactor that breaks key rotation, accepts invalid keys silently,\nor loses the bytes round-trip fails fast.\n\nTotal iter-52..80 test count: 295 / 295 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b3b74b85663d634e4203ca5da09eb9db1000f5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/7b3b74b85663d634e4203ca5da09eb9db1000f5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDI0Yzg5MmUwZGFhYWFhMjU4MWYwOGQ4NzcyNmNiMzAzZDVhNmMyMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5","sha":"865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5"}],"sha":"24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/24c892e0daaaaa2581f08d87726cb303d5a6c203"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:54:37Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:54:37Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 79: KnowledgeGraph subject canonicalisation tests\n\nThe KG''s _canonical() helper handles case-insensitive lookup, leading-\narticle stripping (the / a / an), trailing-punctuation stripping,\nand a curated alias map.  These 15 tests pin the contract so a\nrefactor that breaks \"Python.\" → \"python\" silently breaks every chat-\ntab answer.\n\nTESTS (15 / 15 green in 0.27 s)\n- get_facts() normalises across 7 case / punctuation / whitespace\n  variants of \"python\" (python, Python, PYTHON, ''  python  '', ''the\n  python'', ''Python.'', ''python!'').\n- get_facts() handles \"huawei\" / \"Huawei\" / \"HUAWEI\" / \"the huawei\".\n- get_facts() returns [] for unknown subjects, \"\" / \"   \" inputs.\n- _display_name uses _DISPLAY_OVERRIDES so \"python\" renders as \"Python\"\n  (verified through overview() output).\n- \"huawei\" renders with its proper \"Huawei\" override.\n\nOutcome.  Subject normalisation is now CI-pinned across the chat\ntab''s 30+ overview-supporting subjects.\n\nTotal iter-52..79 test count: 286 / 286 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f333bbe5d7fb3ad340d98f555ceeef764fb63c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/8f333bbe5d7fb3ad340d98f555ceeef764fb63c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKDg2NWQyY2VkMDM2Zjc4ZTEyMDY1OGU0MjEwNTY4NjY0N2RhMTVlZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c","sha":"c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c"}],"sha":"865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/865d2ced036f78e120658e42105686647da15ee5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:53:18Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T01:53:18Z","email":"tamer.atesyakar@bk.ru","name":"Tamer"},"message":"iter 78: routing_decision dict + WS state_update frame shape tests\n\nThe Routing tab + the per-bubble Decision Trace expander both\nconsume PipelineOutput.routing_decision.  These 8 tests pin its\ndocumented schema and synthesize the full state_update frame to\nverify it round-trips through json.dumps cleanly.\n\nTESTS (8 / 8 green in 0.30 s)\n- routing_decision top-level keys present (arm, confidence, reason,\n  feature_vector, complexity, consent_required).\n- arm value is in the known set (edge_slm / cloud_llm / local_slm /\n  retrieval / tool / tool:* sub-paths).\n- confidence in [0, 1].\n- feature_vector is a list of numerics.\n- complexity block has score + factors (dict).\n- consent_required is bool.\n- Synthesised state_update frame round-trips through json.dumps and\n  preserves routing_decision.arm / personal_facts / safety_caveat.\n- routing_confidence dict sums to ≤ 1.0 (per-arm probabilities).\n\nPlus: Makefile test-iter target updated to include the new diary +\nintent-types + routing-schema test files.\n\nTotal iter-52..78 test count: 271 / 271 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58b9a908dd4f5525a04d5deb41b0b0abb5b6f114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/trees/58b9a908dd4f5525a04d5deb41b0b0abb5b6f114"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/git/commits/c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166416725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81","id":166416725,"login":"abailey81","node_id":"U_kgDOCetRVQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abailey81","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c","node_id":"C_kwDOSAO1f9oAKGMxMzM0ZTE2OTkzNjU2NjUwNGExNzk5Y2VkYmFmMTI5MTFjYzVjOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commit/e549a2a2457f022e90a86a0d3f7a957722196403","sha":"e549a2a2457f022e90a86a0d3f7a957722196403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/e549a2a2457f022e90a86a0d3f7a957722196403"}],"sha":"c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits/c1334e169936566504a1799cedbaf12911cc5c8c"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/abailey81/implicit-interaction-intelligence/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=a47320d14a5da08a9369f60b749d4b28c9b4932b&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A57.877Z"}');
